<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Mataayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsaangu Yimbwe yi Mataayi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mataayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mty</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsaangu Yimbwe yi</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mataayi</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsaangu Yimbwe yi Mataayi bali mu uyabisa yo huli Bayudaayo bamukristo. Bo baayaba bubwe mabuuku ma Nzuhisini yi Kulu. Mataayi li mu umweese Yisu we nde wuli mu ukwasa Mabasonehe mu mabuuku mo maana. Nde li mu ubaayambila mu mo taangu yoosi. Ŋa Mataayi ali mu usonehe muhanda a nde, Bayudaayo bamukristo baamibinga bo mutso manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo. Bo baapalisi mabundu ma muubaayaka babaavele Bayudaayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mataayi ubaaleele ti, Yisu li <char style="em">Mulongisi</char> wu li mu uleele na lituma loosi, mambu ma Nzambi ali mu utuma banga imiinu mu usa. Mulongisi mo wunuunu, li mu uva tsimi yi nyatihi yi utsikaha mikele mya lahi yi kulu. Yisu li kaka <char style="em">Masiya</char> wu Bayudaayo bali mu ubaakeele. Mu uyambila mu ipfumu hi mayulu, nde li mu uleele bunuubu: Nzambi li Pfumu, na matwala ma nde mali mu ubaamonehele ŋa toto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsaangu Yimbwe yi Mataayi yili mu uduka mulahi a nzili wu mihanda mimitatu myatsomi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hutso a mulahi a nzila mo wuuna, Mataayi li mu uyabisa mambu ma Yisu <char style="em">mu mandongisili mataanu ma manene</char>: ndongisili a mabuli <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5-7">5–7</ref></char>, yi bali mu uteele ndongisili ŋa yulu isyelo, yili mu mweese mbiili a bayihi ba Yisu. Mbiili yi yili mu utala kaka itwadi hya baatu ŋa hati la bo, na itwadi hya baatu na Nzambi. Ndongisili a buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10">10</ref></char> yili mu uva matumili na mandoongi huli ba bali mu uyayabisa Tsaangu Yimbwe. Ndongisili a buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13">13</ref></char> yili mu umweese makuma ma Yisu ali mu usalila, mana baatu batsikaha mi mili mu uvyoho ŋa Nzambi ali Pfumu. Ndongisili a buli la <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18">18</ref></char> yili mu ubindula buni baana ba ngu ba babahala baafwana uba itwadi na baana ba ngu ba bakaasu mutso libundu la bamukristo. Ndongisili a mabuli ma <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24-25">24–25</ref></char> yili mu uleele buni bayihi buutwala ukeele mbiingili a tsyelele ya Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tswamina mandongisili mo maniima, na hu mbisa a mo, hu li na mambu ma mali mu umweese buni Yisu ali mu ubeeloso babeedu, ali mu va byudya huli makonge ma baatu. Mandongisili ma mali mu umweese matsimi, bileedi na bakuutu ba Bayudaayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hu mbadiili muhanda, Mataayi li mu uyambila mu mbutili na bukenyi bwa Yisu (mabuli <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1-2">1–2</ref></char>). Hu tsukusu muhanda, Yisu pfumu Bayudaayo buuduba na ukomene nde a kuruwa (buli li <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 27">27</ref></char>). Ka Nzambi miisuula nde mu lipfu. Yisu miimonehele huli bayihi ba nde. Nde li mu utumasa bo mu uyayabisa Tsaangu Yimbwe huli baatu ba toto yoosi, buli li (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 28">28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tswamina mbutili a Yisu, bali mu uteele nde <char style="em">Imanweli</char>, mbindulili ni ti <char style="em">«Nzambi na bisu»</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:23">1.23</ref></char>). Muhanda Mataayi li mu usuka mu lahi la Yisu liniili: «Na me ndi na benu bilumbu byosi natee tsukusu a tsi». Yisu ni imweesi hya Nzambi ŋa hati la baatu.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ibandu hya Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3.23-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Wunuuwu ni muhanda manduhi ma bakaaha ba Yisu Kristo, mwana a Davidi, mwana a Abrahami.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abrahami abuti Isaki; Yakobi aba mwana a Isaki; Yuda na baana ba taata a nde aba baana ba Yakobi. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda abuti Farese na Zera ngu a bo aba nduhi Tamare. Farese abuti Hesromi; Hesromi abuti Arami. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Arami abuti Aminadabi; Aminadabi abuti Nasoni; Nasoni abuti Salama. <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salama abuti Booze, Rahabi aba ngu a nde. Booze abuti Obedi, Luti aba ngu a nde; Obedi abuti Yese. <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Na Yese abuti mutumi Davidi; Davidi abuti Salomooni, ngu a nde ni mukadi a Uri. <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Salomooni abuti Robowami; Robowami abuti Abiya; Abiya abuti Asafi. <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asafi abuti Yosafati; Yosafati abuti Yoraami; Yoraami abuti Ozyasi. <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Ozyasi abuti Yotami; Yotami abuti Akazi; Akazi abuti Ezekyasi. <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Ezekyasi abuti Manase; Manase abuti Amoni; Amoni abuti Yosyasi. <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosyasi abuti Yekonya na baana ba ngu a nde; mu taangu yi bisu Babylooni baakwamisi Isereli mu uyatsahala hu tsi a Babylooni<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">2Pf 24.10-16</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Hu mbisa a palili a bisu Isereli hu Babylooni, Yekonya abuti Salatyeli; Salatyeli abuti Zorobabeli. <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Zorobabeli abuti Abyudi; Abyudi abuti Elyakimi; Elyakimi abuti Azori. <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Azori abuti Sadoki; Sadoki abuti Akimi; Akimi abuti Elyudi. <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Elyudi abuti Elyazari; Elyazari abuti Matani; Matani abuti Yakobi. <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Yakobi abuti Yosefi, mulumi a Mariya. Ni mu Mariya Yisu wu bubateele Kristo hapali. <verse eid="MAT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Mu umata Abrahami natee Davidi, hu li matuungi kuumi mana. Umata Davidi natee palili a bisu Isereli hu Babylooni, kuumi matuungi mana. Kuumi matuungi mana maavyohi umata palili a bisu Isereli hu Babylooni natee mbutili a Kristo.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbutili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2.1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Mono buni mbutili a Yisu Kristo yaaba. Mariya ngu a nde aba mutangula a Yosefi. Ka tswamina bo bapfuuta nzo, Mariya abahi yimi mu matwala ma Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Yosefi, mutangula a nde aba muutu nga tsiki, na a hatoondi upalisa musamu mbadi ve. Nde abahi tsimi mu utsala itwadi hya bo mu tswehi. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Bu nde hakatsima buuna, pofi a Pfumu ayamonehele na nde mu ndoosi, na aleeli: «Yosefi, mwana a Davidi, abata boomo mu uvolo Mariya mukadi a we ve, mu tooni ati, mu Livupu la Ngidi nde amiibaha yimi. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Nde sa abuta mwana wa bahala, na we sa luha nde nduhi Yisu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yisu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili ya mu Ingereke ti Yosuwa, «Pfumu ubaava liyobolo».</char></note>, ni nde ufuuhasa baatu ba nde mu masumu ma bo.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Mambu mo maana moosi maatswiihi, mana ma Pfumu hayabisi mu munywa mumbihuli, mayelemene:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Nuumba wu aveleyaaba babahala sa abaha yimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">nde sa abuta mwana wa bahala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">na sa baluha nde nduhi Emanweli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Esa 7.14</ref></char></note>».</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 1:23">Mbindulili ni ti: «Nzambi li na bisu.»<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Bu Yosefi hasuuhi, nde avaangi moosi ma pofi a Pfumu hatumi nde. Nde avoli Mariya na asiidi nde mu nzo a nde. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Ka Yosefi a hapfuuti taangi na nde ve, natee bu Mariya habuuti mwana wa bahala, wu Yosefi haluhi nduhi Yisu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Banga buyedi bamiiyakongemene Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Hu mbisa a mbutili a Yisu hu musyenge a Betelemi hu tsi a Yude, mu taangu a mutumi Eloode, banga buyedi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">banga buyedi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikuma mo hiina hili mu ubindula ba bali kaka batsikihi ba bamvwelele.</char></note> baamati hu Esete, baayidi hu Yeruselemi. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Na baafuuli: «Mwana wu bamiibuta huni ali, Mutumi Bayudaayo? Ka bisu limiimono mvwelele a nde hu Esete, na bisu limiiya mu ukongemene nde.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Bu mutumi Eloode hayuhi musamu mo wuuna, mutima aheliini nde, bumosi kaka mu baatu ba musyenge a Yeruselemi boosi. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Nde akuukihi bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi boosi na milongisi mi Mikele, na nde afuuli bo: «Huni baafwana ubuta Masiya?» <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Bo baafutili nde: «Hu Betelemi a Yude. Mu tooni ati, mu buuku li mumbihuli baasonehe buunubu:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />“We Betelemi, tsi a Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">we a hali musyenge wu afulala bukeehe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">ŋa hati li misyenge mya Yuda ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">mu tooni ati, mu we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">sa hupala mutumi wu utuma ibaandu hya me, Isereli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mik 5.1</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Na Eloode ateeli baatu banga buyedi mu tswehi, afuuli bo bubwe-bubwe: «Mu ki taangu mvwelele haamonihili?» <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Titswene, nde atsindihi bo hu Betelemi na uleele: «Yenaani, yatsikahaani bubwe-bubwe mu tooni a mwana. Bu benu luusoolo nde, benu liyaayabisa me, mana me kaka nzakongemene nde.» <verse eid="MAT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Bu baamani uyuha mambu ma mutumi, bo baayeni. Mvwelele wu bo baamoni hu Esete atswamini bo hu busu, natee bu haatsikimi ŋa mbuha yi yaaba mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Bu baatalili mvwelele ŋaana, bo baasangili hu ulaahi: <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Bo baakoti mu nzo, na baamoni mwana na ngu a nde Mariya. Bo baatsokimi mu ukongemene mwana. Bo baapalisi biloho bya talu, baabitili nde bungodu bwa wolo, bwa paha a tsulu yimbwe, na miire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">miire </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malimbu ma tsulu yimbwe. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ka bu baayibusi bo mu ndoosi, mu uvelefutaha huli Eloode, bo baafutihi hu tsi a bo mu nzila kima.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefi na Mariya bamiibata na mwana hu tsi a Ngipiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ŋa banga buyedi baayeni, pofi a Pfumu ayamonehele na Yosefi mu ndoosi na aleeli: «Teleme, volo mwana na ngu a nde, bata hu tsi a Ngipiti. We sa ba huuna, natee bu me undeele we mu uyafutaha, mu tooni ati, Eloode sa asaha mwana mu utuma uduba nde.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Yosefi atelimi hutso butsuhu, avoli mwana na ngu a nde, ayasweme hu tsi a Ngipiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Yosefi atsahili huuna natee bu Eloode haakwidi, mana mambu ma Pfumu haayabisi mu libuuku li mumbihuli matswiha: «Me ateeli mwana a me mu upala mu Ngipiti<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Ose 11.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eloode miituma uduba bikenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Bu Eloode haamoni ti banga buyedi a baayafutaha huli nde ve, nde abahi kesi yi mifudi. Na nde atumi uduba baana ba babahala boosi, hu Betelemi na itaanzi hya nde hyoosi, ba baavelekuhasa bilima byole. Nde hakesi bilima byole, mana biyelemene na taangu yi banga buyedi baayabisi nde. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Ni buuna, mambu ma mumbihuli Yelemiya haayabisi mayelimini:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«Baatu baayuhi bileele hu musyenge a Lama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">ni bililu na minyongo mi milahi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Ni Laakeli li mu ulila baana ba nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">na nde a hali mu usiinga mbombisili ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">mu tooni ati bo bamiikwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Yel 31.15</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosefi na Mariya bamiibita mwana hu Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Luk 2.39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Hu mbisa lipfu la Eloode, pofi a Pfumu ayamonehele na Yosefi mu ndoosi hu Ngipiti. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Na aleeli nde: «Teleme, volo mwana na ngu a nde, na futaha hu tsi a Isereli. Mu tooni ati, ba bakasaha utuma uduba mwana, bamiikwa.» <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Yosefi atelimi, avoli mwana na ngu a nde, afutihi hu tsi a Isereli. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Ka bu nde haayuhi ti Alakelawosi akiisini taata a nde Eloode ŋa ipfumu hu tsi a Yude, Yosefi amoni boomo bu uyene huuna. Baayibusi nde mu ndoosi, na nde ayasweme hu itaanzi hya Ngalili. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Huuna, nde ayatsahala hu musyenge wa nduhi Nazareti, mana mambu ma mimbihuli matswiha: «Sa bateele nde: musi Nazareti.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili a Yowani mutondihi mu kumu a nzala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:2-8">Mlk 1.2-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yow 1.19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Yowani mutondihi abaandihi ulongese mu kumu a nzala a Yude<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kumu a nzala a Yude </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itaanzi hi hyavele na baatu ba banzuhisini, hi hili ŋa hati la Yeruselemi Heboroni na Yolodani ya hu baanda.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />Nde akabaaleele: «Sobwaani mbiili, mu tooni ati Ipfumu hi mayulu hyaaka bebele!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Yowani ni nde wuuna wu mumbihuli Esaya haayabisi, ŋa nde haaleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«Yiniiyi ni ndaha a muutu wu li mu uta ibila mu kumu a nzala:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">“Vangimasaani nzila a Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">suungahaani misoho mya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esa 40.3</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Yowani aba alwata ikutu hi baatuunga mu myoso mya buuru nga irunga. Na mu luungu la nde, aba ahada mudi wu mukobo ibulu. Nde akabaadya makooko na maadi ma nyuhi a tsyehe. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Bisu Yeruselemi, bisu Yude yoosi na bisu itaanzi hyoosi hi hyabaambana na nzali a Yolodani, baakayabwana Yowani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Bo baakasiinga masumu ma bo ŋa kuungi la baatu. Na Yowani akatondehe bo mu Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Ka bu Yowani hamoni Bafarisi na Basaduki ba balahi mu uyaayaka tondihili huli nde, nde aleeli bo: «Benu ibaandu hi bapili! Na alongese benu mu ubata kesi a Nzambi yi yili mu uya? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Mwesaani mu mavaanga ti benu limiisobo mbiili. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Na a lilelesene mu mitima mya benu ve ti: “Bisu lili na taata a bisu Abrahami!” Ka me ndeele benu ti, Nzambi utwala ukitusa mamanya mo maniima baana ba Abrahami! <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Pa pibi baamiivangimasa mu ukwanga miti mu manganzi. Ni mu buuna, pasi muti wu uvelebuta mbutu yimbwe, sa bakwanga nde na ubwaha nde hu mbaahu. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Me ndi mu utondehe benu mu mamba, mana benu lisobo mbiili. Ka nde wuuna wu li mu uya ŋa mbisa a me, sa atondehe benu mu Livupu la Ngidi na mu mbaahu. Nde afulala me matwala, na me a handi wu akuha mu umaasa bikoodi bya nde ve. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Nde li na iyengese hya nde ŋa hoho, mu ukahula mbutu na biimbu. Nde ukuukaha mbutu hutso iswehili hya nde, ka nde utsuha biimbu hu mbaahu yi yaaveledima.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tondihili a Yisu Kristo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mlk 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Yisu amati hu itaanzi hya Ngalili, ayidi hu nzali a Yolodani huli Yowani, mana Yowani atondehe nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Ka Yowani a hatoondi ve na aleeli: «Me ni wu li na nzala ati we tondehe me, ka we ni wu ubweya huli me!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Ka Yisu afutili nde: «Siinga, nyaha buba buuna mu taangu mo yiniiyi. Ka hufwani ti, bisu a we likuhasa moosi ma Nzambi hatuma.» Na Yowani asiingili nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Bu baamani utondehe Yisu, nde apali mu mamba. Mu taangu mo yiina, mayulu maadibumi, nde amoni Livupu la Nzambi laayakulamana mu ifwafwani hi libembe ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Na ndaha mosi yaamati hu mayulu, yaaleeli: «Wunuuwu ni Mwana a me wu litondo, wu ubaakuhasa kinya a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mkg 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Esa 42.1</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiilobese</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mlk 1.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Titswene, Livupu la Nzambi laabiti Yisu hu kumu a nzala, mana mukuyi alobese nde. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Hu mbisa udya ikaandi mu maku mana ma bilumbu bya nyangu na maku mana ma bilumbu bi butsuhu, Yisu amoni nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Mukuyi, mulobisi, ayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde, na aleeli: «Tso we li Mwana a Nzambi, tuma mamanya mo maniima makituha mapa.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Ka Yisu afutili: «Baasonehe: “Muutu a huubaha moonyi ndulu mu mapa ve, ka mu mambu moosi ma mu baapala mu munywa a Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Pfu 8.3</ref> </char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Mukuyi abiti Yisu hu Yeruselemi, musyenge a ngidi, asuusi nde ŋa yulu mubundu a nzo a Nzambi, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />na aleeli: «Tso we li Mwana a Nzambi, dumaha na bwa, mu tooni ati baasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">“Nzambi utuma bapofi ba nde mu usyele we.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">Bo buuyaka we mu myoho mya bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">mana hulu hwa we a hukubaana manya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Mkg 91.11</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yisu afutili nde: «Baasonehe kaka mu libuuku la Nzambi ti: “A lobese Pfumu Nzambi a we ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Pfu 6.16</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Mukuyi abwebita nde ŋa yulu isyelo hi mutaabu, amweesi nde bipfumu bya tsi byosi na muyusu a byo, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />na aleeli nde: «Me tsa pa we biniibi byosi, tso we kongimini ŋa busu bwa me mu ukuunda me.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yisu afutili nde: «Saatana, matila me! Mu tooni ati baasonehe: “We afwana ukuunda na usalila ndulu Pfumu Nzambi a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Pfu 6.13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:20">10.20</ref> </char></note>.”» <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Titswene, mukuyi ni usiisa nde. Na bapofi baayidi mu ukumbasa nde.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibaandiha isalu hya nde hu Ngalili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mlk 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Bu Yisu haayuhi ti bamiikotese Yowani mu kondaayi, nde ayeni hu Ngalili. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Nde amati hu Nazareti, ni uyatsahala hu Kapernahumi, musyenge wa mu muvanga a dyanga la Ngalili hu itaanzi hya Zabuloni na Nafetali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zabuloni na Nafetali </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bibandu byole bi bikulu bya hu Noode a tsi Isereli.</char></note>, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />mana mambu ma mumbihuli Esaya haabihuli mayelemene:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />«Tsi a Zabuloni na tsi a Nafetali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">benu ba lili bebele na mubu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">hu simu lina la Yolodani,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">Ngalili, itaanzi hya ba baavele Bayudaayo!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />Baatu ba bali hutso a piipidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">sa bamono liyalala li linene!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Mu ba bali mu utsahala mu tsi a posi yi lipfu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">liyalala sa liyalusa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:23-9:1">Esa 8.23–9.1</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Umata taangu mo yiina, Yisu abaandihi uyabisa na ubaaleele: «Sobwaani mbiili, mu tooni ati Ipfumu hi mayulu hyaaka bebele!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiteele bayihi bana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mlk 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Yisu akataangila simu la dyanga la Ngalili. Nde amoni baana ba ngu boole, Simoni nga kuumbu Peetelo na Andele, mwana a ngu a nde. Bo baaba mu ubwaha lihi mu dyanga, mu tooni ati, bo aba balobi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Yaduukalaani me, me tsa kitusa benu balobi ba baatu.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Masulubete, bo batiimbi malihi ma bo, na baaduukili nde. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Bu Yisu haasusihi mwana a lala, nde amoni baana ba ngu boole bakima, Yaki na Yowani, baana ba Zebedayi. Bo aba mu uloondo malihi ma bo mutso a luungu na taata a bo Zebedayi. Na Yisu ateeli bo. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Masulubete, bo baasiisi na luungu, napa taata a bo, titswene bo baaduukili nde.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese na ubeeloso baatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yisu akataangila tsi a Ngalili yoosi, nde akalongese mu manzo ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo. Nde akayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe wu Ipfumu hi mayulu, na nde akabeeloso mabeedu moosi ma baatu na bipiha bya bo byosi. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Lidumu la Yisu laatsamuhi mu itaanzi hya Siriya hyoosi, na baatu baakabehele nde ba baaba na mabeedu na makenene ma pila mu pila. Banga matengo, banga mapuha, bikata, nde akabeeloso bo. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Makonge ma manene ma baatu maaduukili nde. Bo baakamata hu Ngalili, hu itaanzi hya Dekapoli, hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, hu tsi a Yude, na hu simu lina la Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese ŋa yulu isyelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 5-7">5–7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Bu Yisu hamoni makonge ma baatu, nde avaati ŋa yulu isyelo, na atsahili. Bayihi ba nde baayidi ŋa pedu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Na nde abandihi uva bo ndongisili mo yiniiyi:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kinya ya mbuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6.20-23</ref></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Kinya yili huli biyaha mu livupu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">ka Ipfumu hi mayulu hili hya bo!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Kinya yili huli ba bali mu ulila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">mu tooni ati, sa babombesele bo!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Kinya yili huli ba bali na kulimini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">mu tooni ati, bo sa bayaka mukobe a toto.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Kinya yili huli ba bubaakwa nzala na peyu a butsiitsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">mu tooni ati, bo sa baywata!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Kinya yili huli banga a kwili lingebe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">mu tooni ati, sa bakwila bo lingebe!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Kinya yili huli ba batsyeme mu mitima,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">mu tooni ati, bo sa bamono Nzambi!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Kinya yili huli ba bubaamweese hyenze ŋa hati la bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">mu tooni ati, sa bateele bo baana ba Nzambi!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Kinya yili huli ba bali mu utsuta mu tooni butsiitsa bwa bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">mu tooni ati, Ipfumu hi mayulu hili hya bo!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Kinya yili huli benu ŋa baatu bali mu utuha benu, bali mu utsuta benu na uta bimbangi bi mapfuta mu benu mu tooni a me. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Baani mu muyali na sangilaani hwa benu hu hulahi mu tooni ati, musyendo a benu li wu munene hu mayulu. Mu mbuli, ni buuna baatsuti mimbihuli mi myatswamini benu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Benu lili mungwa na liyalala la tsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mlk 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14.34-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yisu abweleele: «Benu lili mungwa a toto. Ka tso mungwa diimbisi livu la nde, na ki isiha benu luufutala nde livu mo liina? Nde tsalu ka ve, isaali ndulu ka mu ubwaha nde hu mbadi mana baatu badyata nde.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Benu lili liyalala la tsi. Musyenge wu baatunga ŋa yulu isyelo utwala uswemene ve. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Na a bubaabangisa mwinda mu usuusa nde hutso ipaanyi ve, ka bubaasuusa nde ŋa isuusili hya nde hi hyasyenoho, mana nde ayalusa byosi bi bili mutso a nzo. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Ni mu buuna, liyalala la benu laafwana ubaamwedeme ŋa busu bwa baatu boosi, mana bo bamono mavaanga ma benu ma mabwe na bayuusa Taata a benu wu li hu mayulu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yisu li mu ulongese mu Mikele mya Moose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Yisu abweleele: «A litsima ve ti me miinza mu uyaamaasa Mikele mya Moose, na ndongisili yi mimbihuli. Me miinza a mu uyaamaasa ve, ka mu uyatswihasa myo. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, a yulu na toto bivyohi ve, isono tso imosi hi ikeehe, buuve iloho hi hyafulala, utwala umata mu Mikele ve, natee bu mambu moosi muutswiha. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ni mu buuna, woosi wu uvelekiinza tso mukele mumosi wu afulala bukeehe mu Mikele mo minimi, na li mu ulongese baatu mu usa bumosi, sa bateele nde wu afulala bukeehe mu Ipfumu hi mayulu. Ka woosi wu ukiinza Mikele na ulongese baatu mu ubaakeelese myo, nde wuuna sa bateele mukuutu mu Ipfumu hi mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, tso benu a lifulili milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi mu ukiinza Mikele ve, benu a luutwala ukoto mu Ipfumu hi mayulu ve.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mukele mu tooni inoongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Yisu abweleele: «Benu laayuhi baleeli huli bakaaha ba bisu ti: “A duba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Pal 20.13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Pfu 5.17</ref> </char></note> ve; pasi muutu wu uduba ahwama na tsundusu ŋa busu bu banzonzi.” <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Ka me, me ndi mu undeele benu, muutu wu ukwila mwana a ngu a nde kesi, sa batsundasa nde ŋa busu bu banzonzi. Muutu wu utuha mwana a ngu a nde: “itsatsambi!” afwana mu uyaka tsundusu ŋa busu bu bakuutu ba Bayudaayo. Muutu wu utuha mwana a ngu a nde: “itsuudu!” bafwana ubwaha nde hu mbeenge a mbaahu. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Ni mu buuna, tso we behi bungodu ŋa diiku li bungodu, na tso we yibuhili moonyi ti mwana a ngu a we li na tooni na we, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />maasiisa bungodu bwa we ŋa busu bwa diiku li bungodu, maayanoongo na mwana a ngu a we. Titswene, yaava bungodu bwa we.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Tso we li mu uyene huli banzonzi nzila moosi na muutu wu miikese we, sa mawasa mu noongo na nde bu benu likini mu nzila, mana muboho a we a hayeholo we huli nzonzi, na nzonzi a hava we huli masadaadu, na mo mabwaha we mu kondaayi. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Mu mbuli, me ndi mu undeele we: We a huupala huuna hwavele umaafuta mukanu a we woosi ve.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mukele mu tooni mayamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Yisu abweleele: «Benu laayuha, baleele ti: “A sa mayamba ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Pal 20.14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Pfu 5.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Ka me ndeeli benu ti pasi nde wuuna wu li mu utala mukaasu na linyungi, amiikwasa mayamba na nde mu mutima a nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ni mu buuna, tso diisu la we la mbahala libaabwisa we mu masumu, lobolo lo na buma lo lala na we. Hwafulala bubwe huli we mu ubungasana inama imosi hi linyutu la we, na mu uvelesa ti nyutu a we yoosi babwaha yo hu mbungulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Tso kaka la we la mbahala libaabwisa we mu masumu, kese lo na buma lo lala na we. Hwafulala bubwe huli we mu ubungasana inama imosi hi linyutu la we, ka a mu uyene hu mbungulu wu akuha ve<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kese lo na buma lo lala na we</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mambu mo maniima a matondi uleele ve ti, ulobolo diisu na ukese kaka la nde mu mbuli a mbuli. Ka mo matondi uleele ti, laafwana ubisa masumu mu mifudi myosi. Mu umonehele we muutu wu miilobolo diisu na ukese kaka la nde, bi bibwisi nde mu masumu.</char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mukele mu tooni a ndubili makwele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mlk 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />Yisu abweleele: «Baaleeli kaka ti: “Woosi wu ubinga mukadi a nde afwana uva nde muhanda a ndubili makwele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Pfu 24.1</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Ka me ndi mu undeele benu ti: Loosi bahala li luubinga mukadi a nde, tso a mu tooni bumbembo ve, nde li mu uvahula nde hu mayamba. Na bahala li luukwele mukaasu wu baabinga, miisa mayamba.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mukele mu tooni milabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />Yisu abweleele: «Benu laayuhi kaka baleeli huli bakaaha ba bisu a benu ti: “A sa mulabu wu mapfuta ve, ka we afwana utswihasa mulabu wu we asa ŋa busu bwa Pfumu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lev 19.12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:3">Mat 30.3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:22-24">Pfu 23.22-24</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Ka me, me ndeeli benu mu ubaavelelaba tso hoole: A lilaba tso mu yulu ve, mu tooni ati, lo ni kiti-ipfumu hya Nzambi, <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />tso mu toto ve, mu tooni ati, yo ni isuusili hya miilu mya Nzambi. A laba tso mu Yeruselemi ve, mu tooni ati, Yeruselemi ni musyenge a Mutumi wu munene. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />A laba kaka tso mu mutswe ve, mu tooni ati, we utwala ufuukasa buuve upiindasa linanga la we tso limosi ve. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Tso hu li eye leelaani “eye” tso hu li naana, leelaani “naana”. Mambu makima ma bubaabwese ŋa yulu, mu baamata huli Nga Bubi.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mukele mu tooni a pindu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Yisu abweleele: «Benu laayuhi baleeli: “Tso muutu tubi diisu li muna a nde, baafwana utuba kaka la nde. Tso muutu kuuli diinyu li muna a nde, baafwana ukuula kaka la nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Pal 21.24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lev 24.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Pfu 19.21</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Ka me, me ndi mu undeele benu: mu ubaavelefutala piinga mu piinga. Tso muutu teti we lipali mu tama la mbahala, bwetehele nde kaka tama lina. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Tso muutu toondi ubita we ŋa busu bu banzonzi mu uvolo ikutu hya we hi butulu, nyaha nde avolo napa iyunga hya we. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Tso muutu tsukimisi we mu usa iveeve (1 000) hi mataka, sa biveeve byole (2 000) na nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Kabila huli wu li mu uvondo we isiha, na a miinguha nde wuuna wu toondi uyaasombo huli we ve.<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Tondwaani baboho ba benu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:27">Luk 6.27</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Benu laayuhi baleeli ti: “We afwana utondo muna a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note> na ubelele muboho a we.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Ka me, me ndi mu undeele benu: baatondwaani baboho ba benu, baasambilaani mu ba bali mu utsuta benu. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Ni buuna, benu luuba baana ba Taata a benu wu li hu mayulu. Nde ubaapalisa nyangu ŋa yulu a banga bukanyi, na ŋa yulu a baatu ba babwe. Nde ubaanohese mvula ŋa yulu baatu ba butsiitsa na ŋa yulu a baatu ba baavele butsiitsa. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Eye, tso benu libaatondo ndulu ba bubaatondo benu, buuna ki musyendo benu luutwala ubaha? Batsonzihi ba limandu kaka bali mu usa bumosi! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Na tso benu libaabila ndulu baana ba ngu a benu, ki dyambu la kimuhili benu libaavaanga? Bangoyi kaka bali mu usa bumosi! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Baani ba baasupaha we bu Taata a benu hu mayulu ali wu asupaha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:13">Pfu 18.13</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s2">Mukele mu tooni bungodu bubaasa huli biyaha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Yisu abweleele: «Kebaani mu ubaasalila butsiitsa bwa benu ŋa busu bwa baatu mu tooni umonehele. Tso ni buuna, benu a luubaha kaluha ŋa busu bwa Taata a benu wu li hu mayulu ve. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa we li mu uva bungodu huli iyaha, a bula mabyoho ve, we bu hubaasa banga muwala mutso manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo na mu masandi, mana baatu bayuusa bo. Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, bo baamiikwabaha musyendo a bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Ka ŋa kaka la we la mbahala lili mu uva isiha huli iyaha, nyaha kaka la we la kaasu liveleyaaba hi kaka la we la mbahala lili mu usa. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Bungodu mo buuna bwafwana uba tswehi. Na Taata a we wu ubaamono mambu ma we ubaasa mu tswehi, sa asyende we.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Buni laafwana ubaasambila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11.2-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Yisu abweleele: «Ŋa benu libaasambila, a laaduukala mbiili a baatu banga muwala ve. Bo ubaatondo usambila mu tele mutso manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo na mu mivaanga mi manzila ma manene, mu tooni umonehele ŋa busu bwa baatu. Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, bo baamiikwabaha musyendo a bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Ka we, ŋa we ubaasambila, koto mu itini hya nzo a we, dibuha munywa a nzo, na sambila Taata a we wu li huuna, ŋa mbuha mo yiina ya tswehi. Na Taata a we wu ubaamono mambu ma we ubaasa mu tswehi, sa asyende we.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />Ŋa benu libaasambila, a laabaapfunasa mikuma mi myavele a tsalu we bangoyi. Bo ubaatsima ti, mu tooni mikuma bulahi, Nzambi sa ayuhala bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />A lisa we bo ve, mu tooni ati, Taata a benu ayaba bi benu lili na byo nzala, tswamina benu mu uvondo nde. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Buuna, benu lafwana usambila bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Taata a bisu wu li hu mayulu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Nyaha nduhi a we bakiinza.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Nyaha ipfumu hya we hibaaya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">Nyaha litondo la we liba ŋa toto we hu yulu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Byudya bya bisu bya kele tsuhu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:11">va bisu byo lolo yiniiyi.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Nyahula mikanu mya bisu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">we bu bisu kaka libaanyahula banga mikanu mya bisu.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />A nyaha bisu libwa mu malobese ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">ka yobolo bisu mu myoho mya Nga Bubi.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Ni hya we Ipfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">na matwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">na muyusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">mu bilima na bilima. Amen.]<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />Mu mbuli, tso benu linyahuli masumu ma baatu, Taata a benu wu li hu mayulu sa anyahula kaka ma benu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Ka tso benu a linyahuli ma bo ve, Taata a benu wu li hu mayulu a hunyahula kaka masumu ma benu ve.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Buni laafwana mu udya ikaandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Yisu abweleele: «Ŋa benu libaadya ikaandi, a liba na biinzi bya banga lingebe we banga muwala ve. Bo bubaasanza biinzi bya bo, mana baatu boosi bayaaba ti bo ikaandi bali mu udya. Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu: Bo baamiikwabaha musyendo a bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Ka we, ŋa we ubaadya ikaandi, puupala mutswe a we nyafi, na swaha mbalanga a we, <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />mu uvelemweese huli baatu ti, we ikaandi li mu udya. Ndulu Taata a we wu li ŋaana mu tswehi uyaaba. Na Taata a we wu ubaamono mambu ma we ubaasa mu tswehi, sa asyende we.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Busina bwa mbuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12.33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Yisu abweleele: «A likuukaha busina ŋa toto ve, hu misobi na malali bibaatsala, na hu biibi bibaatsala makumba mu uyiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Ka kuukahaani busina hu yulu, hu hwavele na misobi, tso malali mu utsala, tso biibi mu utsala makumba na uyiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Mu tooni ati, mbuha yi yili busina bwa we, ni mbuha mo yiina kaka mutima a we ali.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Liyalala la nyutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Yisu abweleele: «Diisu ni mwinda a nyutu. Tso diisu la we lili polo, nyutu a we yoosi sa yiba hutso liyalala. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Ka tso diisu la we laabeele, nyutu a we yoosi sa yiba hutso a piipidi. Tso liyalala li lili mu we lili piipidi, ki pila a piipidi yinene yiuba!»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Usalila Nzambi vooti mbongo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16.13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Yisu abweleele: «Muutu utwala usalila bapfumu boole ve. Tso a buuna ve, nde sa abelele mumosi na utondo wuna, buuve nde sa akatita na mumosi na upenye wuna. Benu utwala usalila Nzambi na mbongo ve.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Usa hiitu mu Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12.22-31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />Yisu abweleele: «Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu undeele benu: A liba na minyongo mu tooni a byudya na byunywa bi benu lili na byo nzala mu idiingu hya benu ve. A liba na minyongo mu tooni bikutu bi benu lili na byo nzala mu nyutu a benu ve. Idiingu hyalutahala byudya talu, na nyutu bele a bikutu ve. <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Monwaani banyunyi baa hu yulu, bo a bubaakuna ve, a bubaakuukaha ve, a bubaaswehe pasi isiha mutso binzunihi ve. Na Taata a benu wu li hu yulu ubaabuungala bo. Ka benu laalutahala bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Na ŋa hati la benu, mu minyongo mya nde, utwala ubwese bilumbu tso hoole mu idiingu hya nde?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />Na mu hima benu libaaba na minyongo mu tooni bikutu? Monwaani buni bifulu bi matsyehe bibaakula. Byo a bibaasala ve, byo a bibaatiŋa bikutu bya byo ve. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Ka me ndeele benu lo, tso Soolomo, mutso busina bwa nde bwosi, a habahi bikutu bi byafulala bubwe we imosi mu bifulu mo biniibi ve. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Ni buuna, tso Nzambi ubaalwatisa biimbu bi matsyehe bi bili loloyi, na bi bubwaha ngwali hutso a mbaahu, tandisini a benu, nde a huulwatisa benu mwakulu ve? Ki pila bukeehe bu imiinu hya benu mu nde!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />A liba na minyongo mi ubaaleele ti: “Hima bisu luudya? Hima bisu luunywa? Buuve hima bisu luulwata?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Biina byosi, ni bangoyi bubaasaha byo pasi taangu. Ka Taata a benu wu li hu yulu, yaabi ti benu na nzala a byo. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Tswaminaani usaha tsomi Ipfumu hya Nzambi, saani litondo la nde, na titswene Nzambi sa ava benu bisiha mo biina byosi. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Ni mu buuna, a liba na minyongo mu ilumbu hya ngwali ve. Mu tooni ati, ngwali ka ngwali a yo mwakulu. Pasi ilumbu na mapasi ma hyo.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s2">A litsundasa muutu ve</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6.37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Yisu abweleele: «A litsundasa muutu ve, mana Nzambi uveletsundasa benu. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Mu tooni ati, bu benu libaatsundasa bana, ni buuna kaka Nzambi hutsundasa benu. Hyetso hi benu lili mu usalila, sa basalila hyo kaka mu benu. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Mu hima we ubaatala isyesyele hya hiimbu hi hili mu diisu la mwana a ngu a we, hwavele utsikaha kuunzi li lili mutso a diisu la we? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Buuve, buni we utwala uleele huli mwana a ngu a we: “Nyaha me maasa hiimbu hya mu diisu la we”, bu we mwakulu li na kuunzi mu diisu la we? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />We, muutu nga muwala, teehele umaasa kuunzi li lili mu diisu la we, na hu mbisa, we sa mono bubwe mu umaasa hiimbu hi hili mu diisu la mwana a ngu a we. <verse eid="MAT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />A liva bisiha bya ngidi huli bamvwa ve, mana bo a bakinguhala na ukaha benu. A libwahila bangulu bisiha bya benu bya talu ve, mana bo a badyata byo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Woosi wu ubaavondo, ubaayaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11.9-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Yisu abweleele: «Vondwaani, na benu sa liyaka. Sahaani na benu sa lisoolo. Doodwaani, na sa badibula benu munywa a nzo. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Eye, pasi muutu wu ubaavondo, ubaayaka. Pasi muutu wu ubaasaha, ubaasoolo. Na bubaadibula munywa a nzo huli wu ubaadoodo. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Hu li na muutu ŋa hati la benu, wu uva manya huli mwana a nde tso mwana vondi nde lipa? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Buuve, na uva mwana a nde taadi, tso nde vondi nde tswi? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Tso benu ba lili baatu ba babi, liyaabi uva baana ba benu bisiha bi bibwe, tandisini a Taata a benu wu li hu mayulu sa ava bisiha bi bibwe huli ba buuvondo nde byo!<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />Mambu moosi ma benu libaatondo ti babaasiila benu, benu kaka baasiilaani mo huli baatu bakima, mu tooni ati, mo mali mambu ma mu baalongese Mikele mya Moose na libuuku li Mimbihuli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:8-10">Lom 13.8-10</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Munywa a nzo wu aswekeme</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13.24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Yisu abweleele: «Kotwaani mu munywa a nzo wu aswekeme! Mu tooni ati, munywa a nzo wu ataanyuha, na nzila yi yaavele a pasi yibaabita baatu hu ubungana. Na baatu ba balahi bubaavyohele muuna. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Ka nzila yi yibaavyohele mu munywa a nzo wu aswekeme, yili ya pasi. Yo yibaabita baatu hu moonyi. Baatu ndulu hoole bali mu usoolo yo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mimbihuli mi mapfuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6.43-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Yisu abweleele: «Kebaani mu mimbihuli mi mapfuta. Bo bubaavolo ifwaani hi mameme mu uya huli benu, ka hu hati a bo, bo bali miinzi mi bukanyi. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Benu sa liyaaba bo mu ndyatili a bo. A bubaakoolo mbutu a vinye mu miti mi matsyende ve, tso mbutu mufiinge mu ifuundi ve. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Muti wu mubwe ubaabuta mbutu yimbwe. Ka muti wu mubi ubaabuta mbutu yimbi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Muti wu mubwe utwala ubuta mbutu yimbi ve. Ni bumosi kaka, muti wu mubi utwala ubuta mbutu yimbwe ve. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Pasi muti wu uvelebuta mbutu yimbwe, sa bakwanga nde na ubwaha nde hutso a mbaahu. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Buuna, benu sa liyaaba mimbihuli mi mapfuta mu mavaanga ma myo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Uleele na usa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13.25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />Yisu abweleele: «A baatu boosi ba bubaateele me “Pfumu, Pfumu” buukoto hu Ipfumu hi mayulu ve. Ka ndulu bo baana ba bubaasa litondo la Taata a me wu li hu mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, baatu ba balahi sa baleele: “Pfumu, Pfumu, bisu laabihuli mu nduhi a we. Bisu laabingi matengo mu nduhi a we. Bisu laasiidi bipadi mu nduhi a we”. <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Na me tsanzabisa bo: “Bisu a benu huni laaba, matilaani me, benu ba libaavaanga ma mabi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:9">Mkg 6.9</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Manzo mamoole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6.47-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Yisu abweleele: «Ni mu buuna, woosi wu uyuha mambu ma me ndi mu undeele na usalila mo, nde li we muutu nga bungeele, wu atunga nzo a nde ŋa yulu a manya. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mvula anohi, banzali baaluuli, ifula hyanyingisi nzo, ka yo a yaabwidi ve, mu tooni ati ibeene hya yo hyaba ŋa yulu a manya. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Ka muutu wu ubaayuha mambu ma me na uvelesalila mo, nde afwanina na muutu wu itsuudu, wu atunga nzo a nde ŋa yulu musyeŋunyu. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mvula anohi, banzali baaluuli, ifula hyanyingisi nzo. Nzo yaabwidi, na yo yaatsamuhi yoosi.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yisu li mu ulongese na matwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Bu Yisu hamani uleele mambu mo maana, baatu boosi baakimuhi mu ndongisili a nde. <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />Mu tooni ati, nde akalongese na matwala, ka a we milongisi mi Mikele ve.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso nga a bwatsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mlk 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Bu Yisu hakulimini hu tsina isyelo, makonge ma baatu ma manene maaduukili nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Muutu mumosi nga bwatsi ayasusaha, akongimini ŋa busu bwa Yisu, na aleeli: «Pfumu, tso we tondi, we utwala utsyemese me!» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yisu alabi kaka, abembi nde na aleeli: «Me tondi buuna, nyaha we tsyeme.» Mu mawasa, bahala mo laatsyemi mu bwatsi bwa nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Titswene, Yisu ni uleele: «Kele, a yabisa mambu mo maniima huli pasi muutu ve! Ka yene yamonehele huli ngaanga a Nzambi, na we va bungodu bu Moose hatumi, mu umweese ti we miibeeloho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:2-32">Lev 14.2-32</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso musalili a mukuutu a kama li masadaadu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Yow 4.43-54</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Bu Yisu haakakoto hu musyenge a Kapernahumi, mukuutu a kama li masadaadu, ayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde, alembisini nde na aleeli: <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />«Pfumu, musalili a me wu abwamina ali hu nzo, linyutu laamiivolo nde, na nde li mu umono pasi yindahi.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Me unzambeeloso nde.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Mukuutu a kama li masadaadu afutili: «Pfumu, me a handi wu akuha ti we koto mu nzo a me ve. Ka leele ndulu dyambu limosi, na musalili a me sa abeeloho! <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Mu tooni ati, me ndi me mwakulu hutso lituma li bakuutu na me ndi na masadaadu hutso lituma la me. Tso me ndeeli huli mumosi: “yene!” nde uyene. Tso me ndeeli huli mukima: “yaanga”, nde uya. Na tso me ndeeli huli musalili a me: “sa bunuubu”, nde usa buuna.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Bu Yisu haamani uyuha mambu mo maana, nde akimuhi, na nde aleeli huli ba baakaduukala nde: «Mumbuli me ndi mu undeele benu: Me kini a hamoni imiinu hya pila yiniiyi, huli muutu tso mumosi mu Isereli ve. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Me ndi mu undeele benu lo, baatu ba balahi sa bamata hu Esete na hu Wesete, na sa batsahala ŋa metse na Abrahami, na Isaki na Yakobi hu Ipfumu hi mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Ka sa babwaha ba baakiikoto hu Ipfumu hutso a piipidi ya hu mbadi, hu bo buuba mu ulila na ubaakwete miinyu.»<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Titswene, Yisu aleeli huli mukuutu a kama li masadaadu: «Futaha hu nzo a we, mambu ma we miivondo, sa mavangama we bu hu li imiinu hya we!» Na mu taangu yiina, musalili a nde abeeluhi.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso buko bwa Peetelo bu mukaasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Titswene, Yisu ayeni hu nzo a Peetelo, nde abiisi buko bwa Peetelo bu mukaasu alambama ŋa taangi: nde aba na bahu. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yisu abeembi kaka la nde, na bahu laafwidi. Nde atelimi na akabili bo byudya.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Bu tsitsaha yaatoodi, baabehili Yisu babeedu ba balahi ba matengo maakakwamisa. Mu leele limosi, Yisu apalisi mavupu ma mabi, na nde abeelusi babeedu boosi, <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />mana dyambu li mumbihuli Esaya haleeli, litswiha: «Nde avoli bipiha bya bisu, na abiti mabeedu ma bisu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Esa 53.4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uduukala Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9.57-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yisu amono koonge a baatu yaadiinga nde, nde atumi bayihi ba nde mu uyene na nde hu simu lina la dyanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Mulongisi Mikele mumosi ayasusaha na aleeli nde: «Mulongisi, me tsa nduukala we pasi tsyelo yi we uyene!» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yisu ni ufutala nde: «Mibahu na biswemili bya myo, na banyunyi bubaaba na byanza bya bo. Ka Mwana a muutu a hali na mbuha yi uvumasa mutswe a nde ve.»<verse eid="MAT 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mukima mu bayihi ba nde aleeli nde: «Pfumu, va me muswa me maanzandiiha taata a me.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Yisu afutili nde: «Duukala me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:43">Yow 1.43</ref></char></note>, nyaha babaakwa badiiha babaakwa ba bo.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miivumasa ifula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mlk 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Yisu akoti mu bootehe, bayihi ba nde baaduukili nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Masulubete, ifula hi mifudi hyatelimi mu dyanga, na mapo maakabwa hutso a bootehe, na bwo bwabaandihi uluula mamba. Ka Yisu aba tolo. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Bayihi baayasusaha ŋa pedu a Yisu na baasuuli nde na ubaafulaha: «Pfumu, fuuhasa bisu! Bisu laaka mu ukwa!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yesu ni ufutala bo: «Mu hima benu lili na boomo, benu baatu ba imiinu hi ikeehe?» Na nde ni uteleme, ni ufwengele ifula na mamba ma dyanga. Na bisiha byosi ni usa na swii. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Boosi baaba mu kimuhili yinene, na baakaleele: «Wu ki pila a muutu wa tso ifula na mapo ni ubaasiingala nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:8">Mkg 65.8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:10">89.10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:23-32">107.23-32</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso baatu boole banga matengo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mlk 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Bu Yisu hatoodi hu simu lina la dyanga, hu tsi a bisu Gadare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gadare </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aba musyenge bangoyi wu aba bebele na biveve kuumi bi mataka, hu baanda a Esete ya dyanga la Ngenezareti buuve la Ngalili.</char></note>, babahala boole ba baaba na matengo, baapali hutso mangila na baayabwana Yisu. Bo baaba na tsisu, na muutu tso mumosi a haakamese uvyoho tsyelo mo yiina ve. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bo baakafulaha: «Mwana a Nzambi, we ki lo na bisu? We yidi huni mu unyongese bisu hwavele taangu umaato?»<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Ka ŋa pedu a ŋaana, hwaba na koonge yinene yi bangulu yi yaaba mu udya. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Matengo maakayayahana Yisu na ubaaleele: «Tso we tondi ubinga bisu, tsindaha bisu hutso a koonge bangulu mo yiniiyi.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yisu ni uleele bo: «Yenaani.» Buuna matengo maapali mu baatu mo baana, na maayakoto mu bangulu. Masulubete, koonge bangulu yoosi yaahidumini umata hu yulu isyelo natee hutso a dyanga, na yanyambihini hutso a mamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Ba baakakeelese bangulu baabati. Bo baayeni hu musyenge na uyayabisa musamu woosi, na mambu ma maavyohi mu baatu baboole banga matengo. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Ni buuna, baatu boosi ba hu musyenge baayabwana Yisu. Bo bamono nde, bo baayayiini nde mu apala mu tsi a bo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso ikata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mlk 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yisu akoti mutso a bootehe, abwesabuha dyanga, na afutihi hu musyenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 2:1">Mlk 2.1</ref></char>, Ŋaaniŋa ni Kapernahumi li mu umonehele we musyenge a Yisu. Utala kaka mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mty 4.13</ref></char>.</char></note> a nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Baabehili nde ikata hi hyaba hyalambama ŋa mubabangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mubabangu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ibitili hi mubeedu buuve hya mvumbi.</char></note>. Yisu amono imiinu hya bo, ni uleele huli ikata: «Hwada, mwana a me, masumu ma we bamiinyahula!» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ni buuna, milongisi mi Mikele mikima myalelisini: «Muutu mo wunuuwu miisafula Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yisu ayaabi matsimi ma bo, na nde aleeli: «Mu hima benu lili na matsimi mo ma mabi maniima? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Hima hyafulala ulenge mu uleele: “Masumu ma we bamiinyahula”, buuve mu uleele: “teleme na takula”? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Ka me tondi ti benu liyaaba liniili: Mwana a Muutu li na matwala mu unyahula masumu ŋa toto.» Buuna, nde aleeli huli ikata: «Teleme, volo mubabangu a we na futaha hu nzo a we!»<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Muutu mo atelimi na ayeni hu nzo a nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Bu makonge ma baatu maamoni buuna, mo maaluuli mu boomo na maayusi Nzambi bu haaviidi matwala ma bunuubu huli baatu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiteele Mataayi na miidya na ba baasumaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:13-22">Mlk 2.13-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Bu Yisu hamati ŋaana, nde amoni bahala limosi nduhi Mataayi, laatsahala mu nzo isalu yi bakaambi ba limandu. Yisu aleeli nde: «Duukala me!» Mataayi atelimi na aduukili nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Hu mbisa, bu Yisu haaba ŋa metse mu udya hu nzo Mataayi, bakaambi ba limandu ba balahi na baatu ba baasumaha, baayatsahala ŋa metse na Yisu na bayihi ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Bafarisi bamono buuna, ni uleele bayihi ba Yisu: «Mu hima Mulongisi a benu ali mu udya na bakaambi ba limandu na baatu ba baasumaha?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Bu Yisu haayuhi ma bo baaleeli, nde akaali: «Babeedu ni basahi bangaanga, a batsiitsa ve. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Yenaani yayihaani mbindulili a mambu mo maniima: “Me ndi mu utondo kwili lingebe, ka a piili bungodu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Ose 6.6</ref></char></note> ve.” Mu tooni ati, Me a hanzandanda batsiitsa ve, ka me anzandanda ba baasumaha.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ŋa busu bwa ndiili ikaandi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mlk 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Titswene bayihi ba Yowani mutondihi baayasusaha huli Yisu na uleele nde: «Mu hima bisu na Bafarisi libaadya ikaandi taangu yoosi, ka bayihi ba we a bubaadya hyo ve?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yisu ni ufutala bo: «Benu litsimi ti baatu ba baalanda hu mukungi a kwele, utwala uba mu lingebe bu mulumi akini ŋa hati la bo? Ka mu bilumbu bya hu busu taangu yili, yi buumasa bo mulumi, na buuna bo sa badya ikaandi.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />A hu li na muutu wu ubaalondo ikutu hi ikulu mu ireende hya tsanda yi nyatihi ve. Kini, ireende hi inyatihi hyubwekasula tsanda yikulu. Buuna, vulu luubwefulala bunene. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />A bubaasyeholo malamu ma tsohele mutso mirumbu mi mikulu ve, kini malamu ma tsohele muubula mirumbu. Buuna, na malamu, na mirumbu, byosi byunyambahana. Ka baafwana usyeholo malamu ma tsohele mutso mirumbu mi minyatihi, mu tooni uswehe mo bubwe.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso mukaasu na miisuula nuumba mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mlk 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Bu Yisu haakaleele bo mambu mo maana, mukuutu Bayudaayo mumosi ayidi, ayakongemene ŋa busu bwa Yisu, na ayayiini: «Mwana a me wu mukaasu miimana muvumu. Yaanga yaasuusala nde kaka la we, mana nde aba moonyi!»<verse eid="MAT 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yisu atelimi, na aduukili nde na bayihi ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Mukaasu mumosi wu makila maakapuuha umata bilima kuumi na byole, ayaasusaha hu mbisa a Yisu na abeembi tsoso ikutu hya nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Mu tooni ati, nde akatsima hutso mutima a nde: «Tso me mbeembi ndulu ikutu hya nde, me tsa mbeeloho.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yisu akinguha, na amono nde, nde ni uleele: «Hwada mwana a me wu mukaasu, imiinu hya we hi miiyobolo we.» Masulubete, mukaasu abeeluhi. <verse eid="MAT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Bu Yisu hayato hu nzo a mukuutu Bayudaayo, nde amoni basihi ba mavetso baaba baamiivangama mu ndiihili, na koonge a baatu ba baaba mu muyunga. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Nde aleeli bo: «Palaani, mu tooni ati nuumba mukaasu a haakwa ve, nde tolo ali.» Ka baatu baakakwede nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Bu Yisu hakoti mutso a nzo, nde abingi koonge a baatu yi yaaba muuna. Nde akaangi nuumba mu kaka, na nuumba atelimi. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Tsangu yaatsamuhi mu itaanzi mo hiina hyoosi.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso binzimana byole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Bu Yisu hamati ŋaana, binzimana byole byakaduukala nde na ubaafulaha: «Kwila bisu lingebe, Mwana a Davidi!»<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Bu Yisu hayato ŋa nzo, binzimana byayasusaha huli nde. Na Yisu afuuli byo: «Benu lili na imiinu ti me utwala uvanga buuna?» Byo byafutili nde: «Eye, Pfumu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Buuna Yisu abeembi miisu mya byo na aleeli: «Nyaha buba we bu hu li imiinu hya benu!» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Na miisu mya byo myadibumi. Yisu akebisi byo bunuubu: «Kelaani, muutu tso mumosi a hayaaba mambu mo maniima.» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Ka byo byayatsala tsangu a Yesu mu itaanzi mo hiina hyoosi.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso iduka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Bu bo baatelimi mu uyene, baatu baabehili Yisu muutu mumosi wu aba iduka, mu tooni ati, nde aba na livupu la tengo. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Bu Yisu habingi tengo, iduka hyatoyi. Baatu baakimuhi na baakaleele: «Bisu kini a laamoni dyambu la pila yiniiyi mu Isereli ve!» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Ka Bafarisi baakaleele: «Ni mukuutu matengo li mu uva nde matwala ma ubinga matengo mo maniima!»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miimonele baatu lingebe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yisu akataangila misyenge myosi na mala. Nde akalongese mu manzo ma bo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo. Nde akayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe wu Ipfumu hi mayulu. Nde akabeeloso mabeedu moosi na bipiha byosi.<verse eid="MAT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Nde aluuli mu lingebe, bu nde hamoni makonge ma baatu, ba baaba baamiikolo, na ba hiitu hyaba hyamiifwa, we mameme ma maavele a keedi. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Buuna, nde aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Isalu hi utsonzehe mbutu a mu ngundu hili hiinene, ka basali bali ba bakeehe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maniima mali mu uleele ti, baatu baamiivangama mu usa imiinu mu Yisu. Ka baatu a bali ba banzuhisini mu ubita bo hu Ipfumu ve.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ni mu buuna, vondwaani pfumu isalu hi utsonzehe mbutu, mana nde abwetsindaha basali mu ngundu a nde.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Biluumbi bikuumi na byole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mlk 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yisu ateeli bayihi ba nde kuumi na boole. Nde aviidi bo matwala ma ubinga mavupu ma mabi na ubeeloso mabeedu moosi na bipiha byosi. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Manduhi ma kuumi na biluumbi byole bi Yisu hasooli ni maniima: Watsomi, Simoni wu Yisu haviidi kuumbu Peetelo, na mwana a ngu a nde Andele. Yaki, na Yowani mwana a ngu a nde, bo baboole baana ba Zebedayi. <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipo na Batolomayi, Tomasi na Mataayi mukaambi limandu. Yaki mwana a Alafe na Tadayi. <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simoni Muzeloti, na Yuda Isikaryoti, wu ayehuli Yisu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiva tumili huli bayihi ba nde amiitsindaha hu isalu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-42">10.5-42</ref></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mlk 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Yisu atsindihi bakuumi na boole mo baana hu isalu, na nde aviidi bo matumili mo maniima: «A liyene hu bitaanzi bya ba baavele Bayudaayo ve. Na a likoto mu musyenge tso mumosi wa Samariya ve. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Ka yenaani huli mameme ma maadimbala ma buli la Isereli. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Taani ibila na baaleelaani mu nzila ti “Ipfumu hi mayulu hyaka bebele!” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Beeloswaani babeedu, suulaani baatu ba baakwa mu lipfu, tsyemesaani banga bwatsi, bingaani matengo. Benu limiiyaka mu bungodu, vaani kaka mu bungodu. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />A libita tso wolo ve, tso mbongo ve, tso bakuta mu uvidaha mu mapoose ma benu ve. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Bu benu luuyene mu mudyenge, a libita tso koome ve, tso iyunga ikima ve. A livolo tso bikoodi ve, tso likaanda ve. Mu tooni ati, musali afwana ubaha byudya bya nde. <verse eid="MAT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />Ŋa benu luuto mu pasi musyenge, buuve mu pasi bula, sahaani tso hu li na muutu wu avangama mu uyaka benu. Tsahalaani huli nde, natee bu benu luumata ŋaana. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ŋa benu luukoto mu pasi nzo, vaani mabwehe huli baatu ba bali mu nzo. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Tso baatu banga nzo bayaki benu, nyaha hyenze hya benu hiba ŋa yulu a bo. Ka bo baveleyaka benu, nyaha hyenze hya benu hifutaha huli benu mwakulu. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Ŋa baveliyaka benu, tso uveleyuhala benu, palaani mu nzo mo yiina buuve mu musyenge mo wuuna. Na kubalaani mufuundu a miilu mya benu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ukubala «mufuundu mataambi ma nde», hu li iliimbu hya kabuhili. Buuna, iluumbi a hisaali na mukanu a baatu ba nzo buuve baa musyenge mo wuuna ve. Hyo a hisaali tso na mukanu a mufuundu a musyenge mo wuuna mu mataambi ma nde ve. Utala kaka mu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Mav 13.51</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">18.6</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, tsyembili yi buusyembe musyenge mo wuuna, sa yivyohelele ya Sodoomo na Ngomooro.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mambingisili ma hu busu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mlk 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21.12-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />Yisu abweleele: «Yuhaani! Me ndi mu utsindaha benu we mameme ŋa hati la miinzi. Ni mu buuna, baani na buyedi we bataadi, na baani ba baatsyeme we mabembe. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Baakelaani mu baatu mu tooni ati, bakima sa bayeholo benu mu manzo ma tsundusu, bo sa batete benu bikooti mu manzo ma bo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Bo sa babita benu ŋa busu bu bapfumu na ŋa busu bu batumi, mu tooni a me. Yiina sa yiba nzila yi benu luuta imbangi mu me, ŋa busu bwa bo na ŋa busu bwa ba baavele Bayudaayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ka ŋa buuyeholo benu huli banzonzi, a limono boomo mu mambu ma benu luuleele ve, tso mu bitoyili bya benu. Ka Nzambi sa ava benu mambu ma benu luuleele mu taangu mo yiina. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Mambu ma benu luuleele, a muumata huli benu ve. Ka Livupu la Taata a benu, luukaayambila mu benu. <verse eid="MAT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Mwana a ngu sa ayeholo mwana a ngu a nde mwakulu hu lipfu, na taata sa avaanga bumosi mu mwana a nde. Baana sa batelemene babuti ba bo, na buutuma ubelese bo mu lipfu. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Baatu boosi sa babelele benu mu tooni a nduhi a me. Ka woosi wu ukuunda natee hu tsukusu, nde wuuna sa afuuha. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Ŋa buutsuta benu mu musyenge mumosi, baataani hu musyenge mukima. Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, benu a luumana utaangila misyenge mya Isereli ve, teehele Mwana a muutu mu uyaafutaha. <verse eid="MAT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />Muyihi a haalutahala mulongisi a nde ve. Musalili a haalutahala pfumu a nde ve. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Humiikuha huli muyihi mu uba we mulongisi a nde, na huli musalili mu uba we pfumu a nde. Tso bateeli pfumu a nzo Belesebuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belesebuli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nduhi yi baakasalila mu uleele ti pfumu matengo.</char></note>, sa bafulala utuha baatu ba nzo.»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Wu baatu baafwana ubata boomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />Yisu abweleele: «Ni mu buuna, a libata boomo bwa baatu mo baana ve. Mu tooni ati, mambu moosi ma maaswemene, mu umonehele. Na mambu ma tswehi muuyabahana. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Ma me ndi mu undeele benu hutso a pipidi, leelaani mo ŋa nyangu. Na mambu ma bali mu uleele benu mu mapfuundu, taani mo ibila mu mifudi myosi ŋa kuungi la baatu. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />A libata boomo bwa ba bubaaduba nyutu na uveletwala uduba muvumu. Ka baataani boomo bwa nde wuuna wu utwala ubungasana muvumu na nyutu hutso a mbeenge a mbaahu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:12">Yak 4.12</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Benu liyaabi ti masyehe moole bubaasumbasa mu likuta limosi. Ka tso limosi mu mo, a libaabwa ŋa toto hwavele litondo la Taata a benu ve. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Uto ti benu, napa naanga mitswe mya benu yoosi yili yibaatanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ni mu buuna, a liba na boomo ve, benu lafulala masyehe ma malahi tsoongo.»<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ubinuha mu Yisu buuve Utuna nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />Yisu abweleele: «Ni mu buuna, woosi wu ubinuha mu me ŋa busu bwa baatu, me kaka tsa mbinuha mu nde ŋa busu bwa Taata a me wu li hu mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Ka pasi nde wuuna wu utuna me ŋa busu bwa baatu, me kaka tsa tuna nde ŋa busu bwa Taata a me wu li hu mayulu.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s2">A hyenze ve, ka mudiingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />Yisu abweleele: «A litsima ve ti me anza mu ubehe hyenze ŋa toto. Me a hanza mu ubehe hyenze ve, ka mudingu. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Me anzatsuusa kabuhili ŋa hati la bahala na taata a nde, ŋa hati la mwana wu mukaasu na ngu a nde. Me anzatsuusa kabuhili ŋa hati li mukaasu na buko bwa nde bu mukaasu. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Baboho ba benu sa baba baatu ba ibaandu hya benu mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7.6</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />Woosi wu ubaatondo taata a nde buuve ngu a nde bele a me, a hafwana mu uba muyihi a me ve. Woosi wu ubaatondo mwana a nde wa bahala buuve wu mukaasu bele a me, a haafwana mu uba muyihi a me ve. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Woosi wu uvelevolo kuruwa a nde na uduukala me, a haafwana mu uba muyihi a me ve. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Woosi wu atondo ufuuhasa muvumu a nde, sa anyambasana nde. Ka nde wuuna wu unyambasana muvumu a nde mu tooni a me, sa abwesoolo nde.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Uyaka musyendo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:31">Mlk 9.31</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />Yisu abweleele: «Woosi wu uyaka benu miiyaka me, na wuuna wu uyaka me, miiyaka wu atsindaha me. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Woosi wu uyaka mumbihuli mu biita li bumbihuli, sa ayaka musyendo wu mumbihuli huyaka. Na woosi uyaka muutu wu asungama, sa ayaka musyendo wu muutu wu asungama huyaka. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, pasi muutu wu uva tso mbuungu a mamba ma piyu huli mumosi mu bangebe mo baniiba ŋa hati li bayihi ba me, mu tooni a bu nde ali muyihi a me, nde sa ayaka musyendo a nde.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bayihi ba Yowani mutondihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Bu Yisu haamani uva matumili huli bayihi ba nde bakuumi na boole, nde amati ŋaana mu uyalongese na uyata ibila mutso misyenge mi itaanzi mo hiina. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Yowani mutondihi hutso a kondaayi, ayuhi tsangu mavaanga ma Kristo. Nde atsindihi bayihi ba nde, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />mu uyafuula Yisu: «We ni nde wuuna wu afwana uya, vo ti bisu laafwana ukeele mukima?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yisu afutili bo: «Yenaani yayabisaani Yowani mambu ma benu lili mu uyuha na umono. <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Binzimana bili mu umono, bikata bili mu uteleme na utakula, banga bwatsi bali mu utsyeme, bikwa-matswi bili mu uyuha, babaakwa bali mu usuuha, na bali mu ulongese Musamu wu Mubwe huli biyaha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">Esa 35.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">61.1</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Kinya yili huli muutu wuna wu uvelebwisa imiinu hya nde mu tooni a me.»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Bayihi ba Yowani bu bafutihi, Yisu abaandihi utoyo mu tooni a Yowani huli konge a baatu: «Benu hima limiiyamono hu kumu a nzala? Litsotso li lili mu unyingama mu livupu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:24">Luk 7.24</ref> </char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Ka benu hima limiiyamono? Muutu wu alwata bikutu bibibwe? Naana! Ba bubaalwata bikutu bibibwe, ubaatsahala hutso bibaanga bi batumi. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ka benu na limiiyamono? Mumbihuli? Eye, me ndeele benu, wu afulala pa mumbihuli. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Yowani ni nde wuuna wu Libuuku la Ngidi lili mu uleele: “Mono, me miitsindaha iluumbi hya me hu busu bwa we, mu uvangimasa nzila a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />Mu mbuli me ndeele benu: ŋa hati la baatu boosi kini a laamoni wu akulala Yowani mu tondihi ve. Ka muutu wu afulala bukenyi mu Ipfumu hi mayulu, akulala nde. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Umata taangu yi Yowani hakatondehe natee lolo yiniiyi, baatu bali mu ulwanisa Ipfumu hi mayulu. Na ba baafulala ngolo, bali mu usaha ukala hyo. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Mimbihuli myosi na Mikele mya Moose mibaayabisa Ipfumu natee mu taangu a Yowani. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Na tso benu litondi, yaabaani ti Yowani ni Eliya wu baayabisi nziili a nde. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Woosi nga matswi mu uyuha, nyaha ayuha!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Naana me upfwanisa tuungi mo liniili? Lo laafwanina na baana ba bangebe ba baatsahala ŋa litandala li mikungi, ba bali mu utelesene na bali mu ulelesene: <verse eid="MAT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Bisu laafula benu munzololo, benu a laakina ve! Bisu laayimbala benu nyimbu yi ikwili, benu a laalila ve!” <verse eid="MAT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Buuna, Yowani Mutondihi amiiya, nde a hali mu udya tso unywa ve, na bali mu uleele: “Tengo laamiilwata nde!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana a muutu amiiya, nde li mu udya, nde li mu unywa, na bali mu uleele: “Monwaani bahala mo liniili, nga mubaka udya na ikolo-mbungu. Nde li mbaahi a bakaambi ba limandu na baatu banga masumu!” Ka tsiki a Nzambi yibaamonehele mu mavaanga ma nde.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Misyenge mi mili mu ubisa usa imiinu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10.13-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Buuna, Yesu abaandihi usyembe misyenge mi nde hafulili usa bipadi. Mu tooni ati, baatu ba misyenge mo miina a baasobi mbiili ve. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />«Ki pila lingebe huli we musi Korazini! Ki pila lingebe huli we Betesayida! Mu tooni ati, tso bipadi byosi bi baasiidi ŋa hati la benu, baayasa byo huli bisu Tiilo na bisu Sidoni, kini umata beleve, baatu ba misyenge mo miina baamiikoto mu lingebe, baamiiyobo mufutu mu mitswe na usobo mbiili. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu undeele benu: mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, tsyembili yi benu luuyaka yiuvyohelele ya baatu ba misyenge mya Tiilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Na we Kapernahumi, we li mu utsima ti Nzambi sa asyenolo we natee hu yulu? Naana! A buuna ve. Sa bakulamasa we natee hu tsi a babaakwa. Mu tooni ati, tso bipadi bi baasiidi huli we, baasiidi byo kaka mu musyenge a Sodoomo, kini musyenge mo wuuna kiiba natee lolo yiniiyi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:14-15">Esa 13.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24-28">Mba 19.24-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu undeele benu, mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, tsyembili yi benu luuyaka yiuvyohelele ya baatu ba musyenge a Sodoomo.»<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaani huli me mu ubaha puumili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10.21-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Yisu aleeli: «Taata, Pfumu a yulu na toto, me ndi mu unzuusa we mu tooni ati, we miimweese huli bikenyi mambu ma we aswehi huli bangeele na huli baatu banga buyedi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:17-29">1Ko 1.17-29</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Eye, Taata, mu libweye la we, ni buuna bu we mwakulu atondo.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />Taata a me ava me bisiha byosi. A hu li na muutu wu uyaaba Mwana, tso a ni Taata ve. Na muutu a hayaba Taata, tso a ni Mwana ve, na huli bo baana ba Mwana atondi usaangula lo. <verse eid="MAT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />Yaani huli me, benu boosi ba laamiikolo mu ubita mipfuna mi myaleme. Me tsa pa benu puumili. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Volwaani na bitaani paka a me, na yakaani ndongisili a me, mu tooni ati, me ndi wu mubwe, nga bulembo mu mutima, na benu sa libaha puumili mu mivumu mya benu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Yel 6.16</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Paka a me yili yimbwe, na mupfuna a me li wu aleenge.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu ŋa busu bu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mlk 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-11">Luk 6.1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Yisu akataangila tsyehe a mbutu mu ilumbu hya saba. Bayihi ba nde baamoni nzala; bo baabaandihi ukoolo bisaka bya mbutu, na udya yo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:26">Pfu 23.26</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Bafarisi bamono buuna, baleeli huli Yisu: «Mono, bayihi ba we bali mu uvanga mi baaliha usa mu ilumbu hya saba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:21">Pal 34.21</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Yisu afutili bo: «Benu a laataanga ma Davidi hasiidi bu haba na nzala, nde na baatu ba nde ve? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Nde akoti mu nzo a Nzambi, avoli mapa ma baayeholo huli Nzambi, adiidi mo na aviidi kaka huli baatu ba nde. Mapa mo maana, muutu mukima a habeedi na muswa mu udya mo ve, ka ndulu bangaanga ba Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:2-7">1Sa 21.2-7</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Buuve, benu a laataanga mu Mikele mya Moose ti, mu ilumbu hya saba, bangaanga ba Nzambi ba bubaasala ŋa mbuha ya ngidi mu nzo a Nzambi bubaasumana mikele mya saba ve? Ka liina a laakaba lisumu huli bo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Me ndeele benu, ŋaniiŋa huli na wu afulala nzo a Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Tso benu laayaaba mbinduli a mambu ma baasonehe maniima: “Me umbaatondo kwili lingebe ka a tsuhili bungodu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Ose 6.6</ref></char></note> bu bibulu ve”, kini benu a laakwiha mbele huli baatu ba baavelesa dyambu ve. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Ni mu buuna, Mwana a muutu li Pfumu a saba.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso muutu mu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mlk 3.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Titswene, Yisu amata ŋaana nde ayeni hu nzo a bo yi lisambulu li Bayudaayo. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Muuna mwaba na muutu mumosi nga kaka li laararama. Bafarisi baafuuli Yisu: «Hu li na muswa mu ubeeloso muutu mu ilumbu hya saba?» Bo baafuuli buuna mu ukete Yisu, mana bo babaha tooni yi ukese nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Yisu afutili bo: «Tso mumosi ŋa hati la benu li na limeme ndulu limosi, na lo limiibwa mu iyuna hya dohesele mu ilumbu hya saba, nde a hupalisa lo ve? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Yaabaani ti muutu alutahala limeme biita! Buuna, baava muswa mu uvanga libwe mu ilumbu hya saba.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli huli muutu: «Laba kaka la we.» Nde alabi lo, na lo laafutihili polo we lina. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Bafarisi baayeni, na baakuti pfuundu yi usaha manzila ma utuma uduba Yisu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ni musalili wu Nzambi hasooli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Bu Yisu hayaabi mambu mo maana, nde amati ŋaana. Baatu ba balahi baadukili nde. Nde abeelusi babeedu boosi. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Ka Yisu akebisi bo mu mifudi mu uvelepalisa lo mbadi. <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Mo mavangimi buuna, mana mambu ma mumbihuli Esaya hayabisi, mayelemene:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«Monwaani musalili a me wu me atsoolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">ni nde me umbaatondo, na me ndi na kinya yindahi mu nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Me utsuusa Livupu la me mu nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">na nde uyabisa butsiitsa bwa me mu matsi moosi.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />Nde a huusa tuumu na muutu ve, na a huubaba ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">na pasi muutu a huuyuha ndaha a nde mu manzila ve.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />Nde a huutabula litsootso li baamiikwaboholo ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">na nde a hudimasa mwinda wu liyalala laaka hoole ve,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">natee bu nde hubiingasa butsiitsa.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />Na baatu ba matsi moosi sa basa hiitu mu nduhi a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Esa 42.1-4</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibingasa mavupu ma mabi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Mlk 3.20-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-27">Luk 11.14-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Titswene, baatu baabehili Yisu muutu mumosi wu aba inzimana na iduka mu tooni ati, nde aba na livupu la tengo. Yisu abeelusi muutu mo wuuna, na nde abaandihi uyambila na umono. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Baatu baakimuhi na baakaleele: «Be wunuwu me ni mwana a Davidi?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Bu Bafarisi baayuhi buuna, bo baakaleele: «Muutu mo wunuuwu ali mu ubinga matengo, ndulu mu tooni a bu nde ali na Belesebuli, pfumu a bo wu li mu uva nde matwala!» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Ka bu Yisu haba ayaaba matsimi ma bo, nde aleeli bo: «Tso ipfumu hya tsi hikabuhi na tso baatu ba ipfumu mo hiina bali mu ulwana bomo na bomo, ipfumu mo hiina sa hitsaamuha. Na tso baatu ba musyenge buuve ba nzo mosi, bali mu ukaakana bomo na bomo, musyenge buuve nzo mo yiina utwala ukwilala ve. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Tso Saatana li mu ubinga nde mwakulu Saatana, na tso nde li wu akabuha nde mwakulu, buni ipfumu hya nde hyutwala ukwilala? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Tso mu mbuli me umbambinga matengo mu matwala ma Belesebuli, ka na ubaava batsyengi ba benu matwala mu ubinga mo? Ni mu buuna, batsyengi ba benu sa baba bo mwakulu baatsundisi ba benu. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Ka uba ti ni mu Livupu la Nzambi me ndi mu umbinga matengo, buuna Ipfumu hya Nzambi hyamiiyaato natee huli benu.<verse eid="MAT 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Muutu tso mumosi utwala ukoto mu nzo a nga pinyu na utaana bya nde ve, hwavele umaahada nde mikudu. Ka hu mbisa uhada nde mikudu, buuna nde utwala utaana bya mu nzo a nde byosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:27">Mlk 3.27</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Woosi wu avele itwadi na me, nde li muboho a me. Woosi wu uvelepfuutana na me mu ukuukaha, nde li mu utsala. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu undeele benu: Nzambi unyahula masumu moosi, naapa bituhi bi bali mu utuha nde. Ka pasi muutu wu utuha Livupu la Ngidi, a huuyaka nyahulili lisumu mo liina ve. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Na pasi muutu wu utoyo bubi mu Mwana a Muutu, sa ayaka linyahula li masumu. Ka nde wuuna wu uyambila bubi mu Livupu la Ngidi, a huuyaka nyahulili lisumu mo liina ve. Tso mu taangu mo yiniiyi, tso mu matangu ma muuya.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muti na mbutu a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />Yisu abweleele: «Tso muti li wu mubwe, mbutu a nde kaka yili yimbwe. Ka tso muti li wu mubi, mbutu a nde kaka yili yimbi. Pasi muti ubaayabahana mu mbutu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Benu ibaandu hi bapili! Benu ba lili baatu ba babi, buni benu luutwala ubaaleele misamu mi mibwe? Munywa a muutu ubaapalisa ma maaluula mu mutima a nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Muutu wu mubwe ubaapalisa ma mabwe ma mali hutso iswehili hi ibwe hi hili mu nde. Muutu wu mubi ubaapalisa ma mabi ma mali hutso iswehili hi ibi hi hili mu nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Me ndeele benu lo: Mu ilumbu hya tsundusu a Nzambi, pasi muutu sa ava ikuumbu mu mambu moosi ma maavele a tsalu ma nde hapalisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Mu tooni ati, ni mu mambu ma we ubaapalisa mu munywa a we, Nzambi huubiingasa we, buuve huubelese we.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pondili iliimbu hya kimuhili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-4">Mlk 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11.29-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Buuna, mwana a kabu li milongisi mi Mikele na li Bafarisi, baaleeli huli Yisu: «Mulongisi, bisu litondi umono iliimbu hya kimuhili.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Yisu afutili bo: «Baatu ba tungi mo liniili, bali baatu ba babi na ba baavelekangama mu Nzambi, bo bali mu usaha iliimbu. Ka a buusiila bo iliimbu ikima ve ŋa yulu a hi mumbihuli Yonasi. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Eye, we bu Yonasi havyosi bilumbu bitatu bya nyangu na bi butsuhu hutso a moonyi a tswi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 2:1">Yon 2.1</ref></char></note> wu munene, ni buuna kaka, Mwana a Muutu huvyoso bilumbu bitatu bya nyangu na bi butsuhu hutso a toto. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, baatu ba Niniive sa bateleme ŋa busu bwa baatu ba tungi mo liniili, na sa bakese bo. Mu tooni ati, bisu Niniive baasobi mbiili a bo, bu baayuhi ibila hya Yonasi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:5">Yon 3.5</ref></char></note>. Ka ŋaniiŋa, hu li na wuuna wu alutahala Yonasi! <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Mu ilumbu hya tsundusu, mutumi wu mukaasu wa hu Sude, sa ateleme ŋa busu bwa baatu ba tungi mo liniili, na sa abelese bo. Nde husa buuna, mu tooni ati nde amati hu matsi ma maafulala lala ŋa toto. Nde ayidi mu uyayuha mambu ma maaluula mu buyedi bwa Soolomo. Ka ŋaniiŋa hu li na nde wuuna wu alutahala Soolomo.»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfutihili livupu li libi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11.24-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />Yisu abweleele: «Ŋa livupu lilibi limiipala mu muutu, lo libaayene yayuhu mu mambuha ma kumu a nzala, mu usaha ivumili. Bu lo livelibaha ivumili, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />lo ka ubaaleele: “Me upfutaha hu nzo yi me amati mu yo.” Ŋa lo lufutaha hu nzo mo yiina, lo sa libiisa nzo yi bunyanga, yi baakombolo, yi baavanga bubwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Buuna, lo sa liyene mu uyavolo mavupu tsambu makima ma maalutahala lo bukanyi. Mo moosi sa maayakoto na lo mu nzo, na utsahala mutso a yo. Hu tsukusu, muutu mo wuuna sa akoto mu pasi yi yafulala yatsomi. Ni buuna, sa huba bumosi kaka huli banga mavaanga ma mabi ba lolo yiniiyi.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngu na baana ba ngu a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mlk 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:11-13">Heb 2.11-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Bu Yisu haaba kini mu utoyo na kuungi la baatu, ngu a nde na baana ba ngu a nde baaba hu mbadi na baakasaha utoyo na nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Muutu mumosi ni uleele Yisu: «Mono ngu a we na baana ba ngu a we hu mbadi bali, bo batondi utoyo na we.» <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Ka Yisu afutili nde: «Ngu a me ni na? Na baana ba ngu a me, ni bana?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Titswene, Yisu alabi kaka hu tsyelo bayihi ba nde, na nde aleeli: «Mono ngu a me, mono baana ba ngu a me! <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Mu tooni ati, woosi wu li mu ukuhasa litondo la Taata a me wu li hu mayulu, wuuna ni mwana a ngu a me, wuuna ni kedi a me, na wuuna ni ngu a me.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese mu makuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-52">13.1-52</ref></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:1-20">Mlk 4.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-15">Luk 8.4-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ilumbu mo hiina, Yisu apali mu nzo na ayatsahala ŋa muvanga a dyanga mu ulongese. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Koonge a baatu yinene yaayadiinga nde. Ni mu buuna, nde haakoti na haatsahili mutso a hyabu ŋa yulu a dyanga. Na koonge yoosi yaaba ŋa simu la dyanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Nde akayambila na bo mu mambu ma malahi mu makuma, na nde aleeli: «Ilumbu imoosi, mukuni apali mu unyanza muhunu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Bu nde haakanyanza mbutu, mbutu yina yaabwiidi mu muvaanga musoho, banyunyi baayidi na baadiidi yo. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Mbutu kima yaabwiidi ŋa yulu a toto mamanya, hu hwaba hwavele na toto yindahi. Mbutu yaameni mawasa, mu tooni ati, toto a yaaba na pfifi ve. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Bu nyangu haabeengi, nde anyengisi mitswihala, na myo myakanyi mu tooni a vele li manganzi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Mbutu kima yaabwiidi ŋatso bangamba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bangamba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miti mi matsyende.</char></note>. Bo baabuuhi na baavinyili mitswihala mi myakapala. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Ka mbutu kima yaabwiidi ŋa toto a mbolese. Mitswiihala myabuuhi, myarandi na myapalisi bisaka. Isaka imosi hyaviidi kama (100) la mbutu, hina maku masamunu (60), na bina maku matatu (30).» <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Na Yisu aleeli: «Muutu nga matswi, nyaha ayuha!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Tooni yi Yisu ali mu usalila makuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mlk 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Bayihi ba Yisu baayasusaha na baafuuli nde: «Mu hima we li mu utoyo na bo mu makuma?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Yisu afutili bo: «Huli benu, Nzambi amiiva bungodu bu uyaaba matswehi ma Ipfumu hi mayulu, ka a huli bo ve. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Ni mu buuna, muutu wu li na isiha, buubweva nde bi byafulala, na nde uba na bi byafulala. Ka huli wu avele na isiha, buumaasa nde tso hi nde ali na hyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ni mu buuna, me umbanzambila na bo mu makuma: Mu tooni ati, bo bali mu usungamana, hwavele umono. Bo bali mu uyuha, hwavele uyuha na hwavele utsikaha. <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />Na huli bo, ma maaleeli mumbihuli Esaya mamiitswiha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">“Benu sa liyuha bubwe, ka benu a luutsikaha ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">Benu sa lisungamana bubwe, ka benu a luumono ve.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />Eye, mitima mya baatu mo baniba myaka mi minono.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Bo baamiidibuha matswi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bo baamiidibuha miisu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">mana bo bavelemono mu miisu mya bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bo baveleyuha mu matswi ma bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">bo baveletsikaha mu mitima mya bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">Ni buuna bo buubwevelesobo mbiili, mana me a hambeeloso bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esa 6.9-10</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />Yisu abweleele: «Ka benu, kinya huli benu bu miisu ma benu mali mu umono na matswi ma benu mali mu uyuha! <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, mimbihuli mi milahi na baatu ba butsiitsa baatondi umono ma benu lili mu umono, ka bo a baamoni mo ve. Bo baatondi kaka uyuha ma benu lili mu uyuha, ka bo a baayuhi mo ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:10-12">1Pe 1.10-12</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yisu li mu ubindula kuma mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mlk 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Yisu abweleele: «Yuhaani mbindulili a kuma a mukuni. <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Baatu ba bubaayuha mambu ma Ipfumu hi mayulu, na ubaaveletsikaha mo, bo bali ŋa muvanga a luuha hu mbutu yabwiidi. Nga Bubi ubaayamasa mambu ma bamiikuna mu mitima mya bo. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Baatu bakima bali we toto mamanya hu mbutu yaabwidi. Bo bubaayuha mambu ma Nzambi na babaayaka mo mawasa na kinya yoosi. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Ka abubaanyaha ti mo mameni manganzi mu mitima mya bo ve. Mu taangu a pasi na ya mbingisili, mu tooni a mambu ma Nzambi, bo ni ubaabwisa imiinu. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Baatu bakima kaka bali we toto ya na bangamba hu mbutu yaabwiidi ŋatso matsyende. Bo bubaayuha mambu ma Nzambi, ka minyongo mu tooni a mambu ma tsi, soho li busina na makinya ma tsi, bibaavinyala mambu ma Nzambi, buuna mo utwala ubuta mbutu ve. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Hu tsyelele, baatu bakima bamiiyaka mbutu mu toto a mbolese. Bo bali mu uyuha mambu na bali mu utsikaha; bo bali mu ubuta mbutu, mumosi kama (100), mukima maku masamunu (60) na mukima maku matatu (30).»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma a hiimbu hi ibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yisu abweta bo kuma kima na aleeli: «Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina na muutu wu akuni muhunu wu mubwe mu ngundu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Ŋa butsuhu, bu baatu bamiibwamina, muboho a nde ayidi mu ukuna muhunu wu mubi ŋatso a mbutu a bele, na ayeni. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Bu mitswihala myakuli na myaviidi mbutu, biimbu bi bibi kaka byameni. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Basalili ba mukuutu a nzo baayaleele nde: “Pfumu, we akuni muhunu wu mubwe mu ngundu a we. Ka biimbu bi bibi mo biniibi huni bimiimata?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Nde afutili bo: “Ni muboho asa buuna.” Basalili baafuuli nde: “We tondi ti bisu liyaatuupala biimbu bi bibi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Pfumu afutili bo: “naana, mana ŋa benu luutuupala byo, benu alituupala kaka bele. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Nyahaani byosi bikula nzila moosi, natee mu taangu yi ukuukaha, na mu taangu mo yiina, me tsa ndeele huli bakuukihi: Maatuupalaani biimbu bi bibi, na kutaani byo mu biko mana batsuha byo. Titswene, benu likotese muhunu a bele hutso isyengi hya me.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma a libutu li mutade</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mlk 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yisu atiidi bo kuma kima: «Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina na libutu li mutade, li muutu amiikuna mu ngundu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Lo lili libutu li laafulala bukeehe mu mbutu yoosi. Ka hu mbisa ukuna libutu, lo libaakula, libaafulala byosi bi baakuna mu wooto mu bunene. Lo libaakituha muti, na banyunyi bubaatunga byanza bya bo hutso bitabi bya nde.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma iloho hi hibaadanisa lidaama li mapa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13.20-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yisu atiidi bo kuma kima mo yiniiyi: «Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina na levure, iloho hi hibaadanisa lidaama li mapa, hi mukaasu amiivolo, na amiipfuuta mu byetso bi bilahi bi lidaama li mapa, te bu lo loosi luudaana.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Yisu akasalila makuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mlk 4.33-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yisu akava ndongisili a nde huli makonge ma baatu mu makuma. A hu li na dyambu tso limosi li nde haleeli bo hwavele a kuma ve. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Nde hakasa buuna, mana mambu ma Nzambi hayabisi mu munywa a mumbihuli a nde matswiha:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Me tsa nzambila mu makuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">Me tsa nzabisa matswehi ma umata pangili a tsi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Mkg 78.2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mbindulili a kuma a himbu hi ibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Titswene, Yisu asiisi koonge a baatu, na nde akoti mu nzo. Bayihi ba nde baayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde, na baleeli: «Bindula bisu kuma a hiimbu hi ibi hya mu ngundu.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Yisu afutili bo: «Wu ubaakuna muhunu wu mubwe ni Mwana a Muutu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />ngundu ni tsi, muhunu wu mubwe ni baana ba Ipfumu hi mayulu. Hiimbu hi ibi ni baana ba Nga Bubi. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Muboho wu akuna mbutu yimbi, ni mukuyi. Tsonzihili ni tsukusu a tsi. Batsonzihi ni bapofi. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Ni mu buuna, we bu bubaatuupala biimbu bi bibi mu ubwaha byo hutso a mbaahu, sa buba kaka bumosi mu ilumbu hya tsyelele. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana a Muutu sa atsindaha bapofi ba nde. Bo buumaasa hutso Ipfumu hya nde, boosi ba bubaabwisa bana mu masumu, na ba bubaavaanga ma mabi. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Na bapofi sa babwaha bo hutso a mbeenge a mbaahu, hu huba bililu na kulili a miinyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Ka baatu ba baakangama mu Nzambi sa ba bamwademe we taangu hutso Ipfumu hya Taata<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:3">Dan 12.3</ref></char></note> a bo. Woosi nga matswi, nyaha ayuha!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Busina bu baaswehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Yisu abweleele: «Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina na busina bu baaswehe hutso a ngundu. Muutu wu usoolo bwo miibweswehe bwo. Na hutso a kinya, nde uyasuumbasa bisiha byosi bi nde ali na byo, na uyasuumba ngundu mo yiina.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />Ipfumu hi mayulu hyabwefwanina na muutu wu uba sa mumbungu, wu li mu usaha bilabu bi bibwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Bu nde amiimono ilabu hya talu yi yaafulala, nde ubaayasumbasa byosi bi nde ali na byo. Na nde uyasuumba ilabu mo hiina.<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma a lihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Ipfumu hi mayulu hyabwefwanina na lihi li baabwaha mu mubu, na li lili mu ukaanga batswi ba pila mu pila. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Bu lo limiiluula mu batswi, balobi baafwana uduta lo ŋa simu. Titswene, bo bubaatsahala na bubaasoolo batswi. Ba babwe, bo bubaasuusa mutso maponzi. Ba baavele a tsongo, bo bubaabuma bo. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Ni buuna kaka huuba mu ilumbu hya tsukusu a tsi. Bapofi sa bayaatahula babi ŋa hati li batsiitsa, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />na ubwaha bo hutso a mbeenge a mbaahu. Huuna sa huba bililu na kulili a miinyu.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Busina bu bunyatihi na bu bukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yisu afuuli bayihi ba nde: «Benu limiitsikaha maana moosi bubwe?» Bo ni ufutala: «Eye.» <verse eid="MAT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Na nde aleeli bo: «Ni buuna, pasi mulongisi Mikele wu ka muyihi Ipfumu hi mayulu, nde li we mukuutu a nzo wu ubaapalisa bisiha bi binyatihi na bisiha bi bikulu mu iswehili hya nde.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisu Nazareti a bali mu usiila Yisu imiinu ve</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mlk 6.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Bu Yisu haamani uleele makuma mo maana, nde amati ŋaana, <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />nde ayeni hu musyenge wu nde haakuli. Nde abaandihi ulongese mu nzo a bo yi lisambulu li Bayudaayo. Baatu ba baakayuha ndongisili a nde, baakimuhi na baakafuula: «Tsiki mo yiniiyi huni yaamatila nde? Buni nde ali mu uvaanga bipadi mo biniibi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Wunuuwu a ni mwana a salapandi ve? Mariya a ni ngu ande ve? Yaki, Yosefi, Simoni na Yude, a bali baana ba ngu a nde ve? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Bakedi ba nde a bali boosi ŋa hati la bisu ŋaaniŋa ve? Nde matwala mo maniima moosi huni mamiimatila nde?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Na maana moosi maakasa ti bo bavelesiila nde imiinu. Ka Yisu aleeli bo: « A bubaakiinza mumbihuli, mu tsi a nde, buuve mu nzo a nde ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yow 4.44</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Yesu avaangi ŋaana ndulu bipadi bya hoole, mu tooni apelili a bo yi imiinu.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Yowani mutondihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mlk 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Eloode Atipasi wu akatuma itaanzi hya Ngalili ayuhi tsangu a Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Nde aleeli huli basalili ba nde: «Muutu mo wuuna ni Yowani mutondihi, nde amiisuuha mu tsi a babakwa. Ni mu buuna, nde ali na matwala ma uvanga bipadi.»<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Mono buni Eloode haatsindihi baatu mu ukaanga Yowani. Nde atumi bahada Yowani mapaanga na ukotese nde mu kondaayi. Nde haasiidi buuna, mu tooni a Elodyadi, wu Eloode haapatuli mu ukwele tso bu nde haaba mukadi a mwana a tata a nde Filipo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mlk 6.17</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Yowani akaleele Eloode ti: «A baava we muswa wu ukwele Elodyadi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Lev 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20.21</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Eloode akasaha uduba Yowani. Ka nde aba na boomo bwa konge Bayudaayo, mu tooni ati boosi baakamono Yowani we mumbihuli. <verse eid="MAT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Mu mukungi wu ilumbu hya mbutili a Eloode, mwana a Elodyadi wu mukaasu, akini ŋa busu bwa byenyi. Nde amweesi Eloode kinya. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Ni buuna, nde hasiidi lahi la na mulabu huli mwana a Elodyadi mu uva nde pasi iloho hi nde huvondo. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Mu ndoongi a ngu a nde, nuumba aleeli Eloode: «Behele me mutswe a Yowani mutondihi ŋa yulu ikoombe mo hiinihi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu bukulu bwa bisu Looma, ukeese mutswe aba iteesi hi hyaba hyayabahana mu uduba muutu. Elodyadi atoondi ti mutswe basuusa ŋa yulu ikoombe, mana bayaaba ti Yowani baadubi. Titswene mutswe baafwana ubuma.</char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mutumi amoni lingebe mu hi mwana haavondi. Ka mu tooni milabu mi nde hasiidi ŋa busu bwa byenyi, Eloode atumi ti babehele nuumba mutswe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Eloode atsindihi muutu mu uyakese mutswe a Yowani Mutondihi hutso a kondaayi. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Baabehi mutswe a nde ŋa yulu ikoombe na baaviidi huli nuumba, wu ayava nde huli ngu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Bayihi ba Yowani baayavolo nyutu a nde na baayadiiha. Titswene, bo baayeni mu uyayabisa Yisu moosi ma maavyohi.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibuungala koonge a baatu yinene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mlk 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Bu Yisu haayuhi tsangu mo yiina, nde amati ŋaana mu hyabu mu uyene ŋa muvanga nde siha ŋa mbuha yi ive na ive. Ka bu koonge a baatu yaayuhi musamu, yo yaapali mu mala ma bebele na yaaduukili nde mu miilu mu muvanga a dyanga. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Bu Yisu hapali mu hyabu, nde amoni koonge a baatu yinene, nde aluuli mu lingebe mu tooni a bo, na abeelusi babeedu ba bo. <verse eid="MAT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Bu busi bwaba bwaka beleve, bayihi ba Yisu baayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde na baaleeli nde: «Busi bwamiiyila, na mbuha mo yiniiyi yi ive na ive. Futala baatu mo baniiba, bayene mu mala ma ibiingi mo hiniihi, mana bo bayasuumba byudya.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Yisu afutili: «Bo a bali na nzala umata ŋaaniŋa ve, vaani bo byudya benu mwakulu!» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Ka bayihi baafutili nde: « Ŋaaniŋa, bisu lili ndulu na mapa mataanu na batswi boole.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Yesu aleeli bo: «Behelaani me byo.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Titswene, nde atumi koonge a baatu mu utsahala ŋa yulu a biimbu. Nde avoli mapa ma mataanu na batswi baboole, asuuli miisu hu yulu na afutili matondo huli Nzambi. Titswene, nde atabuli mapa na aviidi mo huli bayihi, na bayihi baakabili mo huli koonge a baatu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Boosi badiidi na baaywati. Na bayihi baatoli bitini bi mapa bi byasalili. Baaluusi byebe kuumi na byole. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Ba baadiidi baatoodi bebele biveeve bitaanu bi babahala (5 000), hwavele utanga bakaasu na baana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyene ŋa yulu a mamba mu miilu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 6:45-56">Mlk 6.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:16-21">Yow 6.16-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Masulubete, Yisu atumi bayihi ba nde mu ukoto mutso a hyabu na utswamina hu simu lina. Bu nde haba kini mu ufutala koonge a baatu. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Bu nde haamani ufutala baatu boosi, nde akumisi hu yulu isyelo mu usambila. Bu tsitsaha yaatoodi, Yisu asaali nde siha ŋaana. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Hyabu hyaba hyaka lala na simu. Mapo maakanyingasa hyabu na ifula hyakayabwana bo. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Hu mikyakya, Yisu ayeni hu tsyelo bayihi ba nde, mu miilu ŋa yulu a mamba. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ŋa bayihi baamoni nde mu uyene ŋa yulu a mamba, boomo bwakaangi bo, na baaleeli: «Wunuuwu mukuyi!» Bo baabandihi ufulaha mu tsisu. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Masulubete, Yisu aleeli bo: «Hwadaani, wunuuwu me, a liba na boomo ve!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Peetelo abaandihi uyambila na uleele nde: «Pfumu, umono ti wunuuwu ni we, tumasa me mu uya huli we ŋa yulu a mamba.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yisu aleeli: «Yaanga!» Peetelo apali mu hyabu na ayeni ŋa yulu a mamba huli Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Ka bu nde hamoni ti ifula aba hyafulala mifudi, nde amoni boomo. Na bu nde habandihi udyama, nde afulihi: «Pfumu, fuuhasa me!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Mu mawasa, Yisu alabi kaka na akaangi nde na aleeli: «Muutu nga imiinu hi ikeehe, mu hima we siidi paha?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Bo baakoti bo baboole mu hyabu, na ifula hyavudimini. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Buuna, bayihi ba baaba mutso a hyabu baakongimini ŋa busu bwa Yisu na baaleeli: «Mu mbuli we li Mwana a Nzambi!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso babeedu hu Ngenezareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Hu mbisa a tsabuhili a dyanga, bo baatoodi hu itaanzi hya Ngenezareti<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:53">Mlk 6.53</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Baatu ba mbuha mo yiina baadihuli Yisu, na baayabisi tsangu a nziili a nde mu ibiingi mo hiina hyoosi. Buuna, baabehili nde babeedu boosi. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bo baakayayaana Yisu mu unyaha ti babeedu babeleene tso tsoso ikutu hya nde. Na boosi ba baakabeembe nde, baabeeluhi.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ndongisili mu bukulu bu Bafarisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:1-23">Mlk 7.1-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Bafarisi na milongisi mi Mikele baamati hu Yeruselemi mu uyamono Yisu na ufuula nde: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Mu hima bayihi ba we bali mu uvelekiinza bukulu bu bwasiisa bakuutu ba bisu? Mu tooni ati, bo a bubaaswaha makaka ma bo, we bu hu li bukulu, teehele mu dya ve.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yisu afutili bo: «Ka benu, mu hima benu libaavelesiingala matumili ma Nzambi mu ubaaduukala bukulu bwa benu? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi aleele: “Kiinza taata a we na ngu a we”, na: “Woosi wu usinga taata a nde buuve ngu a nde, sa basyembe nde mu tsyembili lipfu.” <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Ka benu, benu lili mu uleele huli muutu: “We na muswa wu uleele huli taata a we buuve huli ngu a we ti, kabu li me kiipa we mu ukumbasa we, ni bungodu bu me ataasila mu uva Nzambi”. <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Na benu lili mu uva muswa huli muutu mo wuuna, mu ubwevelekiinza taata a nde. Buuna, benu libaamaasa mambu ma Nzambi mu usalila we bu hu li bukulu bwa benu! <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Benu banga muwala lili! Esaya aba na mbiinga ŋa nde habihuli bubwe mu tooni a benu:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />“Baatu mo baniiba bubaayuusa me mu bibodu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">ka mitima mya bo myasinzatahuha na me.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />Baatu mo baniiba mu pu bali mu ukuunda me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">ndongisili yi bo bali mu ulongese yili ndulu matumili ma baatu baasuunda<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Esa 29.13</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Titswene, Yisu ateeli koonge a baatu na aleeli bo: «Yuhaani na tsikahaani bubwe: <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />A hi hibaakoto mu munywa a muutu hibaasumana nde ve. Ka hi hili mu upala mu muutu, hiina ni hi hili mu usumana nde.» <verse eid="MAT 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Ni mu buuna, bayihi ba Yisu baayasusaha na baaleeli nde: «We yaabi ti Bafarisi bamiisinzaduka bu bayuhi we mu utoyo buuna?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Nde afutili: «Bubaatupala pasi musumana wu Taata a me wu li hu yulu haavelekuna. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Nyahaani bo, bo bali binzimana bi bili mu ubita binzimana! Ka tso inzimana hibiti inzimana na nde, bo baboole sa babwa hutso iyuna.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Peetelo aleeli Yisu: «Bindula bisu tsiki a kuma mo yiniiyi.» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yisu ni uleele: «Benu kaka kaahu kini a laatsikaha ve? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Benu a lili mu utsikaha ve ti, byosi bi bibaakoto mu munywa a muutu bi baavyohele mu moonyi a nde, titswene byo bipali mu nyutu a nde? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Ka bi bibaapala mu munywa, bibaamata hutso mutima, na ni byo bibaasumana muutu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Mu tooni ati, ni hu hati mutima a muutu hubaapala matsimi ma mabi, ma mu baabita hu uduba, hu mayamba, hu bulaala, hu yiba, hu mapfuta, na hu bituhi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Biniibi byosi, ni bi bibaasumana muutu. Ka udya byudya hwavele uswaha makaka, we bu hu li bukulu, a hubaasumana muutu ve.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaasu a mwenyi miisa imiinu mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mlk 7.24-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Titswene, Yisu amati ŋaana na ayeni hu tsi a Tiiro na hu tsi a Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Na buunubu, mukaasu a Kaana mumosi wu akatsahala hu itaanzi mo hiina, ayidi huli Yisu na afulihi: «Pfumu, Mwana a Davidi, kwila me lingebe! Mwana a me wu mukaasu, tengo lamiikaanga nde na lo lili mu unyongese nde mu iteesi hi inono!» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Ka Yisu a hafutili nde dyambu ve. Bayihi ba nde baayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde na uleele nde: «Binga nde, mu tooni ati, nde li mu usinzafulaha hu mbisa a bisu a benu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yisu afutili: «Baatsindaha me ndulu huli mameme ma maadimbala ma buli la Isereli.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Ka mukaasu ayaakongemene ŋa busu bwa Yisu na aleeli: «Pfumu, kumbasa me!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yisu afutili: «A hu li bubwe mu uvolo lipa la baana na ubuma lo huli bamvwa ve.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Mukaasu afutili nde: «Pfumu, mumbuli, ka bamvwa kaka bubaadya bipepesi bi bibaabwa hu tsina a metse ma bapfumu ba bo.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Buuna Yisu afutili nde: «Mukaasu! Imiinu hya we hili hiinene! Nyaha buba we bu we tondi.» Na mu taangu mo yiina, mwana a nde wu mukaasu abeeluhi.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso babeedu ba balahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yisu amati ŋaana na ayeni hu simu la dyanga la Ngalili. Nde akumisi ŋa yulu isyelo na atsahili. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Makonge ma baatu maayidi huli nde. Bo baabehi bikata, binzimana, banga matsode, biduka, na babeedu bakima ba balahi. Baayasuusa bo ŋa miilu mya Yisu, na nde abeelusi bo. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Ni mu buuna baatu baakimuhi hu ulahi, bu bo baamoni biduka mu utoyo, banga bipiha mu ubeeloho, banga matsode mu uyene bu hwasungama, binzimana mu umono, na bo baayuusi Nzambi a Isereli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibuungala koonge a baatu kima yinene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mlk 8.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Titswene, Yisu ateeli bayihi ba nde na aleeli: «Me ndi mu umono lingebe mu tooni a baatu mo baniiba. Lolo yiniiyi huka bilumbu bitatu bi bo bali mu ukwilala na me, na bo a bali na tso isiha hyudya ve. Tso me pfutili bo mu manzo ma bo nzala, bo buukolo binama mu nzila.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Bayihi baafuuli nde: «Huni bisu luutwala ubaha mapa ma uywatisa koonge mo yiiniyi yoosi ŋa ibiingi hi ive na ive hiniihi?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yisu afuuli bo: «Mapa kwe benu lili na mo?» Bo baafutili: «Tsambu, na mwana a batswi ba bakeehe.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Nde atumisi koonge a baatu mu utsahala ŋa toto. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Titswene, hu mbisa uvolo mapa matsambu na batswi Yisu afutili matondo huli Nzambi. Nde atabuli mapa, akabi na aviidi mo huli bayihi ba nde mu ukabila huli boosi. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Baatu baadiidi na baaywati. Na baatoli byebe tsambu bi byaluuli mu bitini bi byasalili. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Baatu ba baadiidi mapa na batswi, aba bebele biveeve bina (4 000) bi babahala, hwavele utanga bakaasu na baana. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Bu nde haamani ufutala baatu mo baana boosi, Yisu avaati mu hyabu, na ayeni hu tsi a Mangadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bafarisi na Basaduki bali mu uvondo ipadi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:11-21">Mlk 8.11-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12.54-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Bafarisi na Basaduki baayasusaha huli Yisu, mu utehele nde mweto. Bo baakasaha iliimbu hya kimuhili hi hyumata hu yulu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Ka Yisu afutili bo: «Ŋa tsitsaha, benu libaaleele: “Tangu sa yiba yimbwe, mu tooni ati yulu laabeenge.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Na ŋa tsumba a ngwali, benu libaaleele: “Mvula mana unoho lolo yiniiyi, mu tooni ati, yulu laabeenge na laapiinda.” Benu libaayaba utsikaha biliimbu bya toto na bya yulu, buni benu laaveletsikaha mambu ma mali mu uvyoho mu taangu mo yiniiyi? <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Baatu ba tungi mo liniili bali ba babi na ba baavelekangama mu Nzambi. Bo bali mu usaha iliimbu, ka, a busiila bo iliimbu ikima ve ŋa yulu a hi mumbihuli Yonasi.» Titswene, nde asiisi bo na ayeni.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usa buyedi mu ndongisili Bafarisi na Basaduki</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mlk 8.14-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Ŋa bayihi baakayene hu simu lina la dyanga, bo baavusiini mapa mutima. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Kebaani! Baani na buyedi mu levure li Bafarisina na Basaduki.» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Bayihi baakatsundana hutso mitima na baakaleelesene: «Nde amiileele buuna, mu tooni ati, bisu a libehi mapa ve.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yisu a Yaabi mambu ma bo baakatsima, na nde afuuli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu ulelesene ti: a lili na mapa ve? Benu baatu ba imiinu hya hi ikeehe! <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Benu kini a laatsikaha ve? Benu a lili mu uyibwala moonyi mu mapa mataanu ma baakabili biveeve bitaanu (5 000) bi babahala na litangu li maponzi ma benu laabiti ve? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Na benu a lili mu uyibwala moonyi mu mapa tsambu ma baakabili biveeve bina (4 000) bi babahala na litangu la byebe bi benu laabiti ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34">Mty 15.34</ref></char></note>? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Benu a laaveletsikaha ve? Me a hakanzambila benu mu mapa ve ŋa me akandeele benu: “Keebaani mu levure li Bafarisi na Basaduki!”»<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Buuna, bayihi baatsikihi ti nde a haleeli bo mu ukebe mu levure<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">levure </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baasalila ŋaniiŋa mu umweese ipuha hya baatu ba bubaabita bana mu matsimi ma mabi.</char></note> li bubaasalila mu uvaanga lipa ve. Ka mu ukebe mu ndongisili Bafarisi na Basaduki.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo aleeli ti Yisu ni Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mlk 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yisu ayeni hu tsi a Sezare ya Filipo, nde afuuli bayihi ba nde: «Mu uyuha bitoyili bya baatu, Mwana a muutu na ali?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bo baafutili: «Bamosi bali mu uleele ti, we Yowani Mutondihi we li, bakima ti, we Eliya we li; bakima ti we Yelemiya buuve mumosi mu mimbihuli we li.» <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yisu ni ufuula bo: «Ka mu benu, me na ndi?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simoni Peetelo afutili: «We ni Masiya, Mwana a Nzambi a moonyi!» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli nde: «Kinya huli we Simoni, mwana a Yoona, mu tooni ati, a muutu miimweese we lo ve, ka Taata a me wu li hu mayulu miimweese we lo. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Eye, me, me ndi mu undeele ti Peetelo, we li manya, na ŋa yulu a manya mo linili me tsa tuunga libundu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref></char></note> la me. Lipfu lo mwakulu a luutwala pasi isiha usa lo ve. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Me tsa pa we batsaafi ba Ipfumu hi mayulu. Moosi ma we ukuta ŋa toto, Nzambi kaka sa akuta hu mayulu. Moosi ma we unyaangula ŋa toto, Nzambi kaka sa anyaangula mo hu mayulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ufwanisa kaka na <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">18.18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Yow 20.23</ref></char>. </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ma we ukuta...ma we unyaangula</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mambindulili makima </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ma we usiingasa sa basiingasa...ma we uliha sa baliha </char><char style="ft" closed="false">buuve </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ma we ukotese sa bakotese...ma we upalisa sa bapalisa</char><char style="ft" closed="false">buuve kaka </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ma we usa kolo-kolo sa basa kolo-kolo...huuna hu we ubisa kolo-kolo, sa babisala kolo-kolo.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Na Yisu alihi bayihi ba nde mu uvelebila uleele huli pasi muutu ti nde ni Masiya.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiyabisa lipfu na tsuuhili a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mlk 8.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:25-27">14.25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Umata taangu mo yiina, Yisu abandihi uyabisa huli bayihi ba nde ti hwafwana huli nde mu uyene hu musyenge a Yeruselemi, hu bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, na milongisi mi Mikele buumweese nde pasi yi yaafulala. Nde sa akwa na sa asuuha mu ilumbu hi bitatu. <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Buuna Peetelo abiti Yisu ŋa muvanga na abaandihi usyembe nde: «Nzambi akeelese we, Pfumu! Ubila ve! Liina a luuyiila we ve!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Ka Yisu akinguhi na aleeli Peetelo: «Matila me, Saatana! We li baku mu nzila a me, mu tooni ati, matsimi ma we a mali matsimi ma Nzambi ve, ka mo mali ma baatu.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buni laafwana uduukala Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 8:34-9:1">Mlk 8.34–9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luk 9.23-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Titswene, Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Tso muutu tondi uduukala me, anyaha ubwetsima mu nde mwakulu, atsyete kuruwa a nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anyaha ubwetsima mu nde mwakulu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili ni ti, nde a hasaali mu nde mwakulu ve, ka nde aka wa Kristo; </char><char style="fq" closed="false">atsyete kuruwa a nde</char><char style="ft" closed="false">utala kaka mu<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mlk 8.34</ref></char>.</char></note>, na aduukala me. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Ni mu buuna, woosi wu tondi ufuuhasa muvumu a nde, sa anyambasana nde, ka woosi wu unyambasana muvumu a nde mu tooni a me, sa asoolo nde. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Ki kaluha muutu huubaha tso nde bahi tsi yoosi, na uvinda muvumu a nde? Hima muutu huutwala uva ŋa ikiisa hi idiingu hya nde? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Mwana a Muutu sa aya hutso muyusu a Taata a nde na bapofi ba nde, na buuna nde sa asyende pasi muutu we buubeedi mbiili a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:13">Mkg 62.13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Lom 2.6</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu: mwana a baatu bakima mu ba bali ŋaniiŋa, a buukwa ve, teehele bo bamono Mwana a Muutu mu uya mu Ipfumu hya nde.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Moose na Eliya bali mu uyambila na Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mlk 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Bilumbu bisamunu bivyoho, Yisu avoli Peetelo, Yaki na Yowani, mwana a ngu a Yaki, na nde abiti bo ŋa muvanga, ŋa yulu isyelo hi mutaabu. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Nde akimbuhi ŋa busu bwa bo. Hiinzi hya nde hyakamwedeme we taangu, na bikutu bya nde byafuuki we liyalala li mifudi. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Masulubete, Moose na Eliya baayamonehele. Na bo baboole baakamoho na Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Buuna, Peetelo aleeli huli Yisu: «Pfumu, hu li bubwe ti bisu a benu libaani ŋaaniŋa. Tso we tondi, me tsa tuunga bitudu bitatu ŋaaniŋa: imosi hya we, imosi hya Moose, imosi hya Eliya.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Bu Peetelo haaba kini mu uyambila, yidu li laakamwedeme laayafuha bo, na ndaha mosi yaapali hutso a yidu, na yaaleeli: «Wunuuwu ni Mwana a me wu litondo, wu ubaakuhasa kinya a me. Liyuhala nde!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Bu bayihi baayuhi ndaha mo yiina, bo baabahi boomo bu bulahi na baabwidi biinzi mu toto. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Ka Yisu ayasusaha ŋa pedu a bo, abeembi bo na aleeli: «Telemaani, a liba na boomo ve!» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Buuna, bo baasiimbuli miisu, na baamoni ndulu ka Yisu siha. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Bu bo baakakulamana isyelo, Yisu akebisi bo na aleeli: «A lileele huli pasi muutu imono-miisu mo hiina ve, natee bu Mwana a Muutu husuuha mu tsi a ba bakwa.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Titswene, bayihi baafuuli nde: «Mu hima milongisi mi Mikele mi baaleele ti Eliya afwana uya busu?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Nde afutili bo: «Ni mbuli, Eliya afwana uya mu uyaasuungaha mambu moosi. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Ka me ndeele benu, Eliya amiikwaya, baatu a baadihuli nde ve. Ka bo baavangili nde moosi ma bo baatondi. Bumosi kaka, bo buukwamisa Mwana a Muutu nde mwakulu.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Bayihi baatsikihi ti nde mu Yowani mutondihi haakatoyo na bo.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso mwana nga puha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mlk 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Bu bo baayato ŋa hwaba koonge a baatu, bahala limosi laayasusaha huli Yisu, laatsokimi ŋa busu bwa nde na laaleeli: <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />«Pfumu, kwila mwana a me wa bahala lingebe, nde li na puha, na nde li mu umono pasi yindahi. Matangu makima, nde ubaabwa hutso a mbaahu, buuve hutso a mamba. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Me ambiti nde huli bayihi ba we, ka bo a baatwali ubeeloso nde ve.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yisu afutili: «Benu baatu ba tuungi li libi, na balaavele imiinu! Matangu kwe me apfwana umabweba na benu? Matangu kwe me apfwana umaabwekunda benu? Behelaani me nde ŋaniiŋa.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yisu afwengili tengo, na lo laapali mu mwana na mwana abeeluhi masulubete. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Na bayihi baasusihi huli Yisu na baafuuli nde ŋa muvanga: «Mu hima bisu livelitwala ubinga livupu mo lilibi liniili?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Yisu ni ufutala bo: «Mu tooni ati, imiinu hya benu hili ndulu hoole. Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, tso imiinu hya benu hili we libutu la mutade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mutade </char><char style="ft" closed="false">libutu li laalutahala bukeehe mu mbutu yoosi ŋa tsi.</char></note>, benu utwala uleele huli isyelo mo hiniihi: “Mata ŋaana na yene huna!” Isiha utwala ukondosono benu ve. [<verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Ka ndulu mu lisambulu na ndiili ikaandi bubaatwala upalisa livupu lilibi la bunuubu.]»<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibweyabisa lipfu na tsuuhili a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mlk 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Ilumbu imosi, bayihi baaba boosi itwadi hu Ngalili, Yisu aleeli bo: Mwana a Muutu baaka mu uyeholo ŋa myoho mya baatu. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Bo sa baduba nde, ka mu ilumbu hi bitatu nde sa asuuha mu babakwa. Bayihi baamoni lingebe li lilahi mu tooni a mambu mo maana.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfutili limandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Bu Yisu na bayihi ba nde baatoodi hu Kapernahumi, bakaambi ba limandu la nzo a Nzambi, baayasusaha huli Peetelo na bafuuli nde: «Mulongisi a benu a hufuta limandu la nzo a Nzambi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Pal 30.11-16</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Peetelo afutili: «Eye! Nde ubaafuta lo.» Mu taangu yi Peetelo hakoti mu nzo, Yisu abaandihi utoyo na aleeli: «We buni li mu utsima, Simoni? Batumi ba toto bo mamaandu huli na ba baavolo? Huli baana ba bo vo huli byenyi?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Nde afutili nde: «Huli byenyi.» Na Yisu afutili nde: «Baana kaahu a bubaafuta ve. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Ka bisu a benu mu uvelekubasa bo baku, yene hu dyanga, yabwaha lobo, na duta tswi watsomi wu uya, dibula munywa a nde, na we sa mono likuta la mbongo li luukuha mu ufuta limandu la me na la we; volo lo na futa bo limandu la bisu a we.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu ulongese bayihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-35">18.1-35</ref></para>
  <para style="s2">Na alutahala bukuutu hutso Ipfumu hi mayulu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mlk 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Mu taangu mo yiina, bayihi baayasusaha huli Yisu na ufuula nde: «Na alutahala bukuutu hu Ipfumu hi mayulu?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Buuna, Yisu ateeli mwana a ngebe mumosi, asuusi nde ŋa hati la bo, <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />na aleeli: «Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, tso benu a lisobi na ukituha we baana ba bangebe ve, benu a luukoto hu Ipfumu hi mayulu ve. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ni mu buuna, muutu wu alutahala bukuutu hu Ipfumu hi mayulu ni nde wuuna wu ubaakulamana na ubaakituha we mwana a ngebe mo wunuunu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Muutu wu uyaka mwana a ngebe wa bunuubu mu nduhi a me, ni me nde huuyaka.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ukele mu ubwisa mwana a ngebe tso mumosi mu masumu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mlk 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Yisu abweleele: «Ka tso muutu bwisi mu masumu mumosi mu bikenyi mo biniibi, bi bili mu usiila me imiinu, hufulili bubwe huli nde ti bakutalala nde manya li laafulala bunene mu likiingu, na udyamisa nde hu tsina mubu. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Ni lingebe li lilahi mu baatu ba ŋa toto, mu tooni ati misamu mi mibaabwisa baatu mu masumu mili mi milahi. Eye, misamu mo miina utwala uvele ve. Ka ni lingebe huli muutu wu li tooni a nziili a myo! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Tso kaka la we libaabwisa we mu masumu, kese lo na buma lo lala na we, buuve tso huulu hwa we hubaabwisa we mu masumu, kese hwo na buma hwo lala na we. Hwafulala bubwe huli we mu ukoto na kaka limosi buuve huulu humosi hu moonyi a mbuli, ka a mu uyene hu mbungulu wu akuha ve. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Na tso diisu la we libaabwisa we mu masumu, lobolo lo na buma lo lala. Hwafulala bubwe huli we mu ukoto hu moonyi a mbuli na diisu limosi, ka a mu uba na miisu ma we mamoole, na ubwaha we hu mbeenge a mbaahu ve.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma lindombo li laadimbala na li limiisoloho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15.3-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Yisu abweleele: «Baakelaani mu ubelele mumosi mu bikenyi mo biniibi. Mumbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, bapofi ba bo hu mayulu bu baaba taangu yoosi ŋa busu bwa Taata a me wu li hu mayulu. [<verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Mu tooni ati, Mwana a Muutu miiya mu uyobolo ba baadimbala.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Benu buni lili mu utsima? Tso muutu li na kama (100) li madombo, na tso limosi mu mo lidiimbili, nde a humasiisa maku ipfwa na ipfwa (99) ŋa yulu isyelo, na uyene hu uyasaha lindombo li laadimbala ve? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Mu mbuli me ndeele benu, tso nde sooli lo, nde sa aba na kinya mu lindombo mo liina. Kinya a nde mu lo yiufulala ya mu mandombo maku ipfwa na ipfwa (99) ma maaveledimbala. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Ni bumosi kaka, Taata a benu wu li hu mayulu a baatondo ve ti mumosi mu bikenyi mo biniibi adimbala.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Buni mu usiila mwana a ngu a we kolo-kolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Yisu abweleele: «Tso mwana a ngu a we mu livupu sili we dyambu li libi, yene, yamweese nde bubi bwa nde bu benu lili boole. Nde ayuhala we, we miibingala mwana a ngu a we mu livupu. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Ka nde aveleyuhala we, volo muutu mumosi buuve baatu boole na we, we bu Libuuku la Ngidi lili mu uleele “mana musamu woosi asungama mu imbangi hya baatu boole buuve baatu batatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Pfu 19.15</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Tso nde bisi uyuhala bo, yabisa lo huli libundu. Na nde abisa kaka uyuhala baana ba ngu mu libundu, nyaha nde aba we ngoyi ŋa busu bwa we, buuve we mutsonzihi limandu. <verse eid="MAT 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, moosi ma benu luukuta ŋa toto, Nzambi sa akuta mo hu yulu. Na moosi ma benu luunyaangula ŋa toto, Nzambi sa banyaangula mo hu yulu. <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu umbwendeele benu ti, tso baatu boole ŋa hati la benu bapfuuti matsimi ŋa toto mu uvondo pasi isiha, Taata a me wu li hu mayulu sa ava bo hyo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Mu tooni ati, baatu boole buuve baatu batatu bapfuutana mu nduhi a me, me ndi ŋa hati la bo.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma musalili wu abisi usa kolo-kolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Buuna Peetelo ayasusaha huli Yisu na afuuli nde: «Pfumu, kolo-kolo tsa kwe me utsa mwana a ngu a me mu livupu, ŋa nde husiila me ma mabi? Natee, tsa tsambu?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yisu afutili: « Naana, me a handi mu undeele ve ti natee tsa tsambu. Ka we afwana mu usa nde kolo-kolo tsa maku tsambu li bikuku tsambu. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Ni mu buuna, Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina na mutumi mumosi wu tondi ukamba mbongo huli basalili ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Bu nde abandihi usa litangu, baabehili nde musalili mumosi wu aba asombo mbongo yi ndahi-ndahi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Musalili a haaba na tsalu yi utwala ufuta mukanu mo wuuna ve. Buuna pfumu a nde atumi ti basumbasa nde we muviha. Nde na mukadi a nde na baana ba nde, na bisiha bya nde byosi, mana bafuta mukanu mo wuuna. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Musalili akongimini ŋa busu bu a pfumu na aleeli: “Pfumu, suusala me puumi, me tsa pfuta bya we byosi!” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Pfumu akwili musalili a nde lingebe, anyahuli nde na ayehuli mukanu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Bu musalili mo wuuna hapali, nde abwani na mbaahi a nde mumosi wu isalu, wu aba asombo nde mbongo yi keehe. Nde akaangi nde, aviki nde ŋa mivodi na aleeli: “Futa bya me bi we asombo!” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Mbaahi a nde abwili nde ŋa miilu, ayayiini nde na aleeli: Suusala me puumi, na me tsa pfuta we. <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Ka nde a hatondi ve; nde ayabwaha nde napa mu kondaayi, tee mu pfutili a mukanu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Bu basalili bakima baamoni mambu ma maabwidi, baamoni lingebe li lilahi, na baayabisi musamu huli pfumu a bo. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Ni buuna, pfumu hatsihi musalili mo wuuna, na aleeli nde: “We musalili nga mavaanga ma mabi! Me anzyehuli mukanu a we woosi mu tooni ti we ayayiini me. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />We a haakikwila mbaahi a we lingebe, we bu me akwila we lingebe ve?” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Pfumu abahi kesi na nde a tsindihi musalili hu kondaayi, hu bisalu bya pasi, natee bu nde hafuti byosi bi nde haba hasombo.»<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Na Yisu abweleele: «Ni buuna Taata a me wu li hu yulu husa mu benu, tso pasi nde mu benu velisa mwana a ngu a nde mu livupu kolo-kolo mu mutima a nde woosi.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Barifalisi bamiitehele Yisu mweto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:1-10">Mlk 10.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">Mty 5.31-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Bu Yisu hamani ulongese, nde amati hu Ngalili, na ayeni hu tsi a Yude yi yili hu simu lina la Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Koonge a baatu yaakaduukala nde, na nde abeelusi babeedu. <verse eid="MAT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Kabu li Bafarisi baayidi huli Yisu mu utehele nde mweto na baafuuli nde: «Baava muswa huli mulumi mu ubinga mukadi a nde mu pasi tooni?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yisu afutili: «Benu kini a laataanga mambu ma baasonehe mu Libuuku ve ti “ŋa mbandu, Nzambi avangi bahala na mukaasu”, <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />titswene nde aleeli: “Ni mu buuna bahala sa lisiisa taata a nde na ngu a nde, na ukangama na mukadi a nde, bo baboole sa bakituha <char style="w">Nyutu</char> mosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Mba 2.24</ref></char></note>”. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Ni mu buuna, bo a basaali boole ve, ka ndulu nyutu mosi. Ni mu buuna, muutu aveletahula ba Nzambi hamiipfuuta.» <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Bafarisi baafuuli nde: «Ka mu hima Moose haviidi muswa huli bahala mu uva muhanda a ndubili makwele huli mukadi a nde, bu nde amibinga mukadi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Pfu 24.1</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yisu afutili bo: «Moose haviidi benu muswa mu ubinga bakadi ba benu, mu tooni mitima mya benu mi minono. Ka hu mbandu a hwaba buuna ve. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Na me ndeele benu: Pasi muutu wu ubinga mukadi a nde tso a ni mu tooni bumbembo ve, na bwekwele mukima, nde miisa mayamba.»<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Bayihi ba nde baleeli nde: «Tso ni buuna bahala lafwana mu usa ŋa busu bu mukadi a nde, bubwe hwa nde mu uvelekwele.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yisu afutili bo: «Baatu boosi utwala usiinga ndongisili mo yiniiyi ve. Ka ndulu ba Nzambi hamiiva bungodu mo buuna. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Bamosi baavelekwele mu tooni ipiha hi imbutala-ngu. Bakima baavelekwele, mu tooni ati baamiimasa bo mabuta. Bakima kaka baavelekwele, mu tooni ipfumu hi mayulu. Nyaha muutu wu utwala usiinga ndongisili mo yiniiyi, asiinga yo!»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu usyeme baana ba bikenyi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mlk 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Hu mbisa, baatu baabehili Yisu baana, mana nde asuusala bo myoho na usambila mu bo. Ka bayihi baasyembi baatu mo baana. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli: «Nyahaani baana baya huli me, na a liliha bo ve, mu tooni ati, Ipfumu hi mayulu hili hya boosi ba bali we bo.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Nde asuusili bo myoho, na nde amati ŋaana.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Busina na Ipfumu hi mayulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:13-31">Mlk 10.13-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Bahala limosi laayasusaha ŋa pedu a Yisu na ufuula nde: «Mulongisi, hima me apfwana usa lilibwe mana me mbaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yisu ni ufutala nde: «Mu hima we li mu uva me byuhu mu mambu ma mabwe? Ndulu mumosi li wu mubwe. Tso we toondi ukoto hu moonyi, keelese matumili.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Bahala laafuuli: «Ki matumili?» Yisu afutili nde: «A duba ve, a sa mayamba ve, a yiba ve, a tiila imbangi hi mapfuta mu muutu ve. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Kiinza taata a we na ngu a we, tondo muna a we, we we mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Pal 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Pfu 5.16-20</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Mupfudu-mbahala ni uleele nde: «Me atsiingili matumili mo maana moosi. Hima me apfwana ubwe sa?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yisu afutili nde: «Tso we toondi uba wu asupaha, yene, yasumbasa byosi bi we li na byo na va mbongo yi we ubaha huli biyaha, na we ubaha busina hu mayulu. Titswene yaanga, duukala me.» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ka humbisa uyuha mambu mo maana, mufudu mbahala ayeni na lingebe, mu tooni ati, nde aba na busina bu bulahi.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Mumbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, hu li pasi mu bisina mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hi mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Me ndi mu umbwendeele benu buunubu: Hwafulala uleenge huli buuru nga irunga mu uvyoho ŋa vulu la tsongi, ka a huli isina mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Bu bayihi baayuhi buuna, bo baasinzikimuha na baaleeli: «Buuna, ka na utwala uyoboho?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yisu atali bo na aleeli: «Huli baatu, myo utwala uvangama ve. Ka huli Nzambi, mambu moosi mu baavangama.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Buuna Peetelo ni uleele nde: «Ka uto ti bisu, bisu laamiisiisa byosi mu uduukala we. Buni huuba mu bisu?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Mumbuli, me ndi mu undeele benu: Ŋa Mwana a muutu hukatuma ŋa kiti a nde yi ipfumu yi muyusu mu tsi yi nyatihi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7.14</ref></char></note>, benu ba laaduukili me, benu kaka sa libaatuma ŋa makiti kuumi na moole mu utsundasa bibandu kuumi na byole bi Isereli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Na pasi muutu wu usiisa manzo ma nde mu tooni a me, baana ba ngu a nde, bakedi ba nde, taata a nde buuve ngu a nde, baana ba nde, mangundu ma nde, sa ayaka kaluha kama (100) ŋa yulu, na sa abaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Ka baatu ba balahi ba bali batsomi, sa baba batsukusu, na baatu ba bali batsukusu sa baba batsomi.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Basalili mutso a ngundu a vinye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Eye, Ipfumu hi mayulu hili bunuubu: Mukuutu a nzo mumosi apali ŋa ngwali mu uvolo basali mu ngundu a nde ya vinye. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Nde ayuhisini na basali mu pfuta a bo yi likuta limosi la mbongo mu ilumbu, na nde a tsindihi bo hutso a ngundu a nde ya vinye. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Bebele na ngunga yi ipfwa ya ŋa ngwali, nde abwepala, na nde amoni baatu bakima ba baaba ŋaana, hwavele isalu. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Nde aleeli bo: “Yenaani benu kaka hu ngundu a me ya vinye, na me tsa pa benu pfuta yi yafwana.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Na bo baayeni huuna. Mukuutu a ngundu abwepala mu mwangulu, titswene bebele a ngunga yi matatu hu mbisa a mwangulu, nde asiidi bumosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Titswene, hu pedu a ngunga yi mataanu ya tsitsaha, nde apali, na abiisi baatu bakima baaba ŋaana. Nde afuuli bo: “Mu hima benu lili ŋaniiŋa ilumbu hyoosi hwavele usa isiha?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bo baafutili: “Mu tooni ati pasi muutu a havolo bisu mu isalu ve.” Nde aleeli bo: “benu kaka yenaani hu ngundu a me ya vinye.”<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Tsitsaha bu yaatoodi, mukuutu a ngundu aleeli mutumi bisalu: “Teele basali na futa bo muutu muutu. We baandiha mu ba baavoli ba tsyelele, na we mana mu ba baavoli batsomi.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Ba Baabandihi usala mu taangu yi mataanu ya tsitsaha, baayidi na baayaki pasi muutu likuta limosi la mbongo. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Bu taangu a ba baavoli tsomi yaatoodi, bo baakatsima ti bo buuyaka pfuta yi yaalutahala. Ka baaviidi bo kaka pasi muutu, likuta limosi la mbongo. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ŋa bo baakayaka lo, bo baakakusa nga ngundu, <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />na bo baakaleele: “Basali mo ba bavoli tsyelele basali ndulu ngunga mosi, na we miifuta bo we bisu ba limiikunda isalu hya ngolo muyilala woosi na ibabudu hya nyangu!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Ka mukuutu a ngundu afutili huli mumosi mu bo: “Mbaahi a me, me a handi mu utsa we bubi ve. Bisu a we laayuhisini ti, me tsa pfuta we talu likuta limosi la mbongo mu isalu hi ilumbu; a ni buuna ve? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Bunuubu, ni volo pfuta la we na yene. Me toondi uva huli musalili wu misala tsyelele, pfuta mosi we yi me piidi we. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Me a handi na muswa mu usa bu me toondi mu mbongo a me ve? Buuve we nyengi bu me ndi mu upaanga ma mabwe?”» <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yisu abweleele: «Babali ba tsyelele sa baba batsomi, na babali batsomi sa baba ba tsyelele.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyabisa lipfu la nde na tsuuhili a nde mu babaakwa, yabisa li mutatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:30-45">Mlk 10.30-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Yisu akayene hu Yeruselemi, nde avoli bayihi ba nde bakuumi na boole ŋa muvanga, na mu nzila nde aleeli bo: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Yuhaani, bisu a benu lika mu ukumasa hu Yeruselemi, hu buuyeholo Mwana a Muutu huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na huli milongisi mi Mikele. Bo sa bakotese nde kondaayi yi lipfu. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Na sa bayeholo nde huli bangoyi, mana bo bakwede nde, bafwinza nde bikooti, na ukomene nde ŋa muti a kurwa. Na nde sa asuuha mu babaakwa mu ilumbu hi bitatu.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pondili a ngu a Yaki na Yowani huli Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Hu mbisa, mukadi a Zebedayi hayasusaha ŋa pedu a Yisu na baana ba nde boole ba babahala, nde ni ukogemene ŋa busu bwa nde mu uvondo nde isiha imosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yisu ni ufuula nde: «We hima toondi?» Mukadi a Zebedayi afutili: «Sa me lahi ti baana ba me baboole ba babahala baniiba batsahala, mumosi ŋa mbahala a we, wuna ŋa kaasu a we, ŋa we uba mutumi.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yisu ni ufutala: «Benu a liyaabi hima benu lili mu uvondo me ve. Benu utwala unywa mbuungu mapasi yi me unywa?» Bo kaka ni ufutala nde ti: «Bisu utwala.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yisu aleeli bo ti: «Eye, benu sa linywa mbuungu a me. Ka mu li utsahala ŋa mbahala na ŋa kaasu a me, a me undeele ve. Mambuha mo maana mali ma baatu ba Taata a me hamiivangila mo.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ŋa bayihi kuumi bakima baayuhi buuna, bo baadasuhili baana ba ngu baboole bana. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Buuna, Yisu ateeli bo boosi na aleeli: «Benu liyaabi lo. Batumi ba matsi, bubaatuma baatu ba bo na matwala. Na bapfumu bubaanangimana baatu. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ka a huba bumosi ŋa hati la benu ve. Woosi wu toondi uba mukuutu ŋa hati la benu sa aba musalili a benu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Na woosi wu toondi uba watsomi ŋa hati la benu sa aba muviha a benu: <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Ni mu buuna, Mwana a Muutu a haaya mana basalila nde ve, ka mana nde asalila na uva muvumu a nde we kodi mu uyobolo ba balahi.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso binzimana byole hu Yeriko</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mlk 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Bu bo baapali mu musyenge a Yeriko, koonge yinene ya baatu yaduukili Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Binzimana byole byaaba byatsahala ŋa muvanga a nzila. Bo baayuhi ti Yisu aba mu uvyoho, binzimana byakafulaha: «Pfumu, Mwana a Davidi, Kwila bisu lingebe!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Baatu ba balahi baakapfubasa bo mana bo baba swii. Ka bo baabwefulaha: «Pfumu, Mwana a Davidi, kwila bisu lingebe!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yisu atsikimi, ateeli bo na afuuli bo: «Hima benu litoondi ti me tsiila benu?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bo baafutili nde: «Pfumu, miisu mya bisu midibuma!» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yisu akwili bo lingebe, na nde abeembi miisu mya bo. Masulubete, bo baabaandihi umono, na baaduukili nde.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kotili a Yisu hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mlk 11.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:18-44">Luk 19.18-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yow 12.12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Bu bo baaba bebele a Yeruselemi, na bo baatoodi ŋa Betefaze<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Betefaze </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bula bu buli hu Esete isyelo hi miti mya olive, mu litangu li bakilometere hoole mu uto hu Yeruselemi; </char><char style="fq" closed="false">isyelo hi miti mya olive </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni ikuundala hi hili hu Esete a Yeruselemi; ŋa hati hu li na mbeenge a Kederoni.</char></note>, hu tsyelo isyelo hi miti mya olive, Yisu atsindihi bayihi boole, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />na aleeli bo: «Yenaani hu bula bu buli hu busu bwa benu. Benu sa limono ibubuuru na mwana ibubuuru baakutala. Nyangulaani byo na behelaani me byo. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Tso muutu leeli benu pasi dyambu, futalaani nde bu: “Pfumu li na nzala a byo.” Na masubete, muutu sa anyaha byo biyene.» <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Buuna bwavangimi, mana mambu ma mumbihuli matswiha:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«Leelaani huli nuumba a Syoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nuumba a Syoni </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baatu ba Yeruselemi.</char></note>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Mono, mutumi a we aka muuya huli we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">wu aluula na bulembo, avaata ŋa yulu a buuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">ŋa yulu ibubuuru, mwana a buuru wu mukadi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9.9</ref></char></note>».<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Bayihi baayeni na baasiidi we bu Yisu haatumi bo. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bo baabehi buuru wu mukadi na ibubuuru, bo baasuusi ŋa yulu a byo bi byole, bikutu bya bo na baatsahisi Yisu ŋa yulu a ibubuuru. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Koonge a baatu yaayali biyunga bya bo mu nzila. Bakima baakesi mangemvu, na baakasuusa mo mu nzila<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:13">2Pf 9.13</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Baatu ba baakayene ŋa busu bwa Yisu na ba baakaduukala nde, baakafulaha: «Osana, Mwana a Davidi! Nyaha Nzambi asyeme nde wuuna wu miiya mu nduhi a Pfumu! Osana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Osana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili ni ti: «Yaanga hu likumbasa la bisu» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Mkg 118.25</ref></char>) dyambu mo liniili aka dyambu la kinya, na ileele hi muyusu.</char></note>, hu hati mayulu!»<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ŋa Yisu haakoti hu Yeruselemi, musyenge woosi anyingimi na baakaleele: «Wunuuwu na ali?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Koonge a baatu ba baakayene na Yisu, baafutili: «Nde ni Yisu mumbihuli, musi Nazareti hu Ngalili.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibingisa banga mafwanda ba mu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mlk 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-17">Yow 2.13-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yisu akoti mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, nde abingisi basuumbisi na basuumbi boosi babaaba mu nzo a Nzambi, nde atakuli metse ma ba baakasa sanzi na mambuha ma basuumbisi ba mabembe. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Titswene nde aleeli bo: «Baasonehe: “Nzo a me sa bateele yo nzo lisambulu.” Ka benu lamiikitusa yo murali a biibi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esa 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yel 7.11</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Binzimana na banga matsode, baayasusaha huli Yisu mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi, na nde abeelusi bo. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Ka bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele, baamoni bubi mu bimangu bi nde hasiidi, na baana ba bangebe baakafulaha mu litandala la nzo a Nzambi: «Osana! Muyusu huli Mwana a Davidi!» <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Bo baaleeli Yisu: «We li mu uyuha ma bo bali mu uleele?» Yisu afutili bo: «Eye, benu kini a laataangi mambu mo maniima ve: “We asiidi ti tso bangebe, bikenyi bayuusa we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:3">Mkg 8.3</ref></char></note>”?» <verse eid="MAT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Titswene, nde asiisi bo na apali mu musyenge mu uyene hu Betanya hu nde haavyosi butsuhu.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miisyembe muti a fiinge</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mlk 11.12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Ŋa ngwali, mu taangu yi Yisu haaba mu ufutaha hu musyenge, nzala yaakaangi nde. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Nde amoni mufiinge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mufiinge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">muti wu ubaabuta mbuutu yi bubaateele ti bafiinge.</char></note> mumosi ŋa muvanga a nzila, nde ayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde, nde amoni ndulu makaya na makaya. Buuna, nde aleeli huli muti: «We a hukaabwebuta libutu tso limosi ve!» Masulubete, mufiinge akanyi. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Bayihi bamono buuna, baakimuhi na baafuuli Yisu: «Buni mufiinge mo wunuuwu amiikanya mawasa mo maniima?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yisu afutili bo: «Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, tso benu lili na imiinu na benu livelisa paha, benu a luusa ndulu mambu ma me miitsa mu mufiinge ve, ka benu utwala utuma isyelo mo hiniihi: “Mata ŋaana, na yabwa hutso mubu”, na buuna sa buvangama. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Tso benu lili mu usa imiinu, benu luuyaka byosi bi benu luuvondo mu lisambulu.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lituma la Yisu huni laamati?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mlk 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yisu ayeni hu nzo a Nzambi, na abaandihi ulongese. Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na bakuutu ba Bayudaayo baayasusaha bebele na baafuuli nde: «Muki lituma we ubaavanga mambu mo maniima, na ava we muswaa mu mo?»<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yisu afutili bo: «Me kaka maapa benu ndulu idoodo imosi. Na tso benu liviidi me mvutu, me tsa ndeele benu muki lituma me umbapaanga mambu mo maniima. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Tondihili a Yowani huni yaamati? Hu yulu vo huli baatu?» Ka bo baalelisini: «Bisu lileele ti: “Hu yulu”, nde sa afuula bisu: “Ka mu hima benu laavelisiila Yowani imiinu?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Na bisu a benu lifutalaani ti: “Huli baatu”, bisu a benu lafwana ubata boomo bwa koonge a baatu, mu tooni ati, baatu boosi ubaatsima ti Yowani aba mumbihuli.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Buuna, bo baafutili huli Yisu: «Bisu a liyaabi ve.» Na nde kaka aleeli bo: «Me kaka, me a ndeele benu mu ki lituma me umbapaanga maniima ve.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuma a baana boole ba babahala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yisu abweleele: «Benu buni lili mu utsima mu kuma mo yiiniyi? Bahala limosi laaba na baana boole ba babahala. Nde a matuma watsomi na aleeli: “Mwana a me, yasala lolo hu ngundu a me ya vinye.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Nde afutili: “Naana, me mbisi hwa me,” ka hu mbisa, nde asobi matsimi na ayeni hu ngundu a vinye. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Taata abwetuma waboole, na abweleele bumosi. Nde wunuuwu afutili: “Eye, taata, me aka mu dwe huuna,” ka nde a hayeni huuna ve. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Na, mu baboole asiidi litondo la taata a nde?» Bayihi baafutili: «Watsomi». Na Yisu aleeli bo: «Me undeele benu: ni imbuli, batsonzihi ba limandu na malaala bamiiteehele benu hu Ipfumu hya Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Mu tooni ati, Yowani mutondihi ayidi huli benu mu ulaha benu nzila yi butsiitsa, na benu a laasili nde imiinu ve. Ka batsonzihi ba limandu na malaala baasili nde imiinu. Na tso bu benu laamoni maana, benu a laasobo na usa imiinu mu nde ve.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuma basali ba mangundu ma vinye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mlk 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:1-9">Esa 5.1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yisu abweleele: «Yuhaani kuma kima: hwaba na pfumu a nzo mosi wu akuni ngundu yi miti mya vinye. Nde adiingi yo muumbu, nde avahi inyihili hya mbutu a vinye, na atuungi nzo yi mutaabu mu bakeedi. Titswene, nde asiisi ngundu huli basali ba mangundu ma vinye, na nde ayeni hu mudyenge. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Bu taangu yi utsonzehe mbutu a vinye yatoodi, nga ngundu atsindihi basalili ba nde huli basali ba ngundu a vinye mana bo bava la nde kabu li muhunu a ngundu. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Ka basali ba ngundu a vinye baakaangi basalili mo baana, baabeeti mumosi, baadubi wuna na baalangi wu mutatu mu mamanya mu uduba nde. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Buuna pfumu a ngundu a vinye atsindihi basali bakima ba baalutili batsomi mu bulahi. Ka basali ba ngundu baasiidi bo kaka we bu baasiidi batsomi. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Hu tsukusu, nde atsindihi bo mwana a nde wa bahala, bu nde hatsimi ti: “Bo sa baakiinza mwana a me wa bahala.” <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Ka bu basali ba ngundu a vinye baamoni mwana a nga ngundu, bo baalelisini bo mo na bo mo: “Nde wu mbadi ni wu ubyalila mukobe! Tswendaani lidubaani nde, na bisu a benu sa libahaani mukobe a nde!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Buuna, bo baakaangi nde na baabumi nde hu mbadi a ngundu a vinye na baadubi nde.»<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Titswene, Yisu afuuli bo: «Ŋa pfumu a ngundu a vinye huuya, nde hima huusa mu basali ba ngundu a vinye mo baana?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Bo baafutili nde: «Nde sa aduba bitsuuya mo biina hwavele lingebe la bo, na sa asoombese ngundu a nde a vinye huli basali bakima ba buukaava nde mbutu mu taangu yi yafwana.»<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Titswene, Yisu aleeli bo: «Benu a laamaataanga dyambu mo liniili mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi ve?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">“Manya li batuungi baabumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">laaka manya la talu li itungu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">Pfumu ni wu asa buuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">na lo ni dyambu la kimuhili ŋa miisu ma bisu!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Mkg 118.22-23</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yisu abweleele: «Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu undeele benu ti sa bapatula benu Ipfumu hya Nzambi, na sa bava hyo huli baatu ba bukabaabutasa hyo mbutu. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />Pasi nde wu ubwa ŋa yulu a manya mo liina sa asumbaha, na tso lo libwidi ŋa yulu a muutu, lo sa lihesolo nde.]»<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na Bafarisi bu baayuhi makuma ma Yisu, baatsikihi ti nde mu bo haakatoyo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Buuna, bo baakasaha manzila ma ukaanga nde, ka bo baabati boomo bwa koonge a baatu ba baakamono Yisu we mumbihuli.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Kuma a ilaambu hiinene hi makwele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luk 14.15-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yisu abwesalila makuma mu yambila na bo. Nde aleeli: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina we mutumi mumosi wu asiidi mukungi makwele ma mwana a nde wa bahala. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Nde atsindihi basalili ba nde mu uyateele ba baatsihi hu mukungi makwele, ka bo a baasiingi uya ve. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Na nde abwetsindaha basalili bakima na tumili mo yiniiyi: “Yaleelaani huli ba baatsiha: Buunubu, ilaambu hya me hyamiivangama, bangombe ba me, na bibulu bya me bya maadi baamiiduba, byosi byamiivangama. Yaani hu makwele!” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Ka ba baatsihi baapenyi dyambu mo liina, na baayeni hu bisalu bya bo bikima: mumosi hu ngundu a nde, wuna hu mumbungu a nde; <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />bakima baakaangi basalili, baasiidi bo bubi na baadubi bo. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Buuna, mutumi abahi kesi: nde atsindihi masadaadu ma nde mu uyaduba badubi mo baana na utsuha musyenge a bo. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Titswene, nde aleeli basalili ba nde: “Ilaambu hi makwele hyamiivangama, ka ba baatsiha a baahwama mu udya hyo ve. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Yenaani mu manzila ma maayabahana na teelaani hu mukungi baatu boosi ba benu luumono.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Basalili baayeni mu manzila na baakuungi boosi ba bo baamoni, ba babi na ba babwe, na nzo mukungi yaaluuli mu baatu. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Mutumi akoti mu umono ba baatsihi. Mutumi amoni hutso a bo bahala limosi li laaveeli na mulwatu a nde wu mukungi makwele. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Nde afuuli bahala: “Mbaahi a me, buni we siidi mu ukoto huni hwavele mulwatu a mukungi makwele?” Ka bahala mo a laabahi dyambu li uleele ve. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Buuna, mutumi aleeli huli basalili ba nde: “Hadaani nde miilu na myoho na bwahaani nde hu mbadi, hutso a piipidi, ni huuna nde huuba mu ulila na ubaakwete miinyu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Mu mbuli, ba balahi bali ba baatsiha, ka ndulu hoole bamiisoolo».<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Limandu la Kayisaali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mlk 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:13">Yob 5.13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Buuna, Bafarisi baayeni hu uyasa pfuundu mu usaha buni buutehele Yisu mweto mu mambu ma nde. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Titswene, bo baatsindihi huli Yisu mwa litangu li bayihi ba Bafarisi na mwana a baatu ba kabu la Eloode, mu uyayebe nde mu mikuma mi nde haakiipalisa. Bu bo baayidi, bo baleeli nde: «Mulongisi, bisu liyaabi ti we nga imbuli; we li mu ulongese nzila a Nzambi mu imbuli hyoosi. We a hali na boomo bwa muutu tso mumosi ve, na we a hali na buraandu ve. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Bunuubu, leele bisu matsimi ma we mu dyambu mo liniili: Baava muswa mu ufuta limandu huli Kayisaali?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Ka bu Yisu haaba haayaba dyeele la bo, nde akaali: «Banga muwala, mu hima benu lili mu utehele me mweto? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Mwesaani me likuta limosi la mbongo li bubaasalila mu ufuta limandu.» Bo baamweesi nde likuta limosi la mbongo, <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />na Yisu afuuli bo: «Hiinzi na bisono mo biniibi bya na?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bo baafutili ti bya «Kayisaali.» Buuna, Yisu aleeli bo: «A ka! Futalaani huli Kayisaali bya Kayisaali, na huli Nzambi bya Nzambi.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Bu bo baayuhi mvutu mo yiina, bo baakimuhi. Bo baasiisi Yisu na baayeni.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyuhu mu tooni a</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:18-29">Mlk 12.18-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 3:7-9">2Ti 3.7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Ilumbu ndulu ni hiina, Basaduki baayidi huli Yisu. Ni bo bali mu usilasa ti a yili ve. Bo baafuuli nde <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />bunuubu: «Mulongisi, Moose asiisa bisu mukele ti “tso bahala lili na mwana a ngu, lo limiikwa na lisiisi mukadi a nde wu avele na mwana, mwana a ngu mo wuuna afwana ukwele mukwili mana nde abutala wu akwa baana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Pfu 25.5-6</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Kaahu, ŋa hati la bisu hwaba na baana ba ngu tsambu ba babahala. Watsomi akweli mukaasu na akwiidi hwavele usiisa imbisa. Na asiisi mukwili huli mwana a ngu a nde wa bahala. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Hwaba bumosi kaka mu waboole, na mu wu mutatu, natee mu bo batsambu boosi. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Hu mbisa a bo boosi, mukaasu kaka akwiidi. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Mu ilumbu hya tsuuhili a babaakwa, mu batsambu baana, mukadi mo wuuna wa na huuba? Mu tooni ati, bo boosi baakweli nde!»<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yisu akaali bo: «Benu laamiidunga, mu tooni ati, benu a lili mu utsikaha tso Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, tso matwala ma Nzambi ve. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Mu mbuli, ŋa babaakwa buusuuha, babahala na bakaasu a buubwekwelesene ve, ka bo buuba we bapofi hu yulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Mu li litali tsuuhili a babakwa, benu a laataanga ma Nzambi haaleele benu ve? <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“Me, me ndi Nzambi a Abrahami, Nzambi a Isaki na Nzambi a Yakobi!” Nzambi a hali Nzambi a babaakwa ve, ka Nzambi a ba bali moonyi.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Koonge a baatu ba baakayuha baakimuhi mu tooni a ndongisili a Yisu.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukele wu afulala bunene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mlk 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-37">Luk 10.25-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Bu Bafarisi baayuhi ti Yisu adibuhi Basaduki minywa, bo baakuukimi. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Na mumosi mu bo, mulongisi Mikele, atondi utehele Yisu mweto, na afuuli nde: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />Mulongisi, «Ki tumili yi Mikele yi yaafulala mu bunene?»<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yisu afutili nde: «“We afwana utondo Pfumu Nzambi a we mu mutima a we woosi, mu muvumu a we woosi na mu buyedi bwa we bwosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Pfu 6.5</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Yiina ni tumili yatsomi na yi yaafulala bunene. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Ya moole yi yafwanina na yo, ni yiniiyi: “Tondo muna a we, we we mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Mikele mya Moose myosi na ndongisili mimbihuli, byakangama mu matumili mo mamoole maniima.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya Mwana a na ali?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mlk 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Bu Bafarisi baaba baakuukama, Yisu aviidi bo hyuhu mo hiniihi: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Benu buni libaatsima mu Masiya? Nde mwana a na ali?» Bo baafutili nde: «Nde wu imbisa hya Davidi ali.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Ka buni Davidi nde mwakulu hutso Livupu la Ngidi, haateeli nde “Pfumu”? Mu tooni ati Davidi aleeli:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />“Pfumu miileele huli Pfumu a me:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">Tsahala ŋa mbahala a me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">natee bu me utsuusa baboho ba we,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">hu tsina a miilu mya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Ka tso Davidi li mu uteele nde “Pfumu”, buni Masiya huutwala uba mwana a nde?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />A hu li tso mumosi mu bo, wu atwali ubakula ve, na muutu tso mumosi a haabwebila uva nde byuhu ve.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miisuungaha dyatili milongisi mi Mikele na yi Bafarisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mlk 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:7">14.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli huli koonge a baatu yoosi na huli bayihi ba nde ti: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Isalu hi milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi, ni ulongese na ubindula Mikele mya Moose. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Benu laafwana usiingala bo na uvaanga moosi ma bo bali mu uleele. Ka a lidyata we bu hu li mavaanga ma bo ve. Bo a bubaasalila ma bo bubaalongese ve. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bo bubaakuta mipfuna mi myaleme mi mili na pasi mu ubita, na bubaakwiha bana myo mu yulu bisambaha. Ka bo mwakulu bali mu ubisa ubembe myo tso mu mulembo mumosi. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Bo bubaakuhasa mavaanga ma bo moosi mu tooni umonehele ŋa miisu ma baatu. Ni mu buuna, mu taangu lisambulu, bo bubaakuta bisupu bi baasonehe mambu ma Ngidi mu mambalanga na mu myoho. Matsoso ma biyunga bya bo, mali ma maalutahala bunene<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:38-41">Mat 15.38-41</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Bo bubaatondo mambuha ma muyusu mu mikungi mi udya miminene, na utsahala mu makiti ma busu mu manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Bo baatondo kaka ti ba baabila bo mu matandala ma mikungi na ba baateele bo “Rabi, Rabi”.<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Ka benu, a lisiinga ve ti baateele benu “Rabi”, mu tooni ati, benu lili ndulu na mulongisi mumosi, na benu boosi lili baana ba ngu. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />A liteele pasi muutu ŋa toto “taata” a benu ve, mu tooni ati, benu lili na Taata ndulu mumosi, wu li hu mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />A lisiinga ve ti baateele benu “basuungihi”, mu tooni ati benu lili na musuungihi ndulu mumosi, ni Kristo. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Woosi wu li mukuutu ŋa hati la benu, afwana uba musalili a benu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Woosi wu usyenoho mu nde mwakulu, sa bakulamasa. Ka woosi wu ukulamana mu nde mwakulu, sa basyenolo.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miisaangula muwala milongisi mi Mikele na wu Bafarisi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mlk 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luk 11.43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">20.45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Yisu aleeli: «Ki pila lingebe huli benu milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi banga muwala! Mu tooni ati, benu libaadibuha munywa a nzo wu Ipfumu hi mayulu huli bakima. Benu mwakulu a lili mu ukoto mu hyo ve, na benu a lili mu uvyoso ba bali na nzala ukoto ve.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 23:13">[<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Ki pila lingebe huli benu milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi banga muwala! Mu tooni ati, benu libaataana manzo ma bakwili ba bakaasu. Benu libaasa masambulu ma mala, mu usaha umonehele. Benu sa liyaka tsundusu yi yaafulala bunono.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Ki pila lingebe huli benu milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi banga muwala! Mu tooni ati, benu lili mu utaangila toto yoosi na mubu woosi mu usaha ubaha tso muutu mumosi wu ukiingula buyedi. Na bu benu limiibaha nde, benu libaakitusa nde mwana a mbungulu, wu alutahala benu ndutahala yoole mu bubi.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Ki pila lingebe huli benu, babiti ba balili binzimana! Ba lili mu uleele: “Tso muutu labi mulabu mu nzo a Nzambi, mulabu mo wuuna a haali na kaluha ve. Ka tso nde labi mulabu mu wolo la mu nzo a Nzambi, nde afwana ukiinza mulabu a nde.” <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Ki pila butsuudu na ki pila bunzimana! Hima hyalutahala tsoongo: wolo, vo ti nzo a Nzambi yi yibaava wolo mo liina bungidi? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Benu libaabweleele ti, tso muutu labi mulabu mu diiku la tsuhili bungodu, a hu li na kaluha ve. Ka tso nde labi mulabu mu bungodu bu buli ŋa yulu a diiku la tsuhili bungodu, nde afwana ukiinza mulabu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Ki pila bunzimana! Hima hyafulala tsoongo: bungodu, vo ti diiku li bungodu li libaava bungodu mo buuna bungidi? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Ni mu buuna, nde wuuna wu ulaba mulabu mu diiku la tsuhili bungodu, alaba kaka mu diiku la tsuhili bungodu na mu byosi bi bili ŋa yulu a lo. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Nde wuuna wu ulaba mulabu mu nzo a Nzambi, alaba kaka mu nzo a Nzambi na mu Nzambi wu atsahala muuna. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Nde wuuna wu ulaba mulabu mu yulu, alaba kaka mu kiti-ipfumu hya Nzambi, na mu nde wuuna wu atsahala ŋa yo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Esa 66.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Ki pila lingebe huli benu milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi banga muwala! Benu libaava huli Nzambi ikuuku imosi mu kuumi, hi misooso na makaya moosi ma benu libaakuna ma mu baava tsulu yimbwe mu byudya. Ka benu laamiitimba ndongisili yi Mikele yi yaalutahala tsoongo, we butsiitsa, bubwe na kangimini: maana ni mambu ma benu likiibaasalila, hwavele utiimba makima<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27.30</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:22">Pfu 14.22</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Benu babiti ba lili binzimana! Benu libaaleke malamu ma benu mu umaasa ipfudu, ka benu libaamina buuru nga irunga!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Ki pila lingebe huli benu milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi banga muwala! Benu libaaswaha mu utsyemese imbadi hi mambuungu na bikoombe bya benu. Ka hutso mitima mya benu, hwaluula mu bisiha bi mayiba ma benu na mapeyu ma benu ma mabi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Mufarisi wu inzimana! Maatswamina utsyemese hati la mbuungu, buuna imbadi hya yo kaka sa hitsyeme.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Ki pila lingebe huli benu milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi banga muwala! Benu lili we mangila ma mafuuka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mangila ma bisu Palesitini aba baakila mwindu wu mufuuka, mu ukala baatu mu ubelehene mo mu iliba ŋa butsuhu, na uvelekoto mu matumili ma tsyemili. </char></note>, ma mu baamonehele na imbadi hi ibwe, na ma maaluula mu mavisi ma bamvumbi na bi byaveletsyeme bya pila mu pila. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Bumosi kaka mu benu, ŋa busu bwa baatu, benu libaamonehele ti benu libaasa litondo la Nzambi. Ka hu hati a benu, benu laaluula mu muwala na mu idiingu hi hyavele na mikele.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Ki pila lingebe huli benu milongisi mi Mikele na Bafarisi banga muwala! Mu tooni ati, benu libaatuungala mimbihuli mangila ma mabwe, na libaayolo mangila ma baatu ba baasiidi litondo la Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />Na benu libaaleele ti, tso bisu laaba mu taangu bakaaha ba bisu, kini bisu a laakiikuta pfuundu na bo mu uduba mimbihuli ve. <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Na ni buuna, benu libaatiila benu mwakulu imbangi hi hyumweese ti benu ni imbisa hya ba baadubi mimbihuli. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Ni mu buuna, hwadaani na manisalaani isalu hi bakaaha ba benu baabaandihi. <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Benu bataadi, ibaandu hi bapili! Buni benu libaatsima upeke tsyembili a mbungulu?<verse eid="MAT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ni mu buuna, yuhaani: me ndi mu utsindaha benu mimbihuli, banga tsiki na milongisi mi Musamu wu Mubwe. Benu sa liduba bamosi, na benu sa likomene bakima tsooso ŋa muti. Benu sa lifwiinza bakima kaka bikooti mu manzo ma lisambulu li Bayudaayo ma benu, na benu sa litsuta bo mu pasi musyenge wu bo buuyene. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Ni mu buuna, benu luuyaka tsyembili a ba baadubi baatu boosi ba baasungama umata lipfu la Abeli, muutu wa tsiitsa natee lipfu la Zakariya mwana a Baraki. Zakariya wu benu laadubi ŋa taha a nzo a Nzambi na diiku la tsuhili bungodu. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu: ni baatu ba tuungi mo liniili buuyaka tsyembili ya ba baadubi baatu mo baana!»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miilila mu tooni a Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 13:33-35">Luk 13.33-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />Yisu abweleele: «Yeruselemi, we musyenge a Yeruselemi, we wu ubaaduba mimbihuli na uduba baatu ba Nzambi ali mu utsindaha we, mu ndangili mamanya! Mu mana kwe me tondi ukuukaha baatu ba we huli me, we bu tsusu ubaakuukaha baana ba nde hu tsina mapapi ma nde, ka benu a laatondi buuna ve! <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Ni mu buuna, nzo a benu sa yisaala siha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Yel 22.5</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Mu mbuli, me ndi mu undeele benu, benu a luubwemono me ve, natee mu taangu yi benu luuleele ti: “Nyaha Nzambi asyeme nde wuuna wu li mu uya mu nduhi a Pfumu!”»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mandongisili ma tsyelele ma Yisu huli bayihi ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24-25">24–25</ref></para>
  <para style="s2">Yisu miiyabisa utsala hwa nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mlk 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yisu apala hu nzo a Nzambi, na bu nde haakayene, bayihi ba nde baayasusaha huli nde na baamweesi nde buni baatuungi nzo a Nzambi yinene. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Ka Yisu afutili bo: «Benu lili mu umono bunene bwa nzo mo yiniiyi? Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, a huusaala ŋaniiŋa tso manya ŋa yulu a manya ve: byosi sa batsala.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mbandihili yi mapasi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mlk 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Yisu aba atsahala hu yulu isyelo hi miti mya Olive. Bayihi ba nde baayasusaha huli nde na ufuula nde ŋa muvanga: «Leele bisu ki taangu mambu mo maana muutswiha? Ki iliimbu hyuyabisa ti maana moosi muusuka?» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yisu afutili bo: «Keebaani muutu a hadungasa benu.» <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Mu tooni ati, ba balahi sa baya mu nduhi a me na ubaaleele: «Me ni Masiya!» Bo sa badungasa baatu ba balahi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Ŋa benu luuyuha mu utoyo mu midiingu, na batsyetsye ba midiingu, a liba na boomo ve. Maana maafwana uvangama. A yumaaba tsukusu ve. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Tsi mosi sa yitelemene tsi yina, na ipfumu sa hitelemene ipfumu hina. Mu mambuha ma pila mu pila, toto sa yinyingama na limbunga sa liba. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Biliimbu mo biina byosi, sa biba we mbandihili misoongo mya mbutili. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Buuna sa bayeholo benu mu unyongese benu, na sa baduba benu. Mabuli moosi sa mabelele benu mu tooni a nduhi a me. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Mu taangu mo yiina, ba balahi sa batiimba imiinu hya bo. Bo sa batatasana, na sa babelesene. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Mimbihuli mi milahi mi mapfuta sa miteleme na sa midungasa baatu ba balahi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Mu tooni a mambu ma mabi ma muufulala, litondo la baatu ba balahi sa livolo. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Ka wuuna wu uhwada natee hu tsukusu, sa afuuha. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Musamu wu Mubwe wu Ipfumu wunuuwu, sa bayabisa nde mu toto yoosi, mana nde aba imbangi huli mabuli moosi. Na buuna, sa buba tsukusu.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsisu yi yaafulala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mlk 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />Yisu abweleele: «Ŋa benu luumono wu bali mu uteele ti “Musafuli wu Mutsali”, wu mumbihuli Danyeli haayambili mu nde, wu aba atsahala ŋa mbuha ya ngidi, nyaha wu li mu utaanga atsikaha mo bubwe! <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Buuna, ba buuba hu Yude, nyaha babata hu tsyelo bisyelo. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Woosi wu uba hu yulu ibaanga hya nzo a nde, avelesutaha mu uvolo isiha mutso a nzo. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Woosi wu uba hutso a ngundu a nde, avelefutaha hu nzo mu uvolo iyunga hya nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Ki pila lingebe luuba mu bakaasu banga mayimi, na mu ba buukaanwyasa baana mabeelo mu bilumbu mo biina! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Baasambilaani, mana mbatili a benu a yiyiila mu taangu a piyu yi mifudi, buuve mu ilumbu hya saba! <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Mu tooni ati, mu bilumbu mo biina, sa huba na tsisu yi yaafulala bunene na matsisu ma laabwani na mo, umata mbaandu a tsi, natee lolo yiniiyi. Tsisu ya pila mo yiina, a yiubweba ve. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Na tso Nzambi a haavoli kesili yi ukuka bilumbu ve, muutu tso mumosi a haakiifuuha ve. Ka nde haakuki bilumbu, mu tooni a ba nde haamiisoolo. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Ni mu buuna, tso muutu leeli benu ti: “Monwaani, Masiya ndyowunuuwu ŋaniiŋa!” Buuve ti: “Monwaani, ndyowunuuwu hunuuhu!” A lisiila nde imiinu ve. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Mu tooni ati, bakristo ba mapfuta na mimbihuli mi mapfuta buuteleme. Bo sa bavaanga biliimbu bya kimuhili na bimangu mu udungasa tso huyelimini, napa ba Nzambi haamiisoolo. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Yuhaani! Me amiikwanzibusa benu.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Ni mu buuna, tso muutu leeli benu ti: “Monwaani, nde hu kumu a nzala ali,” a liyene huuna ve. Buuve nde aleele benu ti: “Monwaani, nde ndyowunuuwu asweme ŋaniiŋa,” a lisiila nde hiitu ve. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Ni mu buuna, we bu muvedyavedi ubaamwedeme hu mayulu, umata hu nyangu ubaapala natee hu nde ubaadyama, ni buuna kaka buuba mu nziili a Mwana a muutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Ŋa mbuha yi yuuba mvumbi, ni ŋaana kaka bambida buukaakuukama.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Nziili ya Mwana a Muutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mlk 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />Yisu abweleele: «Masulubete, hu mbisa a tsisu yi bilumbu mo biina, taangu sa yikituha piipidi, tsuungi a huubweva mweede ve, bamvwelele buubwa umata hu mayulu, na matwala ma mali hu mayulu muunyingama. <verse eid="MAT 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Buuna, iliimbu hya Mwana a Muutu sa himonehele hu yulu. Mabuli moosi ma ŋa toto, sa maba hutso lingebe. Mo sa mamono Mwana a Muutu mu uya hutso mayidu na matwala na muyusu a nde woosi. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Kulambeete yinene sa bafula, nde sa atsindaha bapofi mu ukuukaha ba nde haamiisoolo mu bituungu bibina bya tsi, umata tsoso a toto natee tsoso mayulu.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma yi mufiinge</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mlk 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />Yisu abweleele: «Tsikahaani ndongisili a kuma yi mufiinge. Bu bitabi bya nde bimiikolo, na bu makaya ma nde mamiifula, benu limiiyaaba ti kwanga yaaka bebele. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Ni bumosi kaka huli benu, ŋa benu luumono misamu mo miniimi mu utswiha, yaabaani ti Mwana a Muutu aka bebele, ŋa munywa a nzo a benu. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Mu mbuli, me ndi mu undeele benu: tuungi mo liniili a luuvyoho ve, tswamina maana moosi matswiha. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Yulu na toto byuvyoho, ka mambu ma me a muuvyoho ve.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndulu Nzambi yaabi taangu a tsukusu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mlk 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17.26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />Yisu abweleele: «Mu ma mali mu utala ilumbu na ngunga yi mambu mo maana muutswiha, pasi muutu a hayaabi ve, tso bapofi hu yulu, tso Mwana kaka; ka ndulu Taata siha yaabi byo. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Mambu ma maabwidi mu taangu a Nowa, sa mavyoho bumosi kaka we mu bilumbu bya nziili a Mwana a Muutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Mu mbuli, mu bilumbu bi byateehili nyamba, baatu baakadya na baakanywa, baakakwele na baakakwelese baana ba bo, natee mu ilumbu hi Nowa haakoti mutso likuumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Na bo a baakayaaba li luuyiila bo ve, nyamba yaayidi na yaanyambisini bo boosi. Sa huba bumosi kaka mu ilumbu hya nziili a Mwana a Muutu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Buuna, mu baatu boole ba buuba mu ngundu: mumosi sa babita, na mukima sa basiisa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Bakaasu boole ba buuba mu unyiha mbutu mu inyihulu: mumosi sa babita, na mukima sa basiisa. <verse eid="MAT 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Buuna, baani likanda, mu tooni ati, benu a liyaabi ilumbu hi Pfumu a benu huuya ve. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Yaabaani lo bubwe, tso nga nzo ubaayaaba ki taangu yi butsuhu yi muyibi huuya, kini nde ubaaba likanda na uveleva nde nzila yi ukoto mu nzo a nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ni mu buuna benu kaka, baavangamaani, mu tooni ati, benu a liyaabi ki taangu Mwana a Muutu huuya ve.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Musalili wu mubwe buuve wu mubi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12.41-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />Yisu abweleele: «Ki musalili wu lili mu usiila hiitu na nga buyedi? Ni nde wuuna wu mukuutu a nde amiiva isalu hyubaava basalili bana byudya mu taangu yi yaafwana. <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Kinya yili na musalili mo wunuuwu, tso mukuutu mu pfutihili a nde, yabiisa nde mu usa isalu hi nde hasiila nde! <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Mu mbuli me ndeele benu, mukuutu sa ava nde lituma ŋa yulu bisiha bya nde byosi. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Ka tso nde li musalili wu mubi, wu ubaaleele hutso mutima a nde ti: “Mukuutu a me li mu utaamba mu uyaafutaha”, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />nde sa abaabeete bambaahi ba nde ba isalu, sa abaadya na ubaanywa na bikolo-mbungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Buuna mukuutu sa ayaafutaha mu ilumbu hi musalili haavelekeele nde, na mu taangu yi nde haaveleyaaba. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Nde sa abinga musalili mo wuuna, na uva nde tsyembili ya banga muwala, ni huuna huuba bililu na kwetili a minyu.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s2">Kuma yi banuumba kuumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Yisu abweleele: «Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina na banuumba kuumi, ba baaveleyaaba babahala, ba baavoli miinda mya bo, na baayeni hu uyabwana mulumi makwele. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Bataanu mu bo baaba bitsuudu, na bataanu bana baaba biyedi. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Banuumba ba butsuudu baavoli miinda mya bo, ka a baavoli maadi ve. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Ka banuumba ba buyedi baavoli miinda mya bo na maadi mutso bitutu. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Bu mulumi makwele haataambi mu uya, banuumba boosi baabahi tolo na baabwamini.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Hu hahati a busi, ibila imoosi hyaayuhini: “Monwaani mulumi makwele, yabwanaani nde!” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Buuna, banuumba bakuumi baasuuhi, na baavangimisi miinda mya bo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Banuumba ba butsuudu ni uleele huli banuumba ba buyedi: “Vaani bisu maadi mu tooni ati, miinda mya bisu myaka mu udima!” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Banuumba ba buyedi baafutili: “Naana, maadi a muukuha mu bisu na benu ve. Bubwe benu mu uyene huli ba bubaasumbasa mo, mana benu lisuumba ma benu.”<verse eid="MAT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Bu bo baayeni hu uyasuumba mo, mulumi makwele ayidi. Banuumba ba bataanu ba baaba baavangama, baakoti na nde mu nzo yi makweele, na baadibuhi munywa a nzo. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Hu mbisa, banuumba ba butsuudu baayidi, na baaleeli: “Pfumu, pfumu, dibula bisu munywa a nzo!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Ka mulumi makwele afutili bo: “Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, me a hanzaabi benu ve.” <verse eid="MAT 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Baani likanda, mu tooni ati, benu a liyaabi tso ilumbu, tso taangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tso ilumbu, tso taangu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabasonehe ma Ngidi makima, mali mu ubwese bunuubu «ya nziili a Mwana a muutu». </char></note> ve.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Kuma yi basalili batatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19.11-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Yisu aleeli: «Eye, Ipfumu hi mayulu hyafwanina na bahala limosi li laayeni mudyenge. Nde laateeli basalili ba nde, na laaviidi bo lituma ŋa yulu bisiha bya nde byosi. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Huli mumosi, nde aviidi makama mataanu (500) ma makuta ma wolo, huli mukima, makama moole (200) ma makuta, huli wu mutatu, kama (100) li makuta. Nde aviidi huli muutu muutu we bu hu li mifudi mya nde. Titswene nde ayeni mudyenge.<verse eid="MAT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Masulubete, wu ayaki makama mataanu ma makuta ma wolo, ayasa mumbungu mu mo, na nde abwebaha makama mataanu (500) makima ma makuta ma wolo. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Ni bumosi kaka, mu wu ayaki makama moole ma makuta, nde kaka abwebaha makama moole (200) ma makuta ŋa yulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Ka wu abahi kama li makuta, ayavaha iyuna, na aswehi mbongo a pfumu a nde.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Tangu yindahi yavyohi, pfumu basalili ayafutaha, nde atsihi basalili mo, mu usa itooki hya mbongo yi nde haasiisili bo. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Wu abahi makama mataanu ma makuta ma wolo, ayasusaha na abehi makama mataanu (500) ma makuta ŋa yulu. Nde aleeli: “Pfumu we aviidi me makama mataanu ma makuta ma wolo, me miimbaha makama mataanu (500) ma makuta ŋa yulu, mo maniima.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Pfumu a nde aleeli huli nde: “We siidi bubwe. Musalili wu mubwe na wu akangama! We li musalili wu buutwala usiila hiitu mu bisiha bya kaluha yi keehe. Ni mu buuna, me tsa pa we bi byafulala kaluha. Yaanga, yaaba mu kinya na me.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Musalili wu abahi makama moole (200) ma makuta, ayasusaha nde kaka, na aleeli: “Pfumu, we aviidi me makama moole (200) ma makuta ma wolo, me miimbaha makama moole (200) ma makuta ŋa yulu. Mo maniima.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Pfumu a nde aleeli huli nde: “We siidi bubwe. Musalili wu mubwe na wu akangama! We li musalili wu buutwala usiila hiitu mu bisiha bya kaluha yi keehe. Ni mu buuna, me tsa pa we bi byafulala kaluha. Yaanga, yaaba mu kinya na me.”<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Hu mbisa, musalili wu abahi kama li makuta ma wolo ayasusaha. Nde aleeli: “Pfumu, me amba anzaaba ti we li muutu nga likondonakaali. We ubaatsoonzehe hu we avelekuna. We ubaakuukaha hu we avelenyaanza muhunu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Ni mu buuna, me amoni boomo na me anzandiiha mbongo a we hutso a toto. Mono mbongo a we yo yiniiyi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Pfumu a nde afutili nde: “Musalili wu mubi, nga bubolo! We ayaaba ti, me umbaatsonzehe hu me avelenyaanza, na me umbaakuukaha hu me avelekuna tso iloho imosi? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />We akiisuusa mbongo a me hutso a nzo iswehili hya mbongo. Hu mbisa a nziili a me, me akiipolo yo na kaluha ŋa yulu.<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Buuna, patulaani nde kama li makuta ma wolo, na vaani mo huli nga iveeve hi makuta. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Ni mu buuna, muutu wu li na isiha, buubweva nde bi byafulala. Ka huli wu avele na isiha, buumaasa nde tso hi nde ali na hyo. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Ka uto ti musalili mo wunuuwu wu avele na tsoongo, bwahaani nde hutso a piipidi ya hu mbadi, hu huli bililu na kwetili a miinyu.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Tsundusu ya tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Yisu abweleele: «Ŋa Mwana a Muutu huuya hutso muyusu a nde na bapofi boosi, nde sa atsahala ŋa kiti a nde yi ipfumu yi muyusu. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Baatu boosi ba ŋa toto sa bakuukama ŋa busu bwa nde. Nde sa atahula baatu ŋa hati la bo, we bu mukeelisi biboodi ubaatahula mandombo na bataba. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Nde sa asuusa mandombo hu mbahala a nde, na bataba hu kaasu a nde.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Buuna mutumi sa aleele huli ba buuba hu mbahala a nde: “Yaani, benu ba Taata a me haasyeme. Byalilaani mukobe wu Ipfumu hi mayulu hi baamiivangimasa mu benu umata pangili a tsi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Mu tooni ati, me ambeedi na nzala, na benu laaviidi me byudya. Me ambeedi na peyu a mamba, na benu laaviidi me mamba ma unywa. Me ambeedi mwenyi, na benu laayaki me. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Me ambeedi pene, na benu laalwatisi me. Me ambeedi na ubeele, na benu laataasili me. Me ambeedi mutso a kondaayi, na benu laayamono me.”<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Ni mu buuna, baatu ba baasiidi litondo la Nzambi sa bafutala nde: “Pfumu, ki taangu bisu laamoni we na nzala, na laaviidi we byudya; buuve we aba na peyu a mamba, na laaviidi we mamba ma unywa? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Ki taangu bisu laamoni we mwenyi, na laayaki we huli bisu; buuve we aba pene, na bisu laalwatisi we bikutu? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Ki taangu bisu laamoni we mubeedu, buuve mu kondaayi, na bisu laataasili we?”<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Na Mutumi sa afutala bo: “Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, pasi taangu yi benu laasiidi buuna, huli mumosi mu baana ba ngu a me wu afulala bukenyi, ni huli me benu laasiidi buuna.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />Titswene, nde sa aleele huli ba buuba hu kaasu a nde: “Matilaani me, benu ba Nzambi haamiisinga! Yenaani hu mbaahu yi bilima na bilima yi baamiivangimasa mu Mukuyi na bapofi ba nde! <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Mu tooni ati, me ambeedi na nzala, na benu a laaviidi me byudya ve. Me ambeedi na peyu a mamba, na benu a laaviidi me mamba ma unywa ve. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Me ambeedi mwenyi, na benu a laayaki me ve. Me ambeedi pene, na benu a laalwatisi me ve. Me ambeedi mubeedu na mu kondaayi, na benu a laataasili me ve.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Buuna, bo sa bafutala nde: “Pfumu, ki taangu bisu laamoni we na nzala, buuve na peyu a mamba, mwenyi, buuve pene, buuve na bubeedu, buuve mu kondaayi, na bisu a laakumbisi we ve?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Na nde sa afutala huli bo: “Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, pasi taangu yi benu laavelisa buuna huli mumosi mu baana ba ngu a me wu afulala bukenyi, ni huli me benu laavelisa buuna.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ni buuna, bo sa bayene hu tsyembili yi bilima na bilima. Ka baatu ba baasungama, sa bayene hu moonyi wu bilima na bilima<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Bakuutu ba Bayudaayo bali mu ukuta pfuundu mu Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mlk 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yow 11.45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Bu Yisu haamani uva mandongisili mo maana moosi, nde aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Benu liyaabi ti bilumbu byole bimiisaala, mu usa mukungi a Paake<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Pal 12.1-27</ref></char></note>. Sa bayeholo Mwana a Muutu, mana bakomene nde ŋa kuruwa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Buuna, bakuutu ba bangu ba bangaanga na bakuutu ba Bayudaayo, baakuukimi hu litandala li mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi watsomi, Kayifa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Bo baakuti pfuundu mu ukaanga Yisu mu tswehi, mana baduba nde. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Ka bo balelisini: «A luukaangaani nde mu taangu mukungi ve, kini baatu buutuumbaha.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaasu miipuupala nyafi mu mutswe a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mlk 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yow 12.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Yisu aba hu musyenge a Betanya, mu nzo a Simoni nga bwatsi. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Bu Yisu haaba haatsahala ŋa metse, mukaasu mumosi ayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde na itutu hya alabatere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">alabatere </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manya li mulingu li baakavangila bitutu byusyeholo nyafi.</char></note> hi hyaluula mu nyafi ya kaluha yinene. Nde apuupili nyafi mo yiina ŋa yulu mutswe a Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Bu bayihi baamoni buuna, bo baamoni pasi mu mutima, na baaleeli: «Ki tooni mu ubiiyasa nyafi mo yiniiyi? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Bakiisuumbasa yo mu talu yi yaafulala na uva mbongo mo yiina huli bapuumbu!» <verse eid="MAT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Bu Yisu haayuhi nzambilili a bo, nde aleeli: «Nyahaani nde. Mu hima benu lili mu ukwamisa mukaasu mo wunuuwu? Ma nde amiivangila mu me, maafulala bubwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Mu tooni ati, benu luuba na bapuumbu taangu yoosi, ka uto ti me, benu a luuba na me taangu yoosi ve. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Nde miiteehele upuupala nyutu a me nyafi, mu uvangimasa yo mu kotili ya mu ngila. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Mu mbuli me ndeele benu: pasi tsyelo yi buukaayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe mu toto yoosi, buukaayambila mu mukaasu mo wunuuwu na buukaayibuhala moonyi mu ma nde amiivaanga.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda miivolo kesili yi usuumbasa Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mlk 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-23">Luk 22.7-23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1Ko 11.23-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Buuna, Yuda Isikaryoti mumosi mu bakuumi na boole li bayihi, ayamono bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />Na nde aleeli huli bo: «Benu hima luuva me, tso me tsuumbisi benu Yisu?» Bo baataangi maku matatu ma mbongo a palata, na baaviidi nde mo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zak 11.12</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Umata taangu mo yiina, Yuda akasaha buni nde huuyeholo bo Yisu mu taangu yi yaafwana.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayihi ba Yisu bamiivangimasa ilaambu hya Paake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mlk 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22.7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yow 13.21-30</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-26">1Ko 11.23-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Ilumbu hyatsomi hi mukungi wu mapa ma maaveledaana, bayihi baafuuli Yisu: «Huni we toondi ti bisu liyavangimasa we ilaambu hya Paake?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Nde afutili bo: «Yenaani hu musyenge, huli bahala limosi, na leelaani lo ti mulongisi miileele: “Tangu a me yimiikuha, ni huli we me undya ilaambu hya Paake na bayihi ba me.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Bayihi baasiidi bu Yisu haatumisi bo, na bo baavangimisi ilaambu hya Paake.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiyabisa ti muyihi mumosi usuumbasa nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:17-26">Mlk 14.17-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luk 22.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yow 13.21-30</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Bu tsitsaha yaatoodi, Yisu atsahili ŋa meetse na bayihi bakuumi na boole. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Bu bo baakadya, Yisu aleeli: «Mu mbuli me ndeele benu: mumosi mu benu sa asuumbasa me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Bayihi baasinzimono lingebe, na baabaandihi ufuula nde mumosi mumosi: «Pfumu! Ni me?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yisu afutili: «Nde wuuna wu li mu upfuuta myoho mu ikoombe na me, ni nde usuumbasa me. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Eye, Mwana a muutu mu ukwa ali, we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uyabisa mu nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2-19">Mkg 22.2-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53">Esa 53</ref></char></note>. Ka ki pila lingebe huli wu li mu usuumbasa Mwana a muutu! Beedi kini bubwe mu muutu mo wuuna, avelebutama hwa nde.» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda wu akasuumbasa nde ni uleele: «Rabi! Ni me?» Yisu afutili nde: «We miileele lo.»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilaambu hya Ngidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mlk 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Bu bo baaba mu udya, Yisu avoli lipa. Hu mbisa ufutala matondo huli Nzambi, nde atabuli lo, na aviidi lo huli bayihi ba nde na aleeli: «Volwaani na dyaani, yiniiyi ni nyutu a me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Titswene, nde avoli mbuungu ya vinye. Hu mbisa ufutala matondo huli Nzambi, nde aviidi bo yo, na aleeli: «Nywaani yo benu boosi, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />mu tooni ati, maniima ni makila ma me, makila ma nzuhisini a Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Pal 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yel 31.31-34</ref> </char></note>. Makila ma maatsamuhi mu tooni a baatu ba balahi, mu tooni a kolo-kolo yi masumu ma bo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Me ndeele benu lo, Me a umbwenywa vinye mo yiiniyi ve, natee ilumbu hi me unywa yo yi nyatihi na benu, hu Ipfumu hya Taata a me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Hu mbisa uyimba nyimbu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nyimbu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili ti: Mikuunga mya Davidi 113 natee 118.</char></note>, bo baayeni hu isyelo hi miti mya Olive.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisu miyabisa ti Peetelo utuna nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mlk 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yow 13.36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Buuna Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Ndulu ni butsuhu mo bunuubu benu boosi luutimba me. Mu tooni ati, Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mu baaleele: “Me tsa nduba keedi wu biboodi, na koonge mandombo sa yitsaamuha pasi tsyelo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zak 13.7</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Ka hu mbisa a tsuuhili a me mu babaakwa, me uteehele benu hu Ngalili.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Peetelo aleeli nde: «Tso bakima baana boosi batiimbi we, me a utiimba we ve.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yisu akaali nde: «Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele we: ndulu butsuhu mo bunuubu, teehele tsusu akohele, we utuna me tunala tatu.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Ka Peetelo aleeli: «Tso hili ti me kwa itwadi na we, ubila ve, me utwala utuna we ve!» Na bayihi boosi baakaleele bumosi.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiyasambila hu Ngetesemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mlk 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yisu ayidi na bayihi ba nde ŋa mbuha yi bubaateele Ngetesemani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngetesemani </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili mu ndaha ya bisu Arameni ti: ipinyili hya maadi.</char></note>, na nde aleeli huli bo: «Tsahalaani ŋaniiŋa, bu me ka mu dwe huuna mu uyasambila.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Titswene, nde avoli Peetelo na baana ba babahala baboole ba Zebedayi, nde abaandihi umono lingebe na mangoongo.<verse eid="MAT 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Buuna, nde aleeli bo: «Mutima a me amiiluula mu lingebe mu uto natee hu ukwa. Saalaani ŋaniiŋa, na baani likanda itwadi na me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Nde ayeni mwana a lala, atsokihi hiinzi mu toto, na asambili bunuubu: «Taata a me, tso huyelimini, tahusa mbuungu yi mapasi yiniiyi lala na me. A we bu hu li litondo la me ve, ka we bu we toondi.» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Titswene, nde ayafutaha huli bayihi babatatu, ba nde haabiisi tolo. Nde aleeli huli Peetelo: «Benu kaahu a litwali uba likanda na me tso mu ngunga mosi ve? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Baani likanda na sambilaani, mana benu a libwa mu lobese. Iluunzi hili hi hyahwada, ka imuutu hili hi hyakolo.» <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Nde abwetahuha na bo, tahuha la yoole na asambili bunuubu: «Taata a me, tso huyelimini ti mbuungu mo yiniiyi yitahuha na me, hwavele ti me nywa yo, nyaha litondo la we livangama!» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Nde abweyafutaha huli bayihi, na abiisi bo boosi tolo. Miisu ma bo maabeedi maaleme. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Nde abwesiisa bo, abwetahuha na bo na abwesambila sambila li matatu na ubaafutahala mambu ni mo mamosi. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Titswene, nde abweyafutaha huli bayihi ba nde na aleeli bo: «Benu likini tolo, benu uvuuma libaavuuma? Bunuubu, ngunga yimiito. Mwana a Muutu bamiiyeholo ŋa myoho mya banga masumu. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Telemaani, tswendaani! Monwaani muutu wu uyeholo me aka bebele!»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiikaanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mlk 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yow 18.3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Bu Yisu haaba kini mu utoyo, Yuda, mumosi mu bakuumi na boole li bayihi, ayato. Ŋa mbisa a nde, hwaaba na koonge a baatu baakaanga basabila na bimbondi. Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na mikukunyungu mya buli li Bayudaayo, ni ba baatsindihi bo. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Yuda, wu akayeholo bo Yisu, amweesi bo iliimbu hi nde huusalila: «Muutu wu me upiva, ni nde. Kaangaani nde.» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Masulubete, Yuda ayasusaha ŋa pedu a Yisu na aleeli nde: «Bwehe, Rabi!» Titswene, nde avivi nde. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mbaahi a me, li we miiyaavaanga, vaanga lo mu mawasa.» Buuna, bana baayasusaha, baabwidi mu Yisu na baakaangi nde. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Mumosi mu ba baabeedi na Yisu, apalisi sabila a nde mu isupu, ateti musalili wu mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, na akesi nde tswi.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Buuna Yisu aleeli nde: «Futala sabila a we hutso isupu hya nde. Ka boosi ba bubaasalila sabila, buukwa mu sabila. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />We kaahu a hayaabi ve ti me utwala uvondo likumbasa huli Taata a me, na masulubete, nde utsindaha me bapofi ba balahi ba baalutahala makonge kuumi na moole ma balwani? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Ka buni, Mabasonehe ma Ngidi muutwala uyelemene? Mo mali mu uleele ti, ni buuna maafwana uvangama.» <verse eid="MAT 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Titswene, Yisu aleeli huli koonge a baatu: «Me kaahu ipuumbulu mbeedi, bu benu luuya na basabila na bimbondi mu uyakaanga me? Bilumbu byosi, me mbeedi atsahala mu nzo a Nzambi mu ubaalongese, benu a laakaangi me ve. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Ka maana moosi mali mu uvangama, mana mambu ma mimbihuli ma mali mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, mayelemene.» Buuna, bayihi boosi baatiimbi nde na baabati.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ŋa busu bwa pfuundu lituma li Bayudaayo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mlk 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yow 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ba baakaangi Yisu, baabiti nde huli Kayifa mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, hu milongisi mi Mikele na mikukunyungu baaba baakuukama. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Peetelo akaduukala Yisu hu lilalala, natee hu litandala la nzo a mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi. Nde akoti hu litandala na atsahili itwadi na bakeedi, mu umono buni musamu haakisuka.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na pfuundu lituma yoosi, baakasaha imbangi, tso hi mapfuta mu Yisu, mu uva nde tsyembili yi lipfu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Ka bo a baabahi imbangi ve, tso bu baatu ba balahi baatiidi bimbangi bi mapfuta mu nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:12">Mkg 27.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:11">35.11</ref></char></note>. Ka hu tsyelele, babahala boole baayamonehele <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />na baaleeli: «Muutu mo wunuunu aleeli: “Me utwala utsala nzo a Nzambi na ubwetuunga yo mu bilumbu bitatu.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Buuna, mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi atelimi na afuuli Yisu: «We a hali mu ukaala pasi lo ve? Lima we leeli, mu bimbangi bi baatu mo baniiba bali mu uta mu we?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Ka Yisu abeedi swii. Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi abwefuula nde: «Me pondi huli we mu ulaba mulabu mu nduhi a Nzambi a moonyi: We ni Masiya, Mwana a Nzambi?» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yisu akaali: «We mwakulu miileele lo! Ka me ndeele benu lo: Bunuubu, benu luumono Mwana a muutu atsahala ŋa mbahala a Pungu Matwala na uya hutso mayidu ma yulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Mkg 110.1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Buuna mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi akasuli bikutu bya nde mwakulu na aleeli: «Nde miibaaya Nzambi. Bisu a lisaali na nzala bambangi ve! Benu limiiyuha nde mu utuha Nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Benu buni lili mu utsima?» Bo baakaali: «Nde li na tooni, na baafwana uduba nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.66 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Titswene, bo baatuuli nde maate mu mbalanga na baateti nde makome. Bamosi baateti nde mapali<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Esa 50.6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />na ubaaleele: «Bihula, we wu li Kristo, leele bisu na miitete we!»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miituna Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mlk 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yow 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Peetelo aba atsahala hu mbadi ŋa litandala. Musalili mumosi wu mukaasu ayidi ŋa pedu a nde na aleeli nde: «We kaka, we beedi na Yisu musi Ngalili.» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Ka Peetelo atuni ŋa kuungi la baatu na aleeli: «Me a hanzaabi li we li mu ukana uleele ve.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Titswene nde ayeni hu tsyelo munywa a litandala. Musalili mukima wu mukaasu amoni nde na aleeli huli ba baaba ŋaana: «Nde wunuuwu beedi itwadi na Yisu musi Nazareti.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Na Peetelo abwetuna mu mulabu na aleeli: «Me a hanzaabi hwa me muutu mo wunuuwu ve.»<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Hu mbisa a mwana a taangu hoole, baatu ba baabeedi ŋaana baayasusaha ŋa pedu a Peetelo na baaleeli nde: «Ni mbuli, we li mumosi mu baatu mo baana, mu tooni ati bitoyili bya we bili mu umweese huni we amata.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Buuna Peetelo ufulihi: «Nyaha Nzambi asyembe me tso me ndi mu upfuta! Mu mbuli a Nzambi, me a hanzaabi muutu mo wunuuwu ve!» Masulubete, tsusu akohili, <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />na Peetelo ayibuhili moonyi mu mambu ma Yisu haaleeli nde: «Tswamina tsusu akohele, we utuna me tunala tatu.» Peetelo apali na atudili nzwenge.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiibita huli Pilaato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mlk 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yow 18.28-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Ŋa tsumba a ngwali, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi boosi na mikukunyungu mya buli li Bayudaayo, baakutili Yisu pfuundu mu uduba nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Bu baatumi uhwenye nde mikudu, bo baabiti nde na baayehuli nde huli Pilaato, pfumu itaanzi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Mav 1.18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Buuna, Yuda wu ayehuli nde, ayuha ti Yisu miiyaka tsyembili yi lipfu, anyongi na ayafutala maku matatu ma makuta ma mbongo ma nde haavoli, huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na huli mikukunyungu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Nde aleeli huli bo: «Me miitsa lisumu mu uyeholo muutu wu avele na tooni!» Ka bo baafutili nde: «Maana a matali bisu ve! Liina dyambu la we!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Titswene, Yuda abumi mbongo mu nzo a Nzambi, ayeni na ayaleleme.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baatoli mbongo na baaleeli: «Mukele a bisu a hali mu uva bisu muswa mu usuusa mbongo mo yiina mutso iswehili hya mu nzo a Nzambi ve. Mu tooni ati, yo yili kaluha yi makila<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kaluha yi makila </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbongo yi bubaabaha mu uduba muutu.</char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Hu mbisa uyuhasana mu mbongo mo yiina, bo baasuumbi ngundu yi muyuhi madiiha, mu usa mapeembe ma byenyi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zak 11.12-13</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ni mu buuna, bali mu uteele ngundu mo yiina natee lolo yiniiyi, «ngundu yi makila». <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Buuna, ma mumbihuli Yelemiya haayabisi maayelimini: «Bo baavoli maku matatu ma makuta ma mbongo. Liina ni lifunu li baana ba Isereli baakesi mu nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />Na baasalili yo mu usuumba ngundu yi muyuhi madiiha, we bu Pfumu haatumi me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 18:2-3">Yel 18.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-2">19.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-15">32.6-15</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilaato miiva byuhu huli Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mlk 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yow 18.33-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Baabiti Yisu ŋa busu bwa pfumu itaanzi, wu aviidi nde byuhu: «We ni mutumi Bayudaayo?» Yisu afutili: «We miileele lo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Titswene, ŋa bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na mikukunyungu baakesi nde mu matooni ma malahi, nde a haafutili dyambu ve. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Buuna, Pilaato abwefuula nde: «We a hafutili isiha ve? We li mu uyuha matooni moosi ma bali mu ukese we?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Ka Yisu a haafutili nde mvutu tso mosi ve. Ni mu buuna, pfumu itaanzi haakimuhi.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiyaka tsyembili yi lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mlk 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yow 18.39–19.16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Mu pasi mukungi a Paake, pfumu akanyahula ikondaayi imosi, hi koonge yaakavondo. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Kaahu, hwaaba na bahala limosi li laaba laayabahana, nduhi [Yisu] Barabasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">[Yisu] Barabasi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mihanda mikima myavusahana nduhi ya </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yisu.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Buuna, Pilaato afuuli huli koonge a baatu: «Na benu litoondi ti me nyahulala benu, [Yisu] Barabasi vo ti Yisu wu bubaateele Masiya?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilaato aba ayaaba bubwe-bubwe ti bo baayehuli nde Yisu, mu nyengi. <verse eid="MAT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Bu Pilaato haaba haatsahala mu nzo a tsundusu, mukadi a nde atsindihi nde iluumbi mu uleele: «A haakoto mu dyambu la bahala mo liniili li laasungama. Mu tooni ati, butsuhu mo bunuubu me moni pasi yindahi mu ndoosi mu tooni a nde.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na mikukunyungu, baatumbisi koonge a baatu mu uvondo linyahula la Barabasi na ndubili a Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pfumu itaanzi abwefuula bo ti: «Na, mu bo baboole benu litoondi ti me nyahula?» Bo baafutili: «Barabasi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilaato aleeli bo: «Ka hima me utsa mu Yisu wu bali mu uteele Masiya?» Bo boosi baafutili: «Komene nde ŋa kuruwa!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilaato afuuli: «Ka ki dyambu lilibi nde haasa?» Na bo baabwesinzafulaha: «Komene nde ŋa kuruwa!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Bu Pilaato haamoni ti nde a huubwetwala usa pasi isiha ve, na bu muyungu haafulili, nde avoli mamba, aswaahi myoho mya nde ŋa busu bwa koonge a baatu. Nde aleeli: «Lipfu la muutu mo wunuuwu a lili mu utala me ve! Lo lili dyambu la benu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Koonge yoosi yaafutili: «Nyaha pepo yi lipfu la nde yibwa ŋa yulu a bisu, na ŋa yulu a baana ba bisu!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Buuna Pilaato anyahuli bo Barabasi. Nde amana utuma ufwinza Yisu bikooti, nde ayehuli nde mana bayakomene nde ŋa kuruwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masadaadu mali mu ukwede Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mlk 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yow 19.2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Masadaadu ma pfumu itaanzi maabiti Yisu hu ibaanga hya nde. Mo moosi maadiingi Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Mo maaduuli nde bikutu, na maalwatisi nde libita li libeenge. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Titswene, mo maavaangi ibudu hi matsyende, hi mo maasuusi ŋa yulu mutswe a nde. Mo maasuusili nde litsootso ŋa hooho hwa nde hwa mbahala. Hu mbisa, mo maatsokimi ŋa busu bwa nde, na maakakwede nde, na ubaaleele: «Bwehe, mutumi Bayudaayo!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Mo maakatuula nde maate. Mo maakavolo litsootso mo liina na ubaatete nde lo mu mutswe. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Bu mo maamani ukwede nde, mo maaduuli nde libita li libeenge, maalwatisi nde bikutu bya nde. Titswene, maabiti nde mu uyakomene nde ŋa kuruwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiikomene ŋa kuruwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:21-28">Mlk 15.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16-24">Yow 19.16-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Mu palili a mu musyenge, masadaadu maabwani na bahala limosi, musi Kilene, nduhi a nde Simoni. Mo maakwihisi nde kuruwa a Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Mo maatoodi ŋa mbuha yi bubaateele Ngolongota, mbindulili ti: «Mbuha yi Ibanga hi Mutswe». <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Huuna, mo maaviidi Yisu vinye yi baapfuuta na bya kali bahaa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mkg 69.22</ref></char></note>. Yisu abiimbi, ka a haatoondi unywa ve.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Masadaadu maakomini nde ŋa kuruwa, na maakabisini bikutu bya nde hu mbisa uta ngodo mu byo. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Titswene, mo maatsahili ŋaana mu ukeelese nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Ŋa yulu a kuruwa a nde, baabandihi itini hya baya. Mu baya mo liina, mo maasonihi tooni ya tsyembili a nde yiniiyi: «Wunuuwu ni Yisu, mutumi Bayudaayo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Masadaadu maakomini kaka baataani boole ŋa kuruwa ŋa pedu a Yisu: mumosi ŋa mbahala a nde, wuna ŋa kaasu.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Bapyohi-nzila baakatuha nde na ubaanyingasa mitswe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Mkg 22.8</ref></char></note> mya bo. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Bo baakaleele: «We wu utsala nzo a Nzambi na wu ubwetuunga yo mu bilumbu bitatu, yoboho we mwakulu tso we li Mwana a Nzambi, na sutaha mu kuruwa!» <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Bumosi kaka, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, milongisi mi Mikele na mikukunyungu, baakakwede nde na ubaaleele: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Nde afuuhisi baatu bakima, ka nde a huutwala ufuuhasa nde mwakulu ve! Nde ni mutumi Isereli? Buunubu, nde ni asutaha mu kuruwa! Buuna bisu luusa imiinu mu nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Nde amiisa hiitu mu Nzambi, na ubaaleele: “Me ndi Mwana a Nzambi.” Tso Nzambi atondo nde, nyaha nde afuuhasa nde mu taangu mo yiniiyi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:9">Mkg 22.9</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Baataani ba baakomini itwadi na Yisu ŋa kuruwa, baakatuha kaka nde pila mosi.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mlk 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yow 19.28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Umata mwangulu natee ngunga yi matatu ya hu mbisa a mwangulu, piipidi yaabwiidi mu tsi yoosi. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Bebele na ngunga yi matatu ya hu mbisa a mwangulu, Yisu afulihi mu ndaha yi mifudi: «Eli, Eli, lema sabakatani?» Mbindulili ni ti: «Nzambi a me, Nzambi a me, tooni ma we siisi me siha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Mkg 22.2</ref> </char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Bamosi mu ba baabeedi ŋaana, baayuhi nde na baakafulaha: «Nde mumbihuli Eliya ali mu uteele!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Mumosi mu bo ayeni tiinu mu uyavolo mukamuna, abwadihi nde mu vinye a nganyi, akatisi nde ŋa tsoso litsootso. Titswene, nde alabili Yisu mukamuna, mana nde aviva vinye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mkg 69.22</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Ka bakima baaleeli: «Keelaani limonwaani tso Eliya uyaafuuhasa nde!»<verse eid="MAT 27:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yisu abwefulaha ileele hi mifudi, na amani muvumu. <verse eid="MAT 27:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ndulu mu taangu mo yiina, nguumbu ya mbuha ya Ngidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Pal 26.31-33</ref></char></note>, yaakasuhi mu bibadi byole, umata hu yulu natee hu tsina. Toto yaanyingimi, mamanya maapasihi, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />mangila maadibumi, na manyutu ma baatu ba balahi ba baakwiidi, ba baaba baakangama mu Nzambi, maasuuhi mu babaakwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Bo baapali mu mangila, na hu mbisa a tsuuhili a Yisu mu babaakwa, bo baakoti hu Yeruselemi, musyenge a ngidi, hu baatu ba balahi baamoni bo.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Bu masadaadu ma maakakeelese Yisu, na mukuutu a mo baamoni toto mu unyingama na moosi ma maabwiidi, bo baamoni boomo bu bulahi. Bo baaleeli: «Mbuli, wunuuwu beedi Mwana a Nzambi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Bakaasu ba balahi baaba ŋaana na baakatala hu lilalala. Bo baakaduukala Yisu umata hu Ngalili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.55 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">umata hu Ngalili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni ti, umata mbandihili isalu hya Yisu.</char></note>, mu ubaakumbasa nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Ŋa hati la bo, hwaba na Mariya musi Magadala, Mariya ngu wa Yaki na Yosefi, na ngu wa baana ba Zebedayi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyutu a Yisu bamiisuusa mu ngila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mlk 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yow 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Tsitsaha bu yaatoodi, hwayidi isina imosi musi Arimate<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.57 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Arimate </char><char style="ft" closed="false">musyenge wu li bebele na Yeruselemi hu Noode ya Wesete, mu biveve bi mataka maku matatu na bitaanu.</char></note>, nduhi Yosefi. Hyo kaka hyaaba muyihi a Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Hyo hyayamono Pilaato na hyavondi nde nyutu a Yisu. Buuna, Pilaato atumi mu uva nyutu a Yisu huli Yosefi. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Yosefi avoli nyutu ya Yisu, afuungili yo lileeso la liino li linyatihi, <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />na nde asuusi yo mu ngila a nde yi nde haatumisi uvaha hutso a manya li linene. Titswene, nde abungimisi manya likima mu udibuha munywa a ngila, na nde ayeni. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mariya musi Magadala na Mariya makima, baaba ŋaana, baatsahala ŋa masungimini ma ngila.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Keelisili a ngila a Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Mu ilumbu hi hyaduukili pangimini a saba, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na Bafarisi, baayeni mu itwadi huli Pilaato. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Bo baaleeli: «Pfumu, bisu likini mu uyibuhala moonyi ti iyahudi mo hiniihi, ŋa hyo hyabeedi kini moonyi, hyaleeli ti: “Hu mbisa bilumbu bitatu, me tsa tsuuha.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Ni mu buuna, tumasa bayakeelese ngila a nde natee mu ilumbu hi bitatu. Tso a buuna ve, kini bayihi ba nde buuyayiba nyutu a nde na uleele: “Nde miisuuha mu babakwa.” Mapfuta mo maana kini muuvyohelele iteesi na matsomi.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilaato aleeli bo: «Monwaani masadaadu ma muukeelese ngila. Yenaani yakeelesaaani yo we bu hu li matsimi ma benu.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Bo baayeni mu uyavangimasa keelisili a ngila. Bo baasiidi iliimbu mu manya li idibuhu hya ngila, na baasuusi bakeedi.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Tsuuhili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mlk 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yow 20.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Hu mbisa ilumbu hya saba, mu limiingu tsumba a ngwali, Mariya musi Mangadala na Mariya makima, baayidi hu uyatala ngila. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Masulubete, toto yanyingimi mu mifudi. Pofi a Pfumu akulimini umata hu yulu, ayabungamasa manya na atsahili ŋa yulu a lo. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Ifwafwani hya nde hyaba we muvedi-a-vedi, na bikutu bya nde byaba byasinzafuuka. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Bakeedi baatsuli likamba mu boomo. Bo baabeedi baaka we bamvumbi. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Ka pofi atoyi na aleeli huli bakaasu: «A liba na boomo ve. Me nzaabi ti benu Yisu wu baakomini ŋa kuruwa lili mu usaha. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Nde a hali ŋaniiŋa ve, nde miisuuha mu babaakwa we bu nde haaleeli. Yaani, yamonwaani mbuha yi baasuusi nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Na yenaani mawasa yaleelaani bayihi ba nde ti: “Nde miisuuha mu babaakwa na miitswamina benu hu Ngalili. Ni huuna benu luumono nde.” Maana ni ma me miindeele benu.» <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Bo baatahuhi mawasa na ngila na boomo bu bulahi, ka bo baaba na kinya yindahi, mu ubita musamu huli bayihi ba Yisu. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Masulubete, Yisu ayabwana bo, na aleeli: «Bwehe bwa benu!» Bo baayasusaha huli nde, baakaangi miilu mya nde, na baakongimini ŋa busu bwa nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Buuna Yisu aleeli bo: «A liba na boomo ve. Yaleelaani huli baana ba ngu a me mu uyene hu Ngalili. Huuna ni hu bo buumono me.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musamu wu bakeedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Bu bakaasu baaba mu nzila, masadaadu mana ma maakiikeelese ngila, maafutihi hu musyenge, na maaviidi ikuumbu huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, mu moosi ma maavyohi. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baakuukimi na mikukunyungu. Hu mbisa uyuhasana, bo baaviidi mbongo yindahi huli masadaadu <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />na baaleeli mo: «Yayabisaani ti bayihi ba nde bamiiyayiba nyutu a nde hutso butsuhu, ŋa bisu libeedi tolo. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Na tso pfumu itaanzi yuhi lo, bisu luuyaaba ulembesene nde mutima, na umaasa benu mu pasi.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Bakeedi baavoli mbongo na baaduukili makesili ma baaviidi bo. Na musamu mo wuuna atsaamuhi ŋa hati li Bayudaayo natee lolo yiniiyi.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miimonehele huli bayihi ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mlk 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yow 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Mav 1.6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Bayihi bakuumi na mumosi baayeni hu Ngalili, hu yulu isyelo hi Yisu haayabisi bo. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Bu baamoni Yisu, bo baakongimini ŋa busu bwa nde. Bamosi ŋa hati la bo baaba hwabo na paha. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yisu ayasusaha na aleeli huli bo: «Matwala moosi baava huli me, umata hu yulu natee ŋa toto. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Buuna yenaani huli mabuli moosi, na saani mo bayihi ba me. Tondehaani bo mu nduhi a Taata, a Mwana, na yi Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Na longesaani bo mu ubaasalila moosi ma me atuma benu. Na yaabaani liniili: me tsa mba na benu bilumbu byosi, natee hu tsukusu a tsi.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>